window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df16"]={"id": "df16", "title": "DDIM：非马尔可夫过程与确定性采样", "focus": "构造 DDIM 的非马尔可夫前向族，推导其更新公式与 η 参数；证明 η=0 时与概率流 ODE 的离散化一致，分析步数与质量的关系。", "claims": ["x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon", "\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}", "\\eta=0\\Rightarrow\\text{确定性 DDIM；}\\eta=1\\Rightarrow\\text{DDPM}"], "topics": ["非马尔可夫前向", "DDIM 的更新公式", "η 参数", "确定性极限", "与 PF-ODE 的等价", "采样轨迹", "步数与质量", "数值稳定性", "与 DDPM 的关系", "反例：η 选择不当导致分布偏移", "隐式采样", "与一致性模型的接口", "代码：DDIM 采样", "代码：η 对分布的影响", "与 PF-ODE 章的接口", "本章推导链：非马尔可夫的确定性"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df16--h-非马尔可夫前向\">非马尔可夫前向<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-非马尔可夫前向\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第二部已固定的扩散过程符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。数据分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的 Borel 集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步注入的标准高斯噪声，各步独立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t):=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 为后验均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t):=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 为后验噪声均值；在 DDIM 推导中二者由同一得分网络给出，关系在下一节展开。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的“注入噪声尺度”，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 为全局插值参数。本节只定义前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 并证明其边缘与条件结构；更新公式、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的完整语义、确定性极限留给后续节。</p>\n<p>假设 A1（前向边缘正则性）：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，即标准扩散前向边缘。假设 A2（非负与单调）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。假设 A3（噪声尺度约束）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>。假设 A4（可积性）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而所有涉及的高斯条件期望平方可积，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 可用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-定义-非马尔可夫前向族\">定义：非马尔可夫前向族<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-定义-非马尔可夫前向族\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>标准 DDPM 前向是马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，其联合分布完全由一步转移确定。DDIM 的核心观察是：边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 并不唯一决定联合分布；可以构造一族联合分布，它们共享全部边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，但条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，从而破坏马尔可夫性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（非马尔可夫前向族）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 满足 A3，定义联合分布</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\sigma(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\prod_{t=2}^{T}q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),$$</div>\n<p>其中反向条件（从前向索引看是“由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>”）取为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\;\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\;\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是待定尺度，A3 保证根号内非负。注意该条件分布的均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的仿射组合，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 一般不是马尔可夫链：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 这一“未来”信息。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（边缘一致性）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，即定义 1 的联合分布与标准前向共享全部时间边缘。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 由构造成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。由定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\int q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_t.$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。则条件均值写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,u$</span>，条件方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,u+\\sigma_t\\,\\xi,\\qquad \\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)\\ \\text{独立}.$$</div>\n<p>右边是独立高斯之和，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)+\\sigma_t^2]I_d=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d)$</span>。归纳完成。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选择不改变任何时间边缘，只改变联合分布的相依结构。这正是“非马尔可夫”的数学内容——边缘相同而桥不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-与马尔可夫前向的差别\">与马尔可夫前向的差别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与马尔可夫前向的差别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 取 DDPM 值时退化为马尔可夫）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，若取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\beta_t,$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 为马尔可夫链。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> DDPM 的贝叶斯后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\lambda_t(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)$</span>，比较系数得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}?$$</div>\n<p>直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)x_0$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0).$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。另一方面，定义 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。令二者相等并平方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})-\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big[(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)-\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big]$</span>。括号内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-\\bar\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t+\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t=\\beta_t$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 一致。此时条件分布恰为 DDPM 后验，联合分布按链式法则分解为马尔可夫链。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 给出一个关键校准：DDPM 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，而 DDIM 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 是另一端点。两端点共享边缘，故“前向过程的边缘”不足以区分二者；区分它们的是条件桥。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一个可检验的恒等式\">一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（前向桥的方差分解）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\underbrace{\\sigma_t^2}_{\\text{注入}}+\\underbrace{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)}_{\\text{由 }x_t\\text{ 传递}}+\\underbrace{\\text{交叉项}}_{=0}=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 证明中的表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,u+\\sigma_t\\xi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 独立且均为标准高斯。两项系数平方和即方差，交叉项因独立性为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 只是把总方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 在“由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 携带的信息”与“新注入噪声”之间重新分配；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时全部方差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时分配到 DDPM 的比例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-d-1-两步情形的显式计算\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、两步情形的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-d-1-两步情形的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1,\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9,\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9,\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。标准前向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\,\\varepsilon_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\,\\varepsilon_2$</span>。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span>（确定性桥）。定义 1 给</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\sigma(x_1\\mid x_2,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1-\\sigma_2^2}\\ \\frac{x_2-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}},\\ \\sigma_2^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>按公式逐步算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}=\\sqrt{0.9}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_1-\\sigma_2^2=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_2=0.28$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.1/0.28}=\\sqrt{1/2.8}$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1/0.28}\\;\\frac{x_2-\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1}{\\sqrt{0.28}}.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}+\\sqrt{0.28}\\,\\varepsilon_2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}+\\sqrt{0.1/0.28}\\cdot\\varepsilon_2$</span>。与标准前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}+\\sqrt{0.1}\\,\\varepsilon_1$</span> 比较：二者边缘均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.9},0.1)$</span>，但 DDIM 桥把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 的随机性完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_2$</span> 承载，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1$</span> 不再出现。这直观展示“边缘相同、桥不同”。</p>\n<p>数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_2=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}+\\sqrt{0.28}\\approx0.8485+0.5292=1.3777$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}+\\sqrt{0.1/0.28}\\approx0.9487+0.5976=1.5463$</span>。若改用 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2\\approx0.0714$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 系数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.1-0.0714)/0.28\\approx0.102$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 还额外注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2\\xi$</span>，方差回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nnp.random.seed(0)\nd, T = 4, 3\nbetas = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nabar = np.cumprod(alphas)\nx0 = np.ones(d)\n# 标准前向边缘采样\ndef forward_marginal(t, x0, rng):\n    return np.sqrt(abar[t-1])*x0 + np.sqrt(1-abar[t-1])*rng.standard_normal(d)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nx2 = forward_marginal(2, x0, rng)\n# sigma_2 = 0 的桥：由 x2 与 x0 生成 x1\nsigma2 = 0.0\ncoef = np.sqrt(1 - abar[0] - sigma2**2) / np.sqrt(1 - abar[1])\nx1_bridge = np.sqrt(abar[0])*x0 + coef*(x2 - np.sqrt(abar[1])*x0) + sigma2*rng.standard_normal(d)\n# 检查 x1 的边缘均值与方差（多次采样）\nM = 20000\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2)\nxs = []\nfor _ in range(M):\n    xt = forward_marginal(2, x0, rng)\n    xs.append(np.sqrt(abar[0])*x0 + coef*(xt - np.sqrt(abar[1])*x0))\nxs = np.array(xs)\nassert xs.shape == (M, d)\nassert np.allclose(xs.mean(axis=0), np.sqrt(abar[0])*x0, atol=0.02)\nassert np.allclose(xs.var(axis=0), 1-abar[0], atol=0.02)\nprint(&quot;bridge sample shape:&quot;, x1_bridge.shape)\nprint(&quot;empirical mean:&quot;, xs.mean(axis=0))\nprint(&quot;empirical var:&quot;, xs.var(axis=0))\nprint(&quot;expected var:&quot;, 1-abar[0])\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>bridge sample shape: (4,)</code>，经验均值接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.9}\\approx0.9487$</span>，经验方差接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，与命题 1 和推论 3 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-非马尔可夫性的精确含义\">非马尔可夫性的精确含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-非马尔可夫性的精确含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（条件独立性的破坏）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 非退化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\neq q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下不条件独立；等价地，联合分布不满足马尔可夫性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 马尔可夫性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>。对 DDPM，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验混合给出，其均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\mid x_t]$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span>，除非后验退化。对定义 1，条件均值显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 非退化且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 不同，两条件均值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数不同。故条件分布不同，马尔可夫性破坏。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点不是“非马尔可夫”这个标签，而是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 的桥依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 在采样时未知，只能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 替代。这一替代的误差正是后续节讨论更新公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-桥的得分表示与后验均值替代\">桥的得分表示与后验均值替代<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-桥的得分表示与后验均值替代\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 指出桥依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，但采样时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 未知。为了把定义 1 变成可执行的更新，必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的可测函数替代。本节只建立这一替代的代数恒等式；替代误差的传播与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的完整语义留给后续节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（桥均值的两种等价参数化）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则定义 1 的条件均值可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\;u_t,$$</div>\n<p>并且对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，有恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\;\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，且二者满足线性约束</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)=x_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由定义 1 直接读出。第二式不是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 成立，而是对“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为条件、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为权”的期望成立。对第一式两边取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\cdot\\mid x_t]$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\hat x_0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的仿射函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[u_t\\mid x_t]=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。线性约束由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的定义式取条件期望直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的关键在于：它把“桥依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>”改写为“桥依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>”，而后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数。这正是 DDIM 更新公式能够只依赖当前样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与网络输出的原因。注意这里没有断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,x_0)=\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span> 对每个样本成立——那将把条件期望误当成逐点等式；命题 5 只断言在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 下的期望相等。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时的桥是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_0(x_t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\;\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\delta_{\\mu_0(x_t)}$</span>，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 退化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时定义 1 的条件方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot I_d$</span>，故条件分布为点质量，位置由命题 5 的均值给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 已由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 替代。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 是“确定性采样”的代数内容：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 把随机桥压成点质量，采样轨迹由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 迭代给出，不含新噪声。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的语义在下一节正式对接；本节只确认 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 使条件桥退化，而边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 仍由命题 1 保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d)$</span>。两者不矛盾：边缘的随机性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的随机性，而非桥自身的注入噪声。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-边缘与桥的联合一致性检验\">边缘与桥的联合一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-边缘与桥的联合一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只断言每个时间边缘与标准前向一致，但没有断言联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与标准马尔可夫联合分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge3$</span> 时一致。事实上二者一般不同，这正是“非马尔可夫”的实质。下面的命题把这一差别精确化为一个可计算的协方差恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（相邻两步的协方差）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\;\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\;I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,u_t+\\sigma_t\\xi$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 独立。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}(u_t,x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(u_t,x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Cov}\\big((x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},x_t\\big)=\\mathrm{Var}(x_t\\mid x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,I_d$</span>。相乘即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 给出一个直接可检验的推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 越大，相邻两步的条件协方差越小；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 时协方差为零，桥完全“切断”了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性关联（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与新噪声决定）。而 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 给出一个中间值。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不仅是噪声尺度，也是相邻时间步线性相关强度的调节量。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的可行区间端点）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\in[0,1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}]$</span> 的两个端点分别对应：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=0:\\ \\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,I_d,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}:\\ \\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将两端点代入命题 7 的公式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8 说明 A3 的上界不是任意的：它恰好是使桥方差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 边缘方差、从而协方差归零的临界值。超过该值根号内为负，定义 1 失效；这正是 A3 必须写进假设的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-三步链上的协方差数值\">具体例子：三步链上的协方差数值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-三步链上的协方差数值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=(0.1,0.2,0.3)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=(0.9,0.72,0.504)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span> 时命题 7 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=\\sqrt{(1-0.9)(1-0.72)}=\\sqrt{0.1\\cdot0.28}=\\sqrt{0.028}\\approx0.1673$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=\\sqrt{(1-0.72)(1-0.504)}=\\sqrt{0.28\\cdot0.496}=\\sqrt{0.13888}\\approx0.3727$</span>。DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\tilde\\beta_2=0.1/0.28\\cdot0.2\\approx0.0714$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=\\sqrt{0.1-0.0714}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.28}=\\sqrt{0.0286}\\cdot0.5292\\approx0.0895$</span>。可见 DDPM 的相邻协方差约为 DDIM（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span>）的一半。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nbetas = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nabar = np.cumprod(1.0 - betas)\ndef cov_formula(t, sigma2):\n    # t 为 1-based 索引，返回 Cov(x_{t-1}, x_t | x0) 的标量系数\n    return np.sqrt(1 - abar[t-2] - sigma2) * np.sqrt(1 - abar[t-1])\nassert np.isclose(cov_formula(2, 0.0), np.sqrt(0.1*0.28))\nassert np.isclose(cov_formula(3, 0.0), np.sqrt(0.28*0.496))\nsigma2_ddpm = (1 - abar[0]) / (1 - abar[1]) * betas[1]\nassert np.isclose(sigma2_ddpm, 0.1/0.28*0.2)\nassert np.isclose(cov_formula(2, sigma2_ddpm), np.sqrt(0.1 - sigma2_ddpm)*np.sqrt(0.28))\n# 端点检验：sigma2 = 1 - abar[t-2] 时协方差为零\nassert np.isclose(cov_formula(2, 1 - abar[0]), 0.0)\nprint(&quot;cov DDIM t=2:&quot;, cov_formula(2, 0.0))\nprint(&quot;cov DDPM t=2:&quot;, cov_formula(2, sigma2_ddpm))\nprint(&quot;cov DDIM t=3:&quot;, cov_formula(3, 0.0))\nprint(&quot;sigma2_ddpm:&quot;, sigma2_ddpm)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>cov DDIM t=2: 0.167332...</code>，<code>cov DDPM t=2: 0.0895...</code>，<code>cov DDIM t=3: 0.37268...</code>，<code>sigma2_ddpm: 0.071428...</code>，与手算一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-前向族的信息几何解释\">前向族的信息几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-前向族的信息几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1 的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 可以看作在固定边缘约束下对联合分布做的一维插值。把每个时间步的边缘分布视为固定，联合分布的集合是一个仿射族；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是该族的一个坐标。下面的命题说明这一坐标与条件分布的 Fisher 信息有单调关系，从而为后续“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移”的反例节提供定量抓手。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（条件 Fisher 信息对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\sigma,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 关于位置参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma$</span> 的 Fisher 信息为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}I_d$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 严格递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 高斯位置族的 Fisher 信息为协方差逆，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{-2}I_d$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\sigma_t^{-3}I_d\\prec0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的用途是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时条件桥对均值误差的敏感度发散，这意味着在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的估计误差会被放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 上。这正是确定性采样在少步数下对网络精度要求更高的原因；定量分析留给“步数与质量”与“数值稳定性”两节，本节只登记这一单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-桥的-KL-分解与-sigma_t-的变分刻画\">桥的 KL 分解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-桥的-KL-分解与-sigma_t-的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 9 只给出条件桥的局部敏感度。为了把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选择与联合分布的整体差异联系起来，需要一个可加性的散度恒等式。下面的命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 与 DDPM 联合分布之间的 KL 散度精确分解为各步条件桥的 KL 之和，从而说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是逐时间步可分离的变分坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（KL 的链式分解）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}$</span> 为命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的马尔可夫联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 为定义 1 的联合分布。若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 均绝对连续（由命题 1 二者同为高斯，成立），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q_\\sigma(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big)=\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\,\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由链式法则，对任意两个联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathbb E_{p(x_{1:t-1})}\\,\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p(x_t\\mid x_{1:t-1})\\,\\|\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{1:t-1})\\big)+\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p(x_1)\\|q(x_1)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q_\\sigma$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}$</span>。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_1\\mid x_0)=q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span>，故首项 KL 为零。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}$</span> 是马尔可夫链，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>（贝叶斯后验，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关的马尔可夫结构在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时仍显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 作为条件，但形式固定）；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_{1:t-2},x_t,x_0)=q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由定义 1 的构造直接成立。于是链式法则中每一步的条件 KL 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:t-2}$</span> 的期望退化。交换求和与期望用 Fubini，其可积性由 A4 与高斯 KL 的闭式（二次型加对数项，均平方可积）保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的价值在于：它把“选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>”从联合分布的高维比较降为逐时间步的一维比较。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 只影响第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的最优选择可逐点求解。这为后续“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数”节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\cdot\\tilde\\sigma_t$</span> 的全局插值解释为逐项 KL 的加权和提供了结构。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 11（单步 KL 的闭式）</strong> 在命题 10 的条件下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，两个条件高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\sigma,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}=\\mathcal N(\\mu_{\\mathrm{ddpm}},\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span> 的 KL 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q_\\sigma\\|q_{\\mathrm{ddpm}})=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big[d\\,\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}-d+d\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}+\\frac{\\|\\mu_\\sigma-\\mu_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}\\|^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时第一、三项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0^+$</span> 的极限理解，此时 KL 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯的 KL 闭式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}^{-1}\\Sigma_\\sigma)-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}/\\det\\Sigma_\\sigma+(\\mu_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}-\\mu_\\sigma)^\\top\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}^{-1}(\\mu_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}-\\mu_\\sigma)]$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\sigma=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{ddpm}}=\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2)\\to+\\infty$</span>，故发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 11 揭示一个必须正视的事实：若以 DDPM 联合分布为参照，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 的 KL 发散。这不是说 DDIM 错了，而是说“以 DDPM 为参照度量 DDIM”不是合适的变分框架——DDIM 的目标分布是数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，不是 DDPM 的联合分布。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选择不能由“最小化到 DDPM 的 KL”决定，而应由“匹配边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>”与“控制桥的注入噪声”共同决定。这一区分是后续“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数”节必须显式写出的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-桥均值的偏差传播恒等式\">桥均值的偏差传播恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-桥均值的偏差传播恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 时没有量化替代误差。下面的命题给出误差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma$</span> 的精确线性传播，这是后续“数值稳定性”节分析少步数误差放大的代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（均值误差的线性传播）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为任意可测估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由线性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 确定。记真实后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^\\star=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e=\\hat x_0-\\hat x_0^\\star$</span>。则桥均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span> 与命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,\\hat x_0^\\star)$</span> 之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,\\hat x_0)-\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,\\hat x_0^\\star)=\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\,e.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 线性，系数即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。两式相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时误差系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的化简）</strong> 在命题 12 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，误差系数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\kappa_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的相对大小决定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（步长趋零）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 得第一式。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t+\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 13 说明：在连续时间极限（步长趋零）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的估计误差对单步桥均值的影响消失；但在少步数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 差距大）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 非零，误差被保留并累积。这正是“步数与质量”节要定量化的对象，本节只登记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-误差系数与步长的数值关系\">具体例子：误差系数与步长的数值关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-误差系数与步长的数值关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=(0.1,0.2,0.3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=(0.9,0.72,0.504)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2=\\sqrt{0.9}-\\sqrt{0.72}\\sqrt{0.1/0.28}\\approx0.9487-0.8485\\cdot0.5976\\approx0.9487-0.5071=0.4416$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_3=\\sqrt{0.72}-\\sqrt{0.504}\\sqrt{0.28/0.496}\\approx0.8485-0.7099\\cdot0.7513\\approx0.8485-0.5333=0.3152$</span>。可见步长较大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 显著非零，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 间隔变小）而减小。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nbetas = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nabar = np.cumprod(1.0 - betas)\ndef kappa(t):\n    # t 为 1-based，返回 sigma_t=0 时的误差系数\n    return np.sqrt(abar[t-2]) - np.sqrt(abar[t-1]) * np.sqrt((1 - abar[t-2]) / (1 - abar[t-1]))\nassert np.isclose(kappa(2), np.sqrt(0.9) - np.sqrt(0.72)*np.sqrt(0.1/0.28))\nassert np.isclose(kappa(3), np.sqrt(0.72) - np.sqrt(0.504)*np.sqrt(0.28/0.496))\n# 步长趋零的极限：构造更细的 beta 序列\nfine_betas = np.full(1000, 0.001)\nfine_abar = np.cumprod(1.0 - fine_betas)\nassert abs(kappa_fine := np.sqrt(fine_abar[500]) - np.sqrt(fine_abar[501])*np.sqrt((1-fine_abar[500])/(1-fine_abar[501]))) &lt; 1e-3\nprint(&quot;kappa_2:&quot;, kappa(2))\nprint(&quot;kappa_3:&quot;, kappa(3))\nprint(&quot;kappa_fine (step 0.001):&quot;, kappa_fine)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>kappa_2: 0.4416...</code>，<code>kappa_3: 0.3152...</code>，<code>kappa_fine (step 0.001): &lt; 1e-3</code>，与手算及推论 13 的极限断言一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-前向族的可逆性与得分恒等式\">前向族的可逆性与得分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-前向族的可逆性与得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 1 的桥是“由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>”，方向与前向相反。为了把它与得分动力学对接，需要一个把桥的均值写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的恒等式。下面的命题给出这一恒等式，它是后续“与 PF-ODE 的等价”节的代数接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（桥均值的得分表示）</strong> 在 A1–A4 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0-\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2\\big)\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}?$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\sigma(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\;\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\;\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。而高斯得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 14 的意义是：桥均值可以写成“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的缩放”减去“得分乘以一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 有关的系数”。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，这正是概率流 ODE 离散化中得分项的系数。后续“与 PF-ODE 的等价”节将证明：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>、把得分替换为网络输出后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 的迭代恰是 PF-ODE 的一阶离散化。本节只建立这一代数恒等式，不做等价性证明。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 对得分项系数的影响）</strong> 在命题 14 下，得分项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(\\sigma_t):=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(0)=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}})=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\le0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时严格负。两端点代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 越大，桥均值中“得分修正”的权重越小，桥越依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的缩放；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 取上界时得分项完全消失，桥退化为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 加新噪声”。这与推论 8 的协方差归零是同一事实的两个侧面。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>定义 1 构造了与标准扩散共享全部时间边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span> 的非马尔可夫前向族，其桥 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 参数化，A3 保证其良定义。</li>\n<li>命题 1 证明边缘一致性；命题 2 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 时退化为 DDPM 马尔可夫链；推论 3 给出方差分解恒等式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 仅在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 携带的信息”与“新注入噪声”之间重分配总方差。</li>\n<li>命题 4 指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时条件桥显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，马尔可夫性破坏；这为下一节用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 导出 DDIM 更新公式提供了结构基础。</li>\n<li>命题 5 把桥均值从依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 改写为依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，并给出线性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon=x_t$</span>；推论 6 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时桥退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数，这是确定性采样的代数基础。</li>\n<li>命题 7 与推论 8 给出相邻两步条件协方差的闭式表达，并把 A3 的上界解释为协方差归零的临界值；数值例子验证 DDPM 的相邻协方差约为 DDIM 的一半。</li>\n<li>命题 9 指出条件桥的 Fisher 信息随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 单调递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时对均值误差敏感度发散，为后续步数、稳定性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 反例节提供定量接口。</li>\n<li>命题 10 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 与 DDPM 联合分布的 KL 精确分解为逐时间步条件桥 KL 之和，推论 11 给出单步闭式并指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时该 KL 发散，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选择不能以 DDPM 联合分布为变分目标，而应以数据边缘为目标。</li>\n<li>命题 12 与推论 13 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 估计误差到桥均值的线性传播系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>，并证明步长趋零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to0$</span>；数值例子显示大步长下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 显著非零，为少步数误差累积提供代数抓手。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-DDIM-的更新公式\">DDIM 的更新公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-DDIM-的更新公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 16 章第 1 节（非马尔可夫前向）已建立的符号。为避免歧义，先重列本节所需的全部符号并固定其含义；本节不引入任何未在此表定义的新符号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间指标：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb{N}_{+}$</span> 为总步数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为累积噪声调度系数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_T&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\bar\\alpha_1&lt;\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。</li>\n<li>前向族：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值随机变量序列（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}_{+}$</span> 为数据维度），其联合律由非马尔可夫前向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 给出，边缘满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varepsilon_t\\}$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下联合高斯、允许跨步相关。</li>\n<li>得分估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\{0,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为可测映射，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x):=\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span>，并假设对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上 Borel 可测且局部有界。</li>\n<li>后验均值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t):=\\dfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，这是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 值可测映射。</li>\n<li>方差参数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span> 为待定标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 为标量超参数。</li>\n<li>标准高斯噪声：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 独立（在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件采样中）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出，后续命题将引用其编号。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 调度正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分映射正则性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部有界；进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上全局 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，以保证更新映射的可测性与矩的可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 二阶矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 由条件期望给出时，此条由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与高斯前向核的平方可积性自动满足。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 条件独立性</strong>：在构造反向采样时，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 条件独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>；此条用于计算条件矩。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在 (A1)–(A4) 下，构造从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的更新映射，推导其唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的公式，并证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时该更新退化为确定性映射。与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：DDPM 的反向核是马尔可夫高斯核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 下的边缘化，其方差由调度固定；DDIM 的更新则是非马尔可夫前向族的反向边缘，其方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是自由参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 正是参数化该自由度的标量。二者共享同一族边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，但联合律不同，这正是“非马尔可夫”一词的数学内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-非马尔可夫前向的反向边缘与更新映射的构造\">非马尔可夫前向的反向边缘与更新映射的构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-非马尔可夫前向的反向边缘与更新映射的构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 为第 1 节构造的非马尔可夫前向族，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。DDIM 的更新公式不是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 直接读出的（该条件在非马尔可夫族下并不由边缘唯一确定），而是从“保持边缘、选取特定联合”的原则导出。具体地，我们要求反向更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 满足：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 独立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)$$</div>\n<p>的律等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>。这一“边缘匹配”条件是 DDIM 更新公式的唯一约束来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2.1（更新映射的仿射形式）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in[0,1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}]$</span> 给定。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon):=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)+\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 条件独立时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 的条件均值与条件协方差分别为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cov}[F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)\\mid x_0]=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,I_d .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下的条件均值。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的构造与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的局部有界性（A2），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 可积（A3）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 恰为条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_t]$</span>（这是 DDIM 推导中默认的得分语义），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\mid x_0]=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_0]=0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立且均值为零。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\mid x_0]\n=\\frac{\\mathbb{E}[x_t\\mid x_0]-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\mid x_0]}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}=x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的条件期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon\\mid x_0]=0$</span>（由 (A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 零均值）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[F_t\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot 0+\\sigma_t\\cdot 0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0 .$$</div>\n<p>再算条件协方差。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u:=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)-x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v:=\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的表达式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t,\\qquad\nu=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,v}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,(\\varepsilon_t-v).$$</div>\n<p>在“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 为条件得分”的语义下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_t]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t-v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 条件独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的剩余随机性，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t-v\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 需经直接计算验证。为避免循环，直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的线性组合逐项计算协方差。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的仿射函数加独立噪声：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,u+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,v+\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>在条件得分语义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_t]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 相关。利用高斯条件期望的线性性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 联合高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 已知时才是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的线性函数；在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的线性投影，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t-v$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下正交。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}(u\\mid x_0)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t-v\\mid x_0)\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot I_d\n=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)(\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\bar\\alpha_t^2}\\,I_d .$$</div>\n<p>此处用到高斯条件期望的残差协方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t-\\mathbb{E}[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_t]\\mid x_0)=\\big(1-\\frac{\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t,x_t)^2}{\\operatorname{Var}(x_t)}\\big)\\operatorname{Var}(\\varepsilon_t)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t,x_t)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(x_t)=1$</span> 得残差方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t^2}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；与上式对照，须注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(u)$</span> 的直接计算应以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的表达式为准。更简洁的路径是：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数（在条件得分语义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\hat x_0\\mid x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\operatorname{Cov}(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。直接展开并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的线性投影结构，可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_0\\big)\n=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)\\,I_d .$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 加上（由 (A4) 条件独立），得总协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 16.2.1 表明：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的边缘协方差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差，且均值匹配。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 是“边缘保持”的更新映射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-方差参数的确定与-sigma_t-公式\">方差参数的确定与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-方差参数的确定与-sigma_t-公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.2.1 只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，并未唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。DDIM 的贡献在于用一个标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 参数化该自由度，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给出确定性更新、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM 的反向核。下面推导 canonical 公式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的参数化）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(\\eta):=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}},\\qquad \\eta\\in[0,1].$$</div>\n<p>则：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(0)=0$</span>；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 型调度（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}^2$</span> 的几何调度）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)^2=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 需按具体调度代入；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)^2$</span> 等于 DDPM 反向核方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　(i) 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r:=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span>（由 (A1)）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot(1-r).$$</div>\n<p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+( \\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-r)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le 1,\\qquad 1-r\\le 1,$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\le\\eta^2\\le 1$</span>。但需与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 比较：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\le 1-r\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-r\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，这由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}^2$</span> 保证；对一般严格递减调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，此时需直接验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-r)\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(1-r)\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-r)\\ge 1-r$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(1-r)\\le 1-r\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 成立。因此 (i) 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>(ii) 显然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(1)^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Big)\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}} .$$</div>\n<p>这正是 DDPM 反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的方差（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取后验均值时的边缘方差），其标准形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。二者一致。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.2.2 给出了 canonical 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}$</span> 的完整合法性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不超过边缘协方差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故命题 16.2.1 的协方差匹配成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 将破坏该预算，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2&lt;0$</span>，更新公式中的平方根不再是实数，这是第 10 节反例的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-主定理-eta-0-的确定性极限\">主定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-主定理-eta-0-的确定性极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 16.2.3（确定性 DDIM 更新）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，更新公式退化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>且该映射关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是确定性仿射映射（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 仿射的得分语义下）。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 为条件得分，则该更新等价于概率流 ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 的一阶 Euler 离散化，其局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((\\Delta t)^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，代入命题 16.2.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 即得第一式；确定性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为零，映射只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二部分的等价性需显式写出 PF-ODE。概率流 ODE 的速度场为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx}{dt}=f(x,t)-\\frac{1}{2}g(t)^2\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\frac{1}{2}\\beta_t x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 为离散调度下的瞬时速率。利用得分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x)$</span>（高斯前向核的标准恒等式），速度场化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx}{dt}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\beta_t x+\\frac{1}{2}\\beta_t\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x).$$</div>\n<p>在离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 上取 Euler 步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=x_t+\\Delta t\\Big(-\\frac{1}{2}\\beta_t x_t+\\frac{1}{2}\\beta_t\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\Big),\\qquad \\Delta t=1.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 并整理，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的定义消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，可得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t .$$</div>\n<p>关键整理步骤：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_t)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span>。Euler 步给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\Big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big)x_t+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_t\n=\\Big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\Big)\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\big)+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon_t .$$</div>\n<p>合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\big)\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{2}$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\big)\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}=\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 的关系需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}\\approx 1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}-\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{8}$</span> 展开，一阶项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，二阶项即 Euler 截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta_t^2)=O((\\Delta t)^2)$</span>。合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\big)\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\beta_t$</span> 展开至一阶，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}+O(\\beta_t^2)$</span>。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t+O(\\beta_t^2),$$</div>\n<p>即确定性 DDIM 更新是 PF-ODE Euler 离散化的一阶近似，局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((\\Delta t)^2)$</span>。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 16.2.3 的证明中，关键恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 定义的直接重排，不依赖任何近似；Euler 步与 DDIM 更新的差异仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta_t^2)$</span> 项，这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 在步数足够多时逼近 PF-ODE 的解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-可检验推论-eta-1-退化为-DDPM-反向核\">可检验推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM 反向核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-可检验推论-eta-1-退化为-DDPM-反向核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 16.2.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的边缘一致性）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}})$</span>，且更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的条件律等于 DDPM 反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 处的边缘，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon)\\stackrel{d}{=}\\mathcal{N}\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I_d\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 16.2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下是高斯（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 高斯的仿射变换），均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span>，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_t(1)$</span> 代入命题 16.2.2(iii)，即得 DDPM 反向核的均值-方差形式。DDPM 反向核的标准形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal{N}(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\tilde\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\hat x_0$</span> 代入，第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 均值一致。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.2.4 给出一个可数值检验的恒等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 DDIM 更新样本与 DDPM 反向核样本同分布。第 14 节代码将用 Monte Carlo 验证该恒等式的样本均值与样本协方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-一维几何调度下的数值验证\">具体例子：一维几何调度下的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-一维几何调度下的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>（几何调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}^2$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\beta_2=1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_2}{\\bar\\alpha_1}=1-0.5=0.5,\\qquad\n\\sigma_2(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-0.5}{1-0.25}}\\sqrt{1-0.5}=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{0.5}{0.75}}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.5}=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{3}}\\approx 0.577\\eta .$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=1/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{0.5-1/3}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_2+\\sqrt{1/3}\\,\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1/6}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_2+\\sqrt{1/3}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。验证协方差预算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_1-\\sigma_2^2)=1/3+1/6=0.5$</span>，匹配。此例可直接代入第 13 节代码的 <code>assert</code> 中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef ddim_update(x_t, eps_hat, x0_hat, ab_prev, ab_t, eta):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;单步 DDIM 更新，返回 x_{t-1} 与 sigma_t。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    sigma_t = eta * ((1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t)).sqrt() * (1 - ab_t / ab_prev).sqrt()\n    assert sigma_t**2 &lt;= 1 - ab_prev + 1e-12, &quot;sigma_t^2 超出协方差预算&quot;\n    x_prev = ab_prev.sqrt() * x0_hat + (1 - ab_prev - sigma_t**2).sqrt() * eps_hat\n    if eta &gt; 0:\n        x_prev = x_prev + sigma_t * torch.randn_like(x_t)\n    return x_prev, sigma_t\n\n# 一维几何调度数值验证\nab1, ab2 = torch.tensor(0.5), torch.tensor(0.25)\nx0_hat, eps_hat = torch.tensor([0.3]), torch.tensor([-0.2])\nx_t = ab2.sqrt() * x0_hat + (1 - ab2).sqrt() * eps_hat\n\nx_det, s0 = ddim_update(x_t, eps_hat, x0_hat, ab1, ab2, eta=0.0)\nx_sto, s1 = ddim_update(x_t, eps_hat, x0_hat, ab1, ab2, eta=1.0)\nprint(&quot;x_t shape:&quot;, x_t.shape, &quot;x_det shape:&quot;, x_det.shape)\nprint(&quot;sigma_t(eta=0):&quot;, s0.item(), &quot;sigma_t(eta=1):&quot;, s1.item())\nassert abs(s0.item()) &lt; 1e-8\nassert abs(s1.item()**2 - 1/3) &lt; 1e-6\nassert abs((1 - ab1 - s1**2).item() - 1/6) &lt; 1e-6\nprint(&quot;预期: sigma_t(eta=1)^2 = 1/3 ≈ 0.333333, 剩余预算 = 1/6 ≈ 0.166667&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>sigma_t(eta=0)=0.0</code>，<code>sigma_t(eta=1)≈0.57735</code>，平方约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.333333$</span>，剩余预算约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.166667$</span>，三个 <code>assert</code> 全部通过。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DDIM 更新公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 由“边缘匹配”条件唯一确定其仿射结构（命题 16.2.1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 是保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 协方差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 的自由参数。</li>\n<li>方差参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（命题 16.2.2），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给出确定性更新且是 PF-ODE Euler 离散化的一阶近似（定理 16.2.3），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM 反向核（推论 16.2.4）。</li>\n<li>本节推导链为“非马尔可夫前向的边缘保持 → 仿射更新映射 → <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 参数化 → <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 确定性极限 → <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> DDPM 极限”，后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数节、确定性极限节与 PF-ODE 等价节均以此为代数基础，第 10 节反例将针对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 破坏协方差预算给出分布偏移的显式构造。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-更新公式的坐标表述与维度一致性检验\">更新公式的坐标表述与维度一致性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-更新公式的坐标表述与维度一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.2.1 与定理 16.2.3 给出的更新公式在无坐标形式下已完整，但工程实现与数值分析需要明确坐标表述与维度约定，否则平方根与逐元素运算的合法性无从检验。本节在此补足该层表述，并给出一个可检验的维度一致性命题。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb{N}_{+}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 视为列向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。更新公式中的三个标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 均为实数，按标量-向量乘法作用于向量。逐坐标写出，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(x_{t-1})_i=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,(\\hat x_0)_i+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,(\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_i+\\sigma_t\\,\\varepsilon_i .$$</div>\n<p>该式表明更新映射是逐坐标独立的：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标的更新只用到第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个坐标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span>，不跨坐标混合。这一点与 DDPM 反向核的高斯结构一致（协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 的对角性），也是 DDIM 更新可在任意维度上逐元素向量化实现的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2.5（维度一致性与逐坐标独立性）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\in[0,1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}]$</span>。则更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 的每个坐标分量只依赖对应坐标的输入，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}\\big((F_t)_i,(F_t)_j\\mid x_0\\big)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　逐坐标独立性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的逐坐标表达式直接读出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0)_i$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_i$</span>（在条件得分语义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的逐坐标仿射函数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_i$</span> 同理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_j$</span> 独立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq j$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(F_t)_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 的函数，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_j$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_j$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p>协方差为零需验证交叉项。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq j$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}\\big((F_t)_i,(F_t)_j\\mid x_0\\big)\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}^2\\operatorname{Cov}\\big((\\hat x_0)_i,(\\hat x_0)_j\\mid x_0\\big)\n+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}^2\\operatorname{Cov}\\big((\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_i,(\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_j\\mid x_0\\big)\n+\\sigma_t^2\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_i,\\varepsilon_j)\n+\\text{交叉项}.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_i,\\varepsilon_j)=0$</span>。由条件得分语义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的逐坐标仿射函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d$</span> 对角，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}((\\hat x_0)_i,(\\hat x_0)_j\\mid x_0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}((\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_i,(\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_j\\mid x_0)=0$</span>，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}((\\hat x_0)_i,(\\hat\\varepsilon_t)_j\\mid x_0)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq j$</span>）。所有项为零，故协方差为零。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.2.5 的工程含义是：DDIM 更新在实现中无需构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 协方差矩阵，逐元素运算即精确；这也解释了第 13 节代码中 <code>torch.randn_like(x_t)</code> 与逐元素乘法的正确性。若得分映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 不是逐坐标的（例如跨坐标耦合的网络），命题 16.2.5 的逐坐标独立性失效，但命题 16.2.1 的边缘匹配仍成立，因为后者只用到条件均值与条件协方差的整体结构，不要求对角性。这一区分在数值稳定性节（第 8 节）讨论非对角得分时的舍入误差传播时会用到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-更新公式的复合与多步采样的代数结构\">更新公式的复合与多步采样的代数结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-更新公式的复合与多步采样的代数结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单步更新公式的复合给出多步采样的代数结构，这是分析步数与质量关系（第 7 节）与采样轨迹（第 6 节）的代数前提。设采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 开始，逐步降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_t(\\eta)$</span> 由命题 16.2.2 给出。定义复合映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{T\\to 0}:=F_1\\circ F_2\\circ\\cdots\\circ F_T,$$</div>\n<p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与独立噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{(t)}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，各步噪声相互独立（这是采样算法的定义性假设，需显式写入 (A4) 的多步版本）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 多步噪声独立性</strong>：采样过程中各步噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{(1)},\\dots,\\varepsilon^{(T)}$</span> 相互独立，且与初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 独立，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{(t)}\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2.6（复合更新的条件矩递推）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sigma_t(\\eta)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span>，则复合更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{T\\to 0}(x_T,\\varepsilon^{(1:T)})$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\Phi_{T\\to 0}\\mid x_0\\big]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}\\,x_0=x_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cov}\\big(\\Phi_{T\\to 0}\\mid x_0\\big)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)\\,I_d=0 .$$</div>\n<p>即复合更新在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 下退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的确定性点，方差为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对单步用命题 16.2.1：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_{t-1}\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d$</span>。但复合的条件矩不能简单迭代单步矩，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的实现，而单步公式的均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\cdots$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的非线性函数。要得到复合的精确矩，需利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的条件得分语义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>（在得分语义下），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\mid x_0]=x_0$</span> 已在命题 16.2.1 证明中用到。</p>\n<p>对复合，用全期望公式逐层剥离。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=F_t(x_t,\\varepsilon^{(t)})$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的定义消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数，其系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，该仿射函数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的修正项，而修正项在条件得分语义下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的残差正交。</p>\n<p>更直接的路径是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数，故复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{T\\to 0}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的确定性函数。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}\\varepsilon_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_T,T)=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_T]$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为确定性点的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_T,T)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}\\varepsilon_T$</span> 处取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_T=0$</span>；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_T$</span> 随机，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的无偏估计的逐点版本，而是条件期望意义下的无偏。复合的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\Phi_{T\\to 0}\\mid x_0]=x_0$</span> 由归纳法：假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_{t}\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}[x_{t-1}\\mid x_0]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathbb{E}[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0]\\big]\n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\mid x_0]+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb{E}[\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\mid x_0].$$</div>\n<p>在条件得分语义下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)\\mid x_0]=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\mid x_0]=x_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_{t-1}\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>。归纳至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_0]=x_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p>协方差：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，单步协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d$</span>，但复合协方差不是单步协方差的简单相加，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件协方差在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下为零（确定性映射），故复合协方差完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的初始协方差经确定性映射传播。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为精确条件期望时，复合映射将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的估计，其条件协方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)I_d=0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_0-\\sigma_0^2}=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 无更新步）。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.2.6 的结论在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时需要精确表述：复合协方差不为零，因为每步注入独立噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon^{(t)}$</span>，这些噪声经后续确定性映射传播后累积。精确的复合协方差递推为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\operatorname{Cov}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_0\\big)+\\sigma_t^2 I_d,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 经确定性部分的传播协方差，第二项是当步噪声注入。该递推是第 7 节分析步数与质量关系的代数基础：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时每步注入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在总协方差中累积，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时无注入，复合协方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处归零。这也解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 在步数足够多时能精确复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布（在得分精确的极限下），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的采样即使步数趋于无穷也保留一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2$</span> 传播而来的残差方差——该残差在第 10 节反例中将与分布偏移直接关联。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-得分误差对更新公式的敏感性\">得分误差对更新公式的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-得分误差对更新公式的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>更新公式的代数正确性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的精确性。实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 是估计量，存在误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x_t):=\\hat\\varepsilon_t(x_t)-\\varepsilon_t^\\star(x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t^\\star$</span> 为精确条件得分对应的噪声。本节给出一个一阶敏感性命题，量化该误差如何传播到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2.7（得分误差的一阶传播）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t+\\delta_t$</span> 均满足 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 局部有界。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，更新映射对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的扰动的一阶响应为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta x_{t-1}=\\Big(-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\,\\delta_t(x_t)+O(\\|\\delta_t\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>（逐坐标），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0$</span> 的扰动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\delta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的扰动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\delta_t$</span>。相加得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta x_{t-1}=\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\delta_t+O(\\|\\delta_t\\|^2).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，第一项可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 的形式，整理即得所述系数。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.2.7 的系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 减小），说明早期步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）的得分误差被放大更多，这与第 8 节数值稳定性讨论中“早期步误差累积”的结论一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 减小，系数绝对值略减，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 注入的噪声同时增大复合方差，二者存在权衡，该权衡的定量分析属于第 7 节与第 10 节的范围，本节只给出代数响应式。</p>\n<p>至此，本节在已有定义与主定理之外，补足了坐标表述（命题 16.2.5）、多步复合的矩结构（命题 16.2.6）与得分误差的一阶传播（命题 16.2.7），三者共同构成更新公式的完整代数图景：单步公式的仿射结构、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的预算约束、复合的矩递推与误差传播系数，均为后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数节、确定性极限节、PF-ODE 等价节与反例节的直接输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-η-参数\">η 参数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-η-参数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为输入、输出对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件期望估计的可测映射；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，满足前节恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>前节已给出非马尔可夫前向族与更新公式的骨架。本节引入的唯一新符号是标量参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 及其诱导的方差系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。为避免与后续节的记号冲突，本节明确：</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.3.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}},\n\\qquad \\eta\\in[0,1].$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，此时根号内第二因子为零，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1(\\eta)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 均为 Borel 可测且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 为数据维度，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,d$</span> 逐分量成立。</p>\n<p>(A2) 采样噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 独立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\equiv 0$</span>（即不抽取该随机项）。</p>\n<p>(A3) 所有出现的期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 下取；涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 求导时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 使被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 局部一致可积（下文命题 16.3.4 中显式验证）。</p>\n<p>(A1) 在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由神经网络参数化，连续可微且有界输出，故局部有界可测。(A3) 在有限步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与有界估计下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不是前向过程的马尔可夫转移核参数，而是<strong>逆向更新族</strong>的插值参数；它不改变前向边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，只改变给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件方差。这与 DDPM 中固定的后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是不同对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-1-sigma_t-的代数结构与合法取值范围\">16.3.1 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的代数结构与合法取值范围<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-1-sigma_t-的代数结构与合法取值范围\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的恒等式与上界）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2\\,\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Bigl(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Bigr)\n=\\eta^2\\,\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一等式由定义平方直接得到。第二等式用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=1-(1-\\beta_t)=\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p>上界：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le\\beta_t+\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，显然成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该上界是更新公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 为实数的充要保障：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 当且仅当根号下非负。命题 16.3.2 说明对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 该条件自动满足，无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.3（端点值）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(0)=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)^2=\\tilde\\beta_t:=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，即 DDPM 的后验方差。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0,1$</span> 并用命题 16.3.2 第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出 canonical claim 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow\\text{DDPM}$</span> 的方差侧依据；漂移侧的匹配留待第 9 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-2-eta-对条件均值与方差的作用\">16.3.2 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对条件均值与方差的作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-2-eta-对条件均值与方差的作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.4（一阶矩不变性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}$</span> 按更新公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\,\\varepsilon$$</div>\n<p>生成。则对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl[x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}\\mid x_t\\bigr]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>且该条件均值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 严格单调（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon\\neq 0$</span> 时）不成立——它关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的变化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 线性。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=0$</span>，故随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 条件期望为零。确定性项保留。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.5（条件方差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的二次依赖）</strong> 在命题 16.3.4 的假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Var}\\bigl(x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}\\mid x_t\\bigr)=\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2 I_d=\\eta^2\\,\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,I_d.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 条件方差只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)=\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>；再用命题 16.3.2 第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.3.4–16.3.5 共同刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的几何意义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只调节逆向一步的<strong>条件方差</strong>，条件均值中的确定性部分随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大而减小其系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，两者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 耦合。这与“把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 当作温度”是不同概念：温度缩放改变的是得分函数的乘子，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 改变的是方差预算在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 之间的分配。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.6（方差预算恒等式）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\bigr)+\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>即逆向一步的总方差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 被拆分为“确定性噪声估计系数平方”与“随机扰动方差”两部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 控制拆分比例，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时全部预算给确定性项。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接相加。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-3-eta-的极限行为与单调性\">16.3.3 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的极限行为与单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-3-eta-的极限行为与单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 的连续性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\mapsto x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 处均方连续：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\eta\\to 0}\\mathbb E\\bigl\\|x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t-1}^{(0)}\\bigr\\|^2=0.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t-1}^{(0)}=\\bigl(a(\\eta)-a(0)\\bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>均方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a(\\eta)-a(0))^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2 d+2(a(\\eta)-a(0))\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\mathbb E\\langle\\hat\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon\\rangle$</span>。由 (A2) 交叉项为零。由命题 16.3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2 c_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关的正常数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\to 0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)\\to a(0)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 0$</span> 与平方根连续性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 局部有界（(A1)），故两项均趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调效应）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon\\neq 0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 严格递增；而确定性系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2 c_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 严格递减。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 16.3.5，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\eta^2 c_t I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span>，故严格递增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 线性递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.3.8 揭示一个必须警惕的事实：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 并非“增加多样性而不改变均值”——它同时压低确定性噪声估计的权重。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 携带真实得分信息时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大将以牺牲该信息为代价换取随机性。这正是第 10 节反例的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-4-具体例子-一维二步验证\">16.3.4 具体例子：一维二步验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-4-具体例子-一维二步验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}=\\frac{0.1}{0.28},\\qquad \\beta_2=0.2,\\qquad c_2=\\frac{0.1\\times 0.2}{0.28}=\\frac{0.02}{0.28}=\\frac{1}{14}.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2/14$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_1-\\eta^2/14=0.1-\\eta^2/14$</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a= \\sqrt{0.1}\\approx 0.3162$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1^{(0)}=\\sqrt{0.9}\\times 0.5+\\sqrt{0.1}\\times 0.3\\approx 0.4743+0.0949=0.5692$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=1/14\\approx 0.0714$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a^2=0.1-0.0714=0.0286$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\approx 0.1690$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.4743+0.0507=0.5250$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.0714$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>验证推论 16.3.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0286+0.0714=0.1=1-\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例同时验证命题 16.3.8：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 从 0 到 1，均值从 0.5692 降至 0.5250，方差从 0 升至 0.0714。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-5-可检验恒等式-eta-与得分的关系\">16.3.5 可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与得分的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-5-可检验恒等式-eta-与得分的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的得分表述）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q_t(x_t)$</span> 的估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（前节已定义）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2\\,\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Bigl(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Bigr)\n=\\eta^2\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>右端只依赖前向调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 无关；这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是<strong>调度侧</strong>参数，不进入得分估计。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 即命题 16.3.2 第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式可检验：给定任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)$</span> 序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)/\\eta$</span> 应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的取值无关。代码节将用 assert 验证。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 给 DDPM 后验方差；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只调节逆向一步的条件方差预算，不改变前向边缘。</li>\n<li>条件均值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 改变（确定性噪声估计系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 递减），条件方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c_t I_d$</span> 严格递增；方差预算恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)+\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 是更新公式合法性的代数保障。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\mapsto x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 处均方连续，故确定性极限是连续极限而非突变；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大同时压低确定性得分项权重，为第 10 节的分布偏移反例埋下代数根源。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef sigma_sq(eta, abar_prev, abar_t):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;sigma_t(eta)^2 = eta^2 * (1 - abar_{t-1}) * beta_t / (1 - abar_t)&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    beta_t = 1.0 - abar_t / abar_prev\n    return eta**2 * (1.0 - abar_prev) * beta_t / (1.0 - abar_t)\n\n# 一维二步例子\nabar1, abar2 = 0.9, 0.72\nx0_hat, eps_hat = 0.5, 0.3\nfor eta in [0.0, 0.5, 1.0]:\n    s2 = sigma_sq(eta, abar1, abar2)\n    a2 = 1.0 - abar1 - s2\n    assert a2 &gt;= -1e-12, &quot;根号下必须非负&quot;\n    a = np.sqrt(max(a2, 0.0))\n    mean = np.sqrt(abar1) * x0_hat + a * eps_hat\n    var = s2\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta}: sigma^2={s2:.6f}, a^2={a2:.6f}, mean={mean:.6f}, var={var:.6f}&quot;)\n    assert abs(a2 + s2 - (1.0 - abar1)) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;方差预算恒等式&quot;\n\n# 端点检查\nassert abs(sigma_sq(0.0, abar1, abar2)) &lt; 1e-15\ns2_1 = sigma_sq(1.0, abar1, abar2)\ntilde_beta = (1.0 - abar1) / (1.0 - abar2) * (1.0 - abar2 / abar1)\nassert abs(s2_1 - tilde_beta) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;eta=1 应等于 DDPM 后验方差&quot;\nprint(&quot;端点与恒等式检查通过；形状：标量&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-6-eta-作为逆向族的插值参数-族的光滑性\">16.3.6 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 作为逆向族的插值参数：族的光滑性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-6-eta-作为逆向族的插值参数-族的光滑性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)$</span> 的代数结构。本节进一步把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 视为一条<strong>单参数逆向更新族</strong>的坐标，并证明该族关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是光滑的、且在端点处分别与确定性 DDIM 与 DDPM 逆向核相合。这一小节的作用是为第 4 节“确定性极限”与第 9 节“与 DDPM 的关系”提供可直接引用的接口命题。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.3.10（逆向更新族）</strong> 固定前向调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)_{t=1}^T$</span> 与估计映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，定义从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的随机映射</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\,\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}\\}_{\\eta\\in[0,1]}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的<strong>逆向更新族</strong>。</p>\n<p>需要强调：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}$</span> 是<strong>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件映射</strong>，不是前向转移核。前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)$</span> 完全确定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只改变逆向条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的方差结构。这与“改变前向噪声调度”是不同操作，后者会改变所有边缘分布。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.11（族关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 光滑性）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部有界。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\mapsto\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}(x_t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 的，且其一阶导数显式可写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\eta}\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}(x_t,\\varepsilon)\n=-\\frac{\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\,\\sigma_t'(\\eta)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t'(\\eta)\\,\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'(\\eta)=\\dfrac{\\sigma_t(\\eta)}{\\eta}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'(0)$</span> 取右导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 16.3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2 c_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)&gt;0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{c_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上光滑（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\ge 0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'(\\eta)=\\sqrt{c_t}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，右导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{c_t}$</span>。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2 c_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 时光滑；由命题 16.3.2 的上界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c_t\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的退化情形出现，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)=0$</span>，需单独处理端点。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span>，链式法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\eta}a(\\eta)^2=-2\\eta c_t,\\qquad \\frac{d}{d\\eta}a(\\eta)=\\frac{-\\eta c_t}{a(\\eta)}=-\\frac{\\sigma_t\\sigma_t'}{a}.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{(\\eta)}$</span> 即得所述导数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大时，确定性噪声项的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)$</span> 以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t\\sigma_t'/a$</span> 下降，随机项以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'$</span> 上升，两者由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 驱动。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不能简单理解为“加噪强度”——它是<strong>方差预算的重新分配</strong>，且分配速率在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 附近因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to 0$</span> 而发散（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)=0$</span> 时）。这一发散是第 8 节数值稳定性讨论的入口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.12（端点相合）</strong> 在命题 16.3.11 的假设下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{(0)}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 无关，即确定性 DDIM 更新；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{(1)}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，即 DDPM 后验采样更新。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，随机项消失。(ii) 由推论 16.3.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(1)^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.3.12 把 canonical claims 中两条端点陈述收束为同一族的两个坐标值，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的插值语义是严格的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 连续变到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，逆向核从确定性 DDIM 连续过渡到 DDPM 后验采样，中间每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 都是一个合法的非马尔可夫逆向核。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-7-eta-与得分估计的独立性-一个可检验的分离恒等式\">16.3.7 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与得分估计的独立性：一个可检验的分离恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-7-eta-与得分估计的独立性-一个可检验的分离恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.3.9 已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)/\\eta$</span> 只依赖调度。这里把它加强为一个<strong>分离恒等式</strong>，用于在第 14 节代码中做数值断言。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.13（方差系数的调度分离）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)$</span> 给定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 由之确定。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sigma_t(\\eta)}{\\eta}=\\sqrt{\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 均无关，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 16.3.2 第二等式开方，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式有两点用途。其一，它说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是<strong>调度侧</strong>参数：给定调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t/\\eta$</span> 是常数，可在采样前预计算，不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 变化。其二，它为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不进入得分估计”提供了代数证据：得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 进入更新式的确定性项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 完全不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。因此调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不会改变网络输出的语义，只改变逆向一步的随机性预算。</p>\n<p>需要警惕一个常见误读：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大虽不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的<strong>数值</strong>，但通过命题 16.3.8 压低了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)$</span>，从而在<strong>更新式</strong>中削弱了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的权重。所以“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与得分无关”应精确表述为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与得分估计的数值无关，但与得分项在更新式中的系数有关”。这两句话不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-8-一个二维例子-验证分离恒等式与族的光滑性\">16.3.8 一个二维例子：验证分离恒等式与族的光滑性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-8-一个二维例子-验证分离恒等式与族的光滑性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1,\\beta_2=0.2,\\beta_3=0.3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.504$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_3=(1.0,-0.5)$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(0.2,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(0.4,-0.3)$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span> 计算调度常数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_3=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)\\beta_3}{1-\\bar\\alpha_3}=\\frac{0.28\\times 0.3}{0.496}=\\frac{0.084}{0.496}\\approx 0.16935.$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3(\\eta)/\\eta=\\sqrt{c_3}\\approx 0.4115$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 无关。验证命题 16.3.13：改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.9,-0.2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-0.1,0.7)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3(\\eta)/\\eta$</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4115$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3^2=0.25\\times 0.16935\\approx 0.04234$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_2-\\sigma_3^2=0.28-0.04234=0.23766$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\approx 0.4875$</span>。更新均值（逐分量）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}\\,\\hat x_0+a\\,\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{0.72}\\,(0.2,0.1)+0.4875\\,(0.4,-0.3)\\approx(0.1697,0.0849)+(0.1950,-0.1463)=(0.3647,-0.0614).$$</div>\n<p>验证推论 16.3.6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.23766+0.04234=0.28=1-\\bar\\alpha_2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>光滑性检验：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.5$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.5+h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-4}$</span>，数值差商 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(\\Phi_3^{(\\eta+h)}-\\Phi_3^{(\\eta)}\\bigr)/h$</span> 应与命题 16.3.11 的解析导数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 内一致。解析导数逐分量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\Phi_3}{\\partial\\eta}=-\\frac{\\sigma_3\\sigma_3'}{a}\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_3'\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\sigma_3'=\\sqrt{c_3}\\approx 0.4115,\\quad \\sigma_3=0.5\\times 0.4115=0.2058,\\quad a=0.4875.$$</div>\n<p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_3\\sigma_3'/a\\approx -0.2058\\times 0.4115/0.4875\\approx -0.1737$</span>。故导数第一分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx -0.1737\\times 0.4+0.4115\\,\\varepsilon_1$</span>，第二分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx -0.1737\\times(-0.3)+0.4115\\,\\varepsilon_2$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0.6,-0.8)$</span> 时，导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx(-0.0695+0.2469,\\ 0.0521-0.3292)=(0.1774,-0.2771)$</span>。差商应与之一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-9-eta-的信息论解读-条件熵的单调性\">16.3.9 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的信息论解读：条件熵的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-9-eta-的信息论解读-条件熵的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可检验的推论，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与逆向一步的条件微分熵联系起来。这一推论在第 10 节讨论分布偏移时会用到。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.14（条件微分熵关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为常数（即把估计视为给定）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}\\mid x_t$</span> 的条件微分熵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h\\bigl(x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}\\mid x_t\\bigr)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\bigl(2\\pi e\\,\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)&gt;0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时条件分布退化为点质量，微分熵取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>（约定）。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span> 严格递增，速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{d}{\\eta}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与估计后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}$</span> 是常数向量加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，故条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\text{常数},\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，其微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma_t^2)$</span>。由命题 16.3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2 c_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e c_t)+d\\log\\eta$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/\\eta&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大以对数速率增加逆向一步的条件熵，但由命题 16.3.8，它同时压低确定性得分项权重。二者张力正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择的核心权衡：熵增带来样本多样性，但得分项权重下降可能引入偏差。第 10 节的反例将构造一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 携带关键方向信息、而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 过大导致该信息被淹没的具体场景。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-10-eta-与逆向核的-KL-结构-一个精确的二次型恒等式\">16.3.10 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与逆向核的 KL 结构：一个精确的二次型恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-10-eta-与逆向核的-KL-结构-一个精确的二次型恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与条件熵联系起来，但熵只刻画了单个条件分布的扩散程度，未刻画两个不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 值所诱导的条件分布之间的距离。本节补上这一缺口：对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 值给出的逆向条件分布都是高斯，其 KL 散度有闭式表达，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的差是二次型。这一恒等式在第 10 节讨论分布偏移时是定量工具。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.15（同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的 KL 散度）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 视为给定常数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1,\\eta_2\\in[0,1]$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_i=\\mathcal N\\bigl(m_i,\\sigma_t(\\eta_i)^2 I_d\\bigr)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_i$</span> 诱导的逆向条件分布，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_i=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+a(\\eta_i)\\,\\hat\\varepsilon,\\qquad a(\\eta_i)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t(\\eta_i)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)&gt;0$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(P_1\\,\\|\\,P_2)=\\frac{d}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2}{\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2}-1-\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2}{\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2}\\right)+\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\,\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2=\\bigl(a(\\eta_1)-a(\\eta_2)\\bigr)^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维各向同性高斯的 KL 散度标准式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\bigl(\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)\\|\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)\\bigr)=\\frac12\\Bigl[\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}+(m_2-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)\\Bigr].$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_i=\\sigma_t(\\eta_i)^2 I_d$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)=d\\,\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\det\\Sigma_2/\\det\\Sigma_1)=d\\log(\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2)=-d\\log(\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2)$</span>；二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2$</span>。合并即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1-m_2=(a(\\eta_1)-a(\\eta_2))\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 直接取范数平方。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题有三点值得注意。其一，KL 由两部分相加：<strong>方差失配项</strong>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2$</span> 的比值）与<strong>均值失配项</strong>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 的差）。二者都只通过调度常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 与估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 进入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 完全消去——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 项在两个分布中相同。其二，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1=\\eta_2$</span> 时两项均为零，KL 为零，符合预期。其三，方差失配项作为比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2/\\sigma_t(\\eta_2)^2$</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1-\\log r$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1$</span> 处取最小值零，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 严格凸；这解释了为何“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离参考值”在 KL 意义下代价随偏离量超线性增长。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.16（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1=0$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_2=\\eta$</span> 的 KL）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_2=\\eta&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta_1)^2=0$</span>，第一个分布退化为点质量，此时 KL 公式须按退化高斯理解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\delta_{m_1}\\|P_2)=\\dfrac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2}$</span>（方差项取极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1-\\log r\\to+\\infty$</span>，但点质量对连续分布的 KL 按定义只保留二次项，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2$</span> 绝对连续当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2$</span> 支撑内且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2$</span> 非退化；此处按常用约定取二次项）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2 c_t}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\bigl(\\delta_{m_0}\\|P_\\eta\\bigr)=\\frac{\\bigl(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2 c_t}\\bigr)^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{2\\eta^2 c_t}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时，分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)-a(\\eta)\\approx \\dfrac{\\eta^2 c_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}$</span>，故 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to \\dfrac{\\eta^2 c_t^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{8(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\eta^2 c_t}=\\dfrac{c_t\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{8(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span>，为有限常数。这说明确定性极限与任意小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时不发散，与命题 16.3.7 的均方连续性一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 按上述代入并做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 的泰勒展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{A-\\eta^2 c_t}=\\sqrt A-\\dfrac{\\eta^2 c_t}{2\\sqrt A}+O(\\eta^4)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(0)-a(\\eta)=\\dfrac{\\eta^2 c_t}{2\\sqrt A}+O(\\eta^4)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的定量结论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 增大时，逆向条件分布相对确定性 DDIM 的 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 极限下<strong>不趋于零而是趋于一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 成正比的常数</strong>——因为点质量与任何非退化高斯的 KL 在方差比趋于零时由二次项主导，而二次项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时趋于有限值。这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 小则接近 DDIM”的直觉并不矛盾：均方意义下确实接近（命题 16.3.7），但 KL 意义下并不连续趋零，因为 KL 对支撑退化敏感。这一区别在第 10 节讨论“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移”时必须区分：均方接近不等于分布接近。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-11-复合多步的-eta-累积效应\">16.3.11 复合多步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 累积效应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-11-复合多步的-eta-累积效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单步命题只刻画一步逆向核。实际采样是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步复合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的影响沿轨迹累积。本小节给出一个可加性上界，说明累积偏差如何随步数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增长，为第 7 节“步数与质量”提供代数接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.17（多步均方偏差的可加上界）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;\\infty$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\\le M$</span> 一致有界。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{(\\eta)}\\}_{t=T}^{0}$</span> 为从同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发、用参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的逆向族逐步生成的轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{(0)}\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性轨迹。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl\\|x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t-1}^{(0)}\\bigr\\|^2\\le C_t\\,\\eta^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_s)_{s\\le t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t^{(\\eta)}-x_t^{(0)}\\|^2$</span> 的递推系数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路与关键步骤</em> 对一步，由命题 16.3.7 的分解，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t-1}^{(0)}=\\bigl(a(\\eta)-a(0)\\bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t^{(\\eta)},t)+\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\varepsilon+\\bigl[\\text{估计在两条轨迹上的差}\\bigr].$$</div>\n<p>第三项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{(\\eta)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{(0)}$</span> 处的取值不同，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-Lipschitz 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2\\|x_t^{(\\eta)}-x_t^{(0)}\\|^2$</span> 控制（乘上系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)^2$</span> 的相应组合）。第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|a(\\eta)-a(0)|\\le \\dfrac{\\eta^2 c_t}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}$</span>（推论 16.3.16 的展开）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|\\le M$</span> 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\eta^4)$</span>，被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 吸收。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\sigma_t(\\eta)\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\eta^2 c_t d$</span>。合并得单步上界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t-1}^{(0)}\\|^2\\le K_t\\,\\eta^2+\\Lambda_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|x_t^{(\\eta)}-x_t^{(0)}\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t=\\bigl(c_t d+Mc_t/(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}})\\bigr)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_t=L^2(\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+a(\\eta)^2)$</span>。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,T-1,\\dots$</span> 递推，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_t$</span> 的乘积给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_t\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 单调不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 诱导的多步偏差在均方意义下是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\eta^2)$</span>，且累积系数随步数单调增长。它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 小则轨迹接近确定性 DDIM”从单步命题 16.3.7 提升到多步，且给出了偏差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增长的显式递推。注意上界中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(\\eta)^2$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1)$</span> 接近零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_t$</span> 主要由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}L^2$</span> 贡献，不会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to 0$</span> 而爆炸——这是 Lipschitz 假设带来的稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.18（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 的多步连续性）</strong> 在命题 16.3.17 的假设下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\eta\\to 0}\\ \\mathbb E\\bigl\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\bigr\\|^2=0.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 16.3.17，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\|^2\\le C_0\\eta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时上界趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把第 4 节“确定性极限”的多步版本预先给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 时整条轨迹在均方意义下收敛到确定性 DDIM 轨迹，且收敛速率是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span>。它同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不是“开关”，而是连续旋钮；不存在某个临界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 使轨迹突变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-12-调度常数-c_t-的边界行为\">16.3.12 调度常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的边界行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-12-调度常数-c_t-的边界行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.3.2 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在调度两端有不同行为，这直接影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的有效范围。本小节把这一行为写成两个极限命题，作为第 8 节数值稳定性的输入。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.19（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 两端的极限）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\downarrow 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时信号完全被噪声淹没）。</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span>（早期步，噪声很小）时，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to 0$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>（晚期步，信号几乎消失）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot 1$</span>，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 有正下界。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\approx 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ll 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\approx\\beta_t\\to 0$</span>。(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to\\beta_t$</span>，有正下界当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有正下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：早期步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 可以很小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\sqrt{c_t}$</span> 在早期步很小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对早期步的影响弱；晚期步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在晚期步的影响强。这与扩散模型的直觉一致：晚期步噪声大，随机性预算大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的作用显著；早期步噪声小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的作用被调度压缩。第 8 节将用这一行为解释为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在晚期步过大时数值上更易失稳。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 命题 16.3.15：两个 eta 的 KL 散度\ndef kl_two_etas(eta1, eta2, abar_prev, abar_t, eps_hat, d=2):\n    c = (1.0 - abar_prev) * (1.0 - abar_t / abar_prev) / (1.0 - abar_t)\n    s1sq, s2sq = eta1**2 * c, eta2**2 * c\n    assert s2sq &gt; 0, &quot;参考分布必须非退化&quot;\n    a1 = np.sqrt(1.0 - abar_prev - s1sq)\n    a2 = np.sqrt(1.0 - abar_prev - s2sq)\n    r = s1sq / s2sq\n    var_term = 0.5 * d * (r - 1.0 - np.log(r))\n    mean_term = 0.5 * ((a1 - a2)**2 * np.sum(eps_hat**2)) / s2sq\n    return var_term + mean_term\n\nabar_prev, abar_t = 0.72, 0.504\neps_hat = np.array([0.4, -0.3])\nkl_same = kl_two_etas(0.5, 0.5, abar_prev, abar_t, eps_hat)\nassert abs(kl_same) &lt; 1e-12, &quot;同 eta 的 KL 应为零&quot;\nkl_01 = kl_two_etas(0.0, 0.5, abar_prev, abar_t, eps_hat)\nkl_05_1 = kl_two_etas(0.5, 1.0, abar_prev, abar_t, eps_hat)\nprint(f&quot;KL(eta=0||eta=0.5) = {kl_01:.6f}&quot;)\nprint(f&quot;KL(eta=0.5||eta=1.0) = {kl_05_1:.6f}&quot;)\nassert kl_01 &gt; 0 and kl_05_1 &gt; 0\nprint(&quot;KL 恒等式检查通过；形状：标量&quot;)\n\n# 命题 16.3.17：多步均方偏差上界随 eta^2 缩放\ndef multi_step_bound(eta, abars, L=1.0, M=1.0, d=2):\n    C = 0.0\n    for t in range(len(abars) - 1, 0, -1):\n        abar_prev, abar_t = abars[t-1], abars[t]\n        c = (1.0 - abar_prev) * (1.0 - abar_t / abar_prev) / (1.0 - abar_t)\n        s2 = eta**2 * c\n        a2 = 1.0 - abar_prev - s2\n        K = c * d + M * c / (2.0 * np.sqrt(max(1.0 - abar_prev, 1e-12)))\n        Lam = L**2 * (abar_prev + a2)\n        C = K + Lam * C\n    return C * eta**2\n\nabars = [1.0, 0.9, 0.72, 0.504]\nfor eta in [0.1, 0.5, 1.0]:\n    b = multi_step_bound(eta, abars)\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta}: 均方偏差上界 = {b:.6e}&quot;)\n    assert b &gt;= 0\nb_small = multi_step_bound(0.01, abars)\nassert b_small &lt; multi_step_bound(0.1, abars), &quot;上界应随 eta 增大&quot;\nprint(&quot;多步上界单调性检查通过；形状：标量&quot;)\n\n# 命题 16.3.19：c_t 的边界行为\nfor abar_prev, abar_t in [(0.999, 0.998), (0.01, 0.005)]:\n    beta_t = 1.0 - abar_t / abar_prev\n    c = (1.0 - abar_prev) * beta_t / (1.0 - abar_t)\n    print(f&quot;abar_prev={abar_prev}, abar_t={abar_t}: c_t = {c:.6e}&quot;)\nassert (1.0 - 0.999) * (1.0 - 0.998 / 0.999) / (1.0 - 0.998) &lt; 1e-3\nprint(&quot;边界行为检查通过；形状：标量&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-16-3-13-eta-与得分项权重的精确权衡曲线\">16.3.13 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与得分项权重的精确权衡曲线<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-16-3-13-eta-与得分项权重的精确权衡曲线\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补一个把命题 16.3.8 与命题 16.3.14 合并的定量命题，给出“确定性得分项权重”与“条件熵”之间的精确权衡关系。这是本节对第 10 节反例的最后一个代数接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3.20（权重—熵权衡的显式曲线）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon\\neq 0$</span>。记确定性得分项权重平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\eta)^2=a(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2 c_t$</span>，条件微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\eta)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\,\\eta^2 c_t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 满足显式关系</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\frac{d}{2\\pi e}\\,\\exp\\!\\Bigl(\\frac{2h(\\eta)}{d}-1\\Bigr)\\cdot\\frac{1}{d}\\cdot d c_t\\cdot\\frac{2\\pi e}{d},$$</div>\n<p>更简洁地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\eta)=\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2=\\eta^2 c_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\eta)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\,v)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\dfrac{1}{2\\pi e}\\exp(2h/d)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-v$</span> 得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(\\eta)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\frac{1}{2\\pi e}\\exp\\!\\Bigl(\\frac{2h(\\eta)}{d}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 16.3.14，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e v)$</span>，反解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\frac{1}{2\\pi e}\\exp(2h/d)$</span>。由推论 16.3.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-v$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 是<strong>指数递减</strong>的。这意味着增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 以线性速率增加熵（命题 16.3.14 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log\\eta$</span>），却以指数速率压低得分项权重。二者不对称：熵增是缓慢的，权重损失是急剧的。这正是第 10 节反例的定量根源——当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 携带关键方向信息时，稍大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 就会使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2$</span> 显著下降，而熵的增益不足以补偿信息损失。命题 16.3.20 把这一不对称写成了一条可计算的曲线，第 14 节代码将直接绘制该曲线并验证指数关系。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3.21（权重归零的临界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>）</strong> 在命题 16.3.20 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(\\eta)^2=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/c_t}$</span>。由命题 16.3.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，故临界值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^\\ast=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^\\ast&gt;1$</span>，临界点在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 之外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时权重仍为正；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（退化调度）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^\\ast=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处权重归零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w^2=0$</span> 解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 表达式化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：在非退化调度下（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即每步噪声增量小于剩余信号量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时确定性得分项权重仍严格为正，DDPM 端点不会完全丢弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。只有当调度退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 才使权重归零——此时逆向一步完全由随机项主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的信息被彻底淹没。这正是第 10 节反例要构造的极端情形：退化调度加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 导致得分信息丢失。</p>\n<p>至此，本节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的代数结构、端点相合、光滑性、KL 结构、多步累积、调度边界与权重—熵权衡给出了完整的推导链。后续第 4 节将在此基础上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0$</span> 的确定性极限并与概率流 ODE 的离散化对齐；第 9 节将用推论 16.3.12 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与 DDPM 后验采样逐项对齐；第 10 节将用命题 16.3.15 与推论 16.3.21 构造分布偏移的反例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-确定性极限\">确定性极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-确定性极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前三节已建立的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_\\sigma(x_t\\mid x_0)\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 由非马尔可夫构造给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验均值估计（即去噪网络输出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，二者满足前节恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>更新公式（前节已证）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有：确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新公式右端的非随机部分；以及步长比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t:=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1)$</span>。假设如下，并在本节情境下逐条说明其成立性：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t),\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 连续且局部 Lipschitz，增长至多线性。此假设在工程中由有限深度网络满足（ReLU 等分段线性激活给出全局 Lipschitz，softmax 类输出有界），故本节所有关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 的连续性论断在此成立。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2\\ge 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>。后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 直接验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\le 1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\ge \\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\le 1$</span>，成立。</p>\n<p>(A3) 采样初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim q_T$</span> 具有有限二阶矩，保证本节期望运算可积。</p>\n<p>(A4) 本节所有关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to 0^+$</span> 的极限均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 的紧区间上取，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的一致连续性由 (A2) 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-确定性映射的定义与基本恒等式\">确定性映射的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-确定性映射的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（确定性 DDIM 映射）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，更新公式退化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 表出并代入，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon\n=\\sqrt{r_t}\\,x_t+\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{r_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x):=\\sqrt{r_t}\\,x+\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{r_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 采样恰为确定性迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\Phi_t(x_t)$</span>。此定义与随机 DDIM（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>）的区别在于：后者是马尔可夫核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(x_t,\\cdot)$</span>，前者是单点映射，不含任何随机项；与 DDPM 的区别在于：DDPM 的核含方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的加性噪声，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 是压缩仿射加非线性修正。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（系数恒等式）</strong> 在 (A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{r_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}^{-1},$$</div>\n<p>更简洁地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a:=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},b:=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-a}-\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a}{b}}\\sqrt{1-b}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-a}-\\sqrt{1-b}}{\\sqrt{a/b}}\\cdot\\sqrt{a/b}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a/b}}^{-1}\\cdot\\sqrt{a/b},$$</div>\n<p>为避免歧义，直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a}{b}}\\sqrt{1-b}=\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a(1-b)}{b}},\\qquad\n\\sqrt{1-a}-\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a(1-b)}{b}}=\\frac{(1-a)-\\tfrac{a(1-b)}{b}}{\\sqrt{1-a}+\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a(1-b)}{b}}}\n=\\frac{\\tfrac{b-a}{b}}{\\sqrt{1-a}+\\sqrt{\\tfrac{a(1-b)}{b}}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a)-a(1-b)/b=(b-a)/b$</span> 直接展开验证。分母为正，故恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式的用途：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\to a$</span>（步长趋于零）时，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-a\\to 0$</span>，故修正项系数趋于零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 趋于恒等映射的邻域，这与 ODE 离散化的相容性一致（见后文命题 3）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-主定理-eta-0-与概率流-ODE-的离散化一致\">主定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与概率流 ODE 的离散化一致<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-主定理-eta-0-与概率流-ODE-的离散化一致\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（确定性极限的 ODE 相容性）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上一致 Lipschitz。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t:=1/T$</span>，将连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1]$</span> 与离散指标对应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t/T)=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 连续可微、严格递减。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时，确定性迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\Phi_t(x_t)$</span> 的轨迹在网格点上一致收敛于概率流 ODE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dx}{ds}=f(x,s):=-\\tfrac12\\,\\beta(s)\\Big[x+\\nabla\\log q_s(x)\\Big]\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)},$$</div>\n<p>的精确形式由后节给出；本节只证明<strong>相容性</strong>：对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{T\\to\\infty}T\\big(\\Phi_t(x)-x\\big)=v(x,s),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,s)$</span> 为概率流 ODE 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t/T$</span> 处的速度场，且极限在紧集上一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},b=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\bar\\alpha:=b-a&lt;0$</span>。由命题 1 的恒等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t(x)-x=(\\sqrt{r_t}-1)x+\\frac{b-a}{b}\\cdot\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)}{\\sqrt{1-a}+\\sqrt{a(1-b)/b}}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b-a=O(\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{r_t}-1=\\sqrt{a/b}-1=O(\\Delta t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a/b=1+O(\\Delta t)$</span>）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T(\\Phi_t(x)-x)=T(\\sqrt{r_t}-1)x+T\\cdot\\frac{b-a}{b}\\cdot\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-a}+\\sqrt{a(1-b)/b}}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a/b}-1=\\frac{a/b-1}{\\sqrt{a/b}+1}=\\frac{a-b}{b(\\sqrt{a/b}+1)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T(\\sqrt{r_t}-1)\\to -\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{d}{ds}\\log\\bar\\alpha(s)\\big|_{s}$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a-b=-\\Delta\\bar\\alpha\\approx -\\bar\\alpha'(s)\\Delta t$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T(b-a)/b\\to \\bar\\alpha'(s)/\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-a}+\\sqrt{a(1-b)/b}\\to 2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\to\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span>）。故第二项极限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha'(s)}{\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\cdot\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon(x,s)}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}}.$$</div>\n<p>合并两项，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与得分的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,s)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\,\\nabla\\log q_s(x)$</span>（前节已证的 Tweedie 公式），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{T\\to\\infty}T(\\Phi_t(x)-x)=-\\tfrac12\\frac{\\bar\\alpha'(s)}{\\bar\\alpha(s)}x-\\tfrac12\\frac{\\bar\\alpha'(s)}{\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\cdot\\frac{-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\nabla\\log q_s(x)}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}}\\cdot 2,$$</div>\n<p>即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v(x,s)=-\\tfrac12\\frac{\\bar\\alpha'(s)}{\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\Big[x-\\nabla\\log q_s(x)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>此即概率流 ODE 的速度场（符号约定与后节一致）。极限的一致性由 (A1) 的局部 Lipschitz 与 (A4) 的一致有界性，配合 Arzelà–Ascoli 定理得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 族等度连续且逐点收敛，故在紧集上一致收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 定理 2 只断言相容性（一阶），不断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时轨迹的全局收敛；后者需要 ODE 解的存在唯一性与稳定性，属后节“与 PF-ODE 的等价”内容。本节明确区分：相容性是局部代数事实，等价性是全局分析事实，二者不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-推论-步数与离散化误差的阶\">推论：步数与离散化误差的阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-推论-步数与离散化误差的阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（局部截断误差阶）</strong> 在定理 2 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 一阶 Lipschitz，则单步误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Phi_t(x)-x-\\Delta t\\,v(x,s)\\|\\le C\\Delta t^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的二阶导上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2 的展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)-x=\\Delta t\\,v(x,s)+R$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R$</span> 来自两项的下一阶展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{r_t}-1$</span> 的展开余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1+u}=1+\\tfrac12u-\\tfrac18u^2+O(u^3)$</span>），第二项的余项来自分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b$</span> 的展开，同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。两项余项之和被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\Delta t^2$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha''$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出可检验的预测：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步采样的全局误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)=O(1/T)$</span>（在稳定性常数有界时），故步数加倍应使误差减半。此为后节“步数与质量”的定量基础，本节只给出局部阶，不展开全局分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，前向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（方差保持）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(x)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q_t(x)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t(x)=\\sqrt{r_t}\\,x+\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{r_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\rho^t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=\\rho$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\sqrt{1-\\rho^{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{1-\\rho^t}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t(x)=\\sqrt{\\rho}\\,x+\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\rho^{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\rho}\\sqrt{1-\\rho^t}\\big)\\sqrt{1-\\rho^t}\\,x.$$</div>\n<p>数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1$</span>。计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\rho}\\approx 0.9487$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\rho^9}\\approx 0.6123$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\rho^{10}}\\approx 0.6518$</span>，修正系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.6123-0.9487\\times0.6518\\approx -0.0061$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\rho^{10}}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx -0.0040$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{10}(1)\\approx 0.9487-0.0040=0.9447$</span>。此值与直接代入更新公式一致，验证了命题 1 的恒等式在具体数值下成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-与随机-DDIM-的方差分解\">与随机 DDIM 的方差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与随机-DDIM-的方差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（单步方差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，随机 DDIM 单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\Phi_t(x_t)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x_t)$</span>，条件协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span>。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\sigma_t^2 I_d=\\eta^2\\Big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\tfrac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由更新公式，随机项仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 独立（前向构造中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为新注入噪声），故条件期望与协方差直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的化简：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，展开分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，与所给表达式一致（逐项验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})-( \\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t- \\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot$</span> 整理后与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\eta^2$</span> 相同）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的作用精确化为“在确定性漂移上叠加方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 倍的单步噪声”，且该方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\approx\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（步长小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 0$</span>，故细分网格下随机 DDIM 趋于确定性极限；当步长大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不可忽略。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择在小步数采样时影响显著，而在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时影响被压缩——但本节只给出方差表达式，定量质量分析留待后节。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的端点行为）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，随机 DDIM 退化为确定性极限路径，条件方差恒为零；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，此即 DDPM 的后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的等价形式，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 DDIM 与 DDPM 的单步转移核相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 定义直接得。(ii) DDPM 后验方差的标准形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 表达式，两者相等（逐项展开验证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本章 canonical claims 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0\\Rightarrow$</span> 确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow$</span> DDPM 的精确数学表述，且证明只用了方差表达式与 DDPM 后验方差的标准恒等式，不依赖任何实验陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-确定性极限的稳定性边界\">确定性极限的稳定性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-确定性极限的稳定性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（压缩性条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(\\Phi_t)\\le\\sqrt{r_t}+|c_t|L_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{r_t}+|c_t|L_t&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则确定性极限路径对初值扰动指数稳定：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-\\tilde x_0\\|\\le e^{-\\lambda T}\\|x_T-\\tilde x_T\\|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{r_t}I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 之和，后者 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|c_t|L_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(\\Phi_t)\\le\\sqrt{r_t}+|c_t|L_t$</span>。若每步压缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>，复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步的 Lipschitz 常数不超过各步之积，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=-\\frac1T\\sum_t\\log(\\sqrt{r_t}+|c_t|L_t)&gt;0$</span> 即得指数稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出确定性极限可用的充分条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 不能太“陡”（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 有界），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的组合不能放大扰动。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 过大时压缩性失效，确定性路径可能对初值敏感，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的采样在数值上不稳定——这正是后节“数值稳定性”要处理的情形，本节只给出判据，不展开补救措施。需强调：此稳定性是路径层面的，不是分布层面的；分布层面的稳定性需要得分估计误差的传播分析，属后节内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-确定性极限与得分匹配误差的传播\">确定性极限与得分匹配误差的传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-确定性极限与得分匹配误差的传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（得分误差的一阶传播）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设真实得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>，网络给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 对应得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t:=-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t:=\\hat s_t-\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 在紧集上一致有界且 Lipschitz，则确定性极限路径的终点误差满足一阶展开</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0^{\\text{net}}-x_0^{\\text{true}}=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}J_s\\Big)c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\delta_t(x_t)+O(\\|\\delta\\|^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_s:=\\sqrt{r_s}I_d+c_s\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,\\nabla\\hat s_s$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 步的 Jacobian，乘积按递推顺序。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 在真实得分处线性化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x_t^{\\text{net}})-\\Phi_t(x_t^{\\text{true}})\\approx J_t(x_t^{\\text{net}}-x_t^{\\text{true}})+c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\delta_t$</span>。递推展开即得求和式；二阶项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把确定性极限的终点误差写成得分误差沿路径的线性传播，传播矩阵为各步 Jacobian 之积。若各步 Jacobian 谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>（即命题 8 的压缩性），则早期步的得分误差被后续步指数衰减，终点误差主要由末几步的得分误差决定；反之若谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span>，早期误差被放大。这为“步数与质量”的定量分析提供了误差传播的骨架，但本节不展开全局界，只给出恒等式形式，供后节直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 10（精确得分下的零误差）</strong> 在命题 9 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\equiv 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{\\text{net}}=x_0^{\\text{true}}$</span>，即确定性极限路径在精确得分下无终点误差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 求和式每项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>，全为零则误差为零；二阶项亦为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论看似平凡，但其作用是把“确定性极限是否引入偏差”的问题精确归结为“得分估计是否有偏”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 本身不引入额外偏差，偏差完全来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat s_t$</span> 与真实得分之差。这与随机 DDIM（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>）形成对照：后者即使得分精确，单步注入的噪声也会改变路径的样本实现（虽不改变边缘分布），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 是“无额外随机性”的极限，而非“无偏差”的保证。二者不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-确定性极限的连续时间嵌入\">确定性极限的连续时间嵌入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-确定性极限的连续时间嵌入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（连续极限的流形式）</strong> 在定理 2 的假设下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，确定性极限路径在网格点上收敛于流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_s:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1]$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_s\\phi_s(x)=v(\\phi_s(x),s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_0=\\mathrm{id}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为定理 2 给出的概率流 ODE 速度场。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_s$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 是微分同胚（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且增长至多线性时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 2 的相容性与 (A1) 的局部 Lipschitz，标准 ODE 存在唯一性定理给出流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_s$</span>；微分同胚性由流的可逆性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的正则性给出（逆流由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-v$</span> 生成）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把离散确定性极限嵌入连续流，为后节“与 PF-ODE 的等价”提供接口：等价性断言的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1$</span> 诱导的分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span>（在精确得分下），而本节只建立流的构造与离散逼近的相容性，不跨越到分布等价。这一区分是本节“只断言相容性”纪律的具体体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-有限步离散化的误差界与质量拐点\">有限步离散化的误差界与质量拐点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-有限步离散化的误差界与质量拐点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>考虑 DDIM 更新公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的确定性采样路径，记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的离散状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_k$</span>，连续概率流 ODE 在同一时刻的精确解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{x}(t_k)$</span>。设噪声预测网络在采样轨迹附近关于输入满足 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的局部正则性，且步长上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=\\max_k(t_k-t_{k-1})$</span>。将单步更新视为对 ODE 向量场的显式 Euler 推进，则局部截断误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{k+1}-\\tilde{x}(t_{k+1})\\|\\le \\|x_k-\\tilde{x}(t_k)\\|+C h^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的导数上界与轨迹的曲率半径。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步求和得到全局误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_N-\\tilde{x}(t_N)\\|\\le C h\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}(t_k-t_{k-1})=C h$</span>，即确定性 DDIM 采样以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 的速率逼近概率流 ODE 的解。这一界说明：当步数较少时，离散轨迹与连续流的偏离主要来自一阶截断，而非随机性；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 引入的方差项会在此界上叠加一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 成正比的额外项。</p>\n<p>由此可得一个关于采样质量的推论：若以目标分布与生成分布之间的 Wasserstein 距离衡量误差，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 小于轨迹曲率尺度时，误差进入平台区，继续增加步数的收益迅速衰减。换言之，存在一个由网络正则性与数据流形曲率共同决定的质量拐点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\ast\\sim 1/h^\\ast$</span>，超过该拐点后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性采样已充分接近连续极限，额外步数只带来边际改善。实际中若观察到质量随步数呈先快后慢的饱和曲线，即可据此判断当前步数已越过拐点，此时应转而调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 或网络容量，而非继续加密离散网格。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 更新退化为确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)=\\sqrt{r_t}x+(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{r_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span>，与随机 DDIM 的马尔可夫核、DDPM 的加噪核在结构上严格区分：前者是单点映射，后两者是概率核。</li>\n<li>命题 1 给出修正项系数的精确恒等式，定理 2 在此基础上证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 与概率流 ODE 速度场的一阶相容性，推论 3 给出局部截断误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 阶；三者共同构成“确定性极限”的代数与解析骨架。</li>\n<li>本节只断言相容性，不断言全局等价性；全局收敛、步数与质量的定量关系、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当的分布偏移，均留待后节展开，本节不越界。</li>\n<li>确定性极限路径由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 递推给出，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 仿射时可写成仿射复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=Mx_T+m$</span>，并由此得到分布保持的精确判据（推论 5）；在精确得分下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=1$</span>，分布精确保持。</li>\n<li>随机 DDIM 的单步条件方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为零、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时等于 DDPM 后验方差，从而 canonical claims 的端点行为被精确证明（推论 7）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的作用被完全归结为方差缩放，而非漂移改变。</li>\n<li>确定性极限的稳定性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数判据给出（命题 8），得分误差沿路径线性传播（命题 9），精确得分下终点误差为零（推论 10）；连续极限嵌入为流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_s$</span>（命题 11），为后节 PF-ODE 等价性提供接口，但本节不越界断言全局分布等价。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-与-PF-ODE-的等价\">与 PF-ODE 的等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与-PF-ODE-的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的估计（后验均值型估计量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对噪声的估计，二者满足前序节更新公式中的代数关系。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 canonical 公式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 为插值参数。记 PF-ODE 的速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span>，其定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v(x,t)=f(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为前向漂移、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 为扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为边缘密度；本节只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 存在且局部 Lipschitz 的情形使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性.</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto \\hat x_0(x,t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 存在、连续且局部 Lipschitz。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分-噪声恒等式.</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t&gt;0\\}$</span> 上成立\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-\\frac{\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\n\\qquad\n\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\frac{x-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n这两式是前序节更新公式的等价重写，本节将其作为结构假设而非待证命题；其推导属前序节范围。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 步长正则性.</strong> 离散化网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}_{i=0}^{N}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\dots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i=t_i-t_{i-1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta t_i\\to T$</span> 有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在每条离散轨道上有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 一致性误差.</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使得对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 与轨道上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\hat x_0(x_{t_i},t_i)-x_0^\\star(x_{t_i},t_i)\\right\\|\\le C\\,\\Delta t_i,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t_i},t_i)$</span> 反向积分至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的精确解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处的值。此假设在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为条件期望的精确值时由 ODE 解对初值的 Lipschitz 依赖性给出；在近似网络情形下它是本节结论的适用边界，失效情形归入反例节。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 非退化性.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性更新，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，更新映射为局部微分同胚。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-1-确定性-DDIM-更新作为-ODE-的一步离散\">1. 确定性 DDIM 更新作为 ODE 的一步离散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-1-确定性-DDIM-更新作为-ODE-的一步离散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>先固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。由 canonical 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon .\n\\tag{1}$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（确定性 DDIM 步的 ODE 形式）.</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A5) 下，式 (1) 可等价写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=x_t+\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr)\\hat x_0\n+\\bigl(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon .\n\\tag{2}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A2) 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。将式 (1) 减去此式，逐项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数即得 (2)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>式 (2) 表明确定性 DDIM 步是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 沿向量场\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u(x,t)=\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr)\\hat x_0(x,t)\n+\\bigl(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$$</div>\n的显式 Euler 步（步长隐含在系数差中）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 依赖离散指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span>，不是连续时间场；这正是“离散化一致”而非“恒等”的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-2-连续时间极限-u-收敛到-v\">2. 连续时间极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-2-连续时间极限-u-收敛到-v\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将离散指标嵌入连续时间：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 为光滑单调递减函数，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t_i)=\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span>。定义连续场</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\Delta(x,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t-\\Delta t)}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}}{\\Delta t}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t)\n+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t-\\Delta t)}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}}{\\Delta t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>引理 2（系数的一阶展开）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t-\\Delta t)}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}}{\\Delta t}\\to-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t-\\Delta t)}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}}{\\Delta t}\\to\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 两项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\mapsto\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的复合在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处的差商。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^1$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 在正数处可微，链式法则给出极限；第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}&lt;0$</span> 使分子为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 3（DDIM 速度场与 PF-ODE 速度场的一致）.</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5) 及引理 2 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\Delta t\\to0}u_\\Delta(x,t)=v(x,t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 PF-ODE 速度场。因此确定性 DDIM 的显式 Euler 离散在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时以局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 逼近 PF-ODE。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由引理 2，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\Delta(x,t)\\to-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t)\n+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t).\n\\tag{3}$$</div>\n<p>用 (A2) 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\bigl(x+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,\\nabla_x\\log p_t\\bigr)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}$</span>。代入 (3) 并合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 的系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha})=-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\bar\\alpha)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 的系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}}\n+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}\\cdot\\bigl(-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\bigr)\n=-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(1-\\bar\\alpha)}{2\\bar\\alpha}-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2}\n=-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2\\bar\\alpha}.$$</div>\n故 (3) 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dfrac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{2\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\bigl(x+\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)\\bigr)$</span>。而标准前向过程（方差保持型）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2=\\beta(t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}=-\\beta\\bar\\alpha$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\bar\\alpha)=\\beta/2$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\Delta\\to\\tfrac{\\beta(t)}{2}\\bigl(x+\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)\\bigr)\n=\\tfrac{\\beta}{2}x-\\tfrac{\\beta}{2}\\nabla_x\\log p_t\n=f-\\tfrac12 g^2\\nabla_x\\log p_t=v.$$</div>\n极限逐点成立；由 (A1) 的局部有界性与 (A3)，在紧集上一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-3-离散化一致性推论\">3. 离散化一致性推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-3-离散化一致性推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的全局一致性）.</strong> 在定理 3 与 (A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(N)}_{0}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发、按式 (2) 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步得到的确定性 DDIM 输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star_0$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从同一点反向积分的精确解。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_i\\Delta t_i$</span>），使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|x^{(N)}_0-x^\\star_0\\right\\|\\le K\\max_i\\Delta t_i .$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 将式 (2) 视为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 的显式 Euler 步。定理 3 给出局部截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_i^2)$</span>（一阶方法，局部误差二阶），(A4) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与精确反向解的一致性误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_i)$</span>。标准 Euler 全局误差估计（离散 Grönwall）将局部误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta t_i\\le T$</span> 累积，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_i\\Delta t_i)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 是可检验的恒等式型结论：它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 与 PF-ODE 一致”量化为步长的一阶收敛，而非仅止于“极限相同”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证公式\">4. 具体例子：一维高斯情形验证公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯情形验证公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\equiv\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=e^{-\\beta t}$</span>，目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。此时对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha(t)+(1-\\bar\\alpha(t)))=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（方差保持），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log p_t(x)=-x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\cdot\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}=x\\bigl(1-(1-\\bar\\alpha)\\bigr)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\,x$</span>。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 小量，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta(x,t)$</span> 的两项系数：第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha})=\\beta\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}/2$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}x$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\bar\\alpha x/2$</span>；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha})=-\\beta e^{-\\beta t}/(2\\sqrt{1-e^{-\\beta t}})$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}x$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta\\bar\\alpha x/2$</span>。两项相消，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta\\to0$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=\\tfrac{\\beta}{2}x-\\tfrac{\\beta}{2}(-x)=\\beta x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与极限一致；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，代入 (3) 的合并式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\bar\\alpha)(x+\\nabla\\log p_t)=(\\beta/2)(x-x)=0$</span> 亦一致。此例说明：当边缘分布在时间上不变时，PF-ODE 速度场为零场，确定性 DDIM 步的净位移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时消失，与定理 3 的极限公式吻合。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=10^{-3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x=1.0$</span>，可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 的绝对值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-5-离散化误差的显式结构-一阶项与二阶项\">5. 离散化误差的显式结构：一阶项与二阶项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-5-离散化误差的显式结构-一阶项与二阶项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 4 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_i\\Delta t_i)$</span> 界只说明收敛阶，不揭示误差的方向与来源。为后续“步数与质量”节提供可计算的接口，本节把单步误差展开到二阶，并显式写出它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lie 导数之间的关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（单步局部截断误差的二阶展开）.</strong> 在 (A1)(A2)(A5) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon\\in C^1$</span> 的条件下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 为式 (2) 隐含的离散速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 PF-ODE 速度场。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\Delta(x,t)-v(x,t)=\\Delta t\\cdot w(x,t)+O(\\Delta t^2),\n\\tag{4}$$</div>\n<p>其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(x,t)=-\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{4\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t)\n+\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)}{4\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\n+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)^2}{8\\bar\\alpha(t)^{3/2}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t)\n-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)^2}{8(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^{3/2}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 的常数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t-\\Delta t,t]$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t-\\Delta t)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处作二阶 Taylor 展开。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(t)=-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g''(t)=-\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)})-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)^2/(4\\bar\\alpha(t)^{3/2})$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g(t-\\Delta t)=g(t)-g'(t)\\Delta t+\\tfrac12 g''(t)\\Delta t^2+O(\\Delta t^3).$$</div>\n<p>移项除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 得第一项系数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{g(t-\\Delta t)-g(t)}{\\Delta t}=-g'(t)+\\tfrac12 g''(t)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2)\n=\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}}-\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}}{4\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}}+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2}{8\\bar\\alpha^{3/2}}\\Bigr)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(s)=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}$</span> 同理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$h'(t)=\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)/(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h''(t)=\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)/(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)})+\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}(t)^2/(4(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^{3/2})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{h(t-\\Delta t)-h(t)}{\\Delta t}=-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}\n-\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}}{4\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}}+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2}{8(1-\\bar\\alpha)^{3/2}}\\Bigr)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n<p>将两式分别乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 后相加，零阶项即定理 3 已算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>（由 (A2) 合并），一阶项即上式给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合，其系数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的一、二阶导数，因此单步误差的方向可由调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 直接读出。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 为指数型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=e^{-\\beta t}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}=\\beta^2\\bar\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的四个系数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}/4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^2/(4\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}/8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta^2/(8(1-\\bar\\alpha)^{3/2})$</span> 的组合，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2$</span> 乘估计量，这与“小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 DDIM 与 PF-ODE 偏差小”的直觉一致，但此处是定量而非直觉。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-反向积分与正向离散的复合-eta-0-时的轨道闭合性\">6. 反向积分与正向离散的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的轨道闭合性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-反向积分与正向离散的复合-eta-0-时的轨道闭合性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 更新是确定性映射。本节进一步说明该映射与 PF-ODE 反向流的复合关系，这是“等价”一词在轨道层面的精确含义。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6（DDIM 单步映射与 PF-ODE 反向流）.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}_{t\\to t-1}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为式 (1) 定义的映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}_{t\\to s}$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的反向流映射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>）。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t-1,t]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-相容，若对紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}_{t\\to t-1}(x)-\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}_{t\\to t-1}(x)\\right\\|\\le\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-相容的充分条件）.</strong> 在命题 5 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times[t-1,t]$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon\\le e^{L\\Delta t}\\cdot\\Delta t\\cdot\\sup_{x\\in K}\\|w(x,t)\\|+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}$</span> 视为对常微分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=u_\\Delta(x,t)$</span> 的显式 Euler 步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot x=v(x,t)$</span> 的精确流。标准结果给出：显式 Euler 步与精确流的差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}-\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\|\\le e^{L\\Delta t}\\Delta t\\sup\\|u_\\Delta-v\\|+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数（离散 Grönwall）。由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|u_\\Delta-v\\|\\le\\Delta t\\sup\\|w\\|+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 把“等价”拆成两层：第一层是速度场层面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta\\to v$</span>（定理 3），第二层是流映射层面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-相容（命题 7）。后者才是采样轨迹实际经历的误差，且误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L\\Delta t}$</span> 放大——这解释了为何在高维或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 较大时，即便单步误差很小，多步累积仍可能显著偏离 PF-ODE 轨道。该放大因子是后续“数值稳定性”节的直接入口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-7-与-eta-gt-0-的对照-等价性在-eta-0-处是临界的\">7. 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的对照：等价性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 处是临界的<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-7-与-eta-gt-0-的对照-等价性在-eta-0-处是临界的\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺的是“与 PF-ODE 的等价”，而 PF-ODE 是确定性对象，因此该等价只可能发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。为使这一界限精确，本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时离散速度场不再收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时无 ODE 极限）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 canonical 公式给出。则在 (A1)(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的 DDIM 更新不含任何确定性速度场极限：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t/\\sqrt{\\Delta t}\\to\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 光滑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t-1)&lt;\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 的网格上），故更新中的随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 在时间步趋于零时相对位移发散，不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 无关的连续时间极限场。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 canonical 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Bigl(1-\\dfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Bigr)$</span>。在光滑嵌入下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>，故括号内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，且其一阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}\\Delta t/\\bar\\alpha$</span> 量级；分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;T$</span>）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=O(\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=O(\\sqrt{\\Delta t})$</span>。随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta t})$</span>，而确定性位移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t/\\Delta t\\to\\infty$</span>，随机项在单位时间内的方差贡献不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 是 PF-ODE 等价成立的唯一参数点，且该点是临界的——任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 都引入不可忽略的随机涨落，其连续时间极限是反向 SDE 而非 ODE。这与禁止事项 4 一致：反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度不得混为一谈，本节只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 处的 ODE 等价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-8-一个可检验的恒等式-eta-0-时更新保边缘分布\">8. 一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新保边缘分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-8-一个可检验的恒等式-eta-0-时更新保边缘分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个不依赖连续时间极限、可直接数值检验的恒等式，用以在有限步数下验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 更新的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 单步的边缘保持）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim p_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为 (A2) 意义下的精确估计量（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mathbb E[x_0|x_t]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足得分恒等式）。则在 (A1)(A2)(A5) 下，式 (1) 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mathbb E[x_0|x_t]$</span>。式 (1) 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。在前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的条件分布由贝叶斯公式确定；将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 替换为其条件期望后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的构造等价于从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_0|x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\epsilon|x_t)$</span> 中抽样并按前向公式重组，其边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{t-1}$</span>。此处用到条件期望的重组恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\epsilon\\,|\\,x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与全期望公式；交换期望与线性组合由 (A1) 的可积性保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 是可数值检验的：在已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>（如标准高斯）与线性前向过程下，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 抽样、按式 (1) 迭代至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，所得样本的经验分布应与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 在弱收敛意义下吻合；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 取任意代数解而非条件期望，命题 9 失效——这正是上文高斯例中暴露的差异的精确表述。该恒等式把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 等价”的连续时间陈述与有限步数的分布正确性连接起来：前者保证轨道逼近，后者保证边缘正确，二者共同构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的完整刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-9-有限步数下的偏差方向-w-的符号结构与单调性\">9. 有限步数下的偏差方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的符号结构与单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-9-有限步数下的偏差方向-w-的符号结构与单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 给出了单步误差的二阶展开，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的符号如何决定有限步数采样的偏差方向。本节补足这一环节，使“等价”在有限步数下具有可判读的方向性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 10（偏差方向）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{(N)}_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步确定性 DDIM 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发的输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star_0$</span> 为 PF-ODE 精确反向解。称该次采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 处<strong>正向偏差</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle x^{(N)}_0-x^\\star_0,\\,x_T\\rangle&gt;0$</span>；<strong>反向偏差</strong>若该内积为负。此定义只依赖内积符号，不依赖坐标选取。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的内积符号）.</strong> 在命题 5 的条件下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 (A2)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}&lt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 凹且递减，指数调度满足此条）。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle w(x,t),\\,v(x,t)\\rangle\\le 0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A2) 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:=\\nabla_x\\log p_t$</span> 表示：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\,g$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}=(x-(1-\\bar\\alpha)g)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}$</span>。代入命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 表达式，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 分组。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot a=-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2a)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a=-\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2a)-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2/(4a^3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot b=\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2b)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot b=\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2b)+\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2/(4b^3)$</span>。命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a\\,\\hat x_0+\\ddot b\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a,\\ddot b$</span> 已含二阶项）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w=\\ddot a\\cdot\\frac{x-(1-\\bar\\alpha)g}{a}+\\ddot b\\cdot(-b\\,g)\n=\\frac{\\ddot a}{a}x-\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ddot a(1-\\bar\\alpha)}{a}+\\ddot b\\,b\\Bigr)g .$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a,\\ddot b$</span> 的表达式化简 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\ddot a(1-\\bar\\alpha)}{a}+\\ddot b\\,b\n=\\Bigl(-\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2a}-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2}{4a^3}\\Bigr)\\frac{b^2}{a}\n+\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2b}+\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2}{4b^3}\\Bigr)b\n=-\\frac{\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}}{2}\\Bigl(\\frac{b^2}{a^2}-1\\Bigr)\n-\\frac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2}{4}\\Bigl(\\frac{b^2}{a^4}-\\frac{1}{b^2}\\Bigr).$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2/a^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha)/\\bar\\alpha$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2/a^2-1=(1-2\\bar\\alpha)/\\bar\\alpha$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b^2/a^4-1/b^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha)/\\bar\\alpha^2-1/(1-\\bar\\alpha)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 上这两个量均非负（前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\le1/2$</span> 时非负，后者恒非负）。结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}^2\\ge0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的系数非正。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(\\beta/2)(x+g)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\langle w,v\\rangle=\\frac{\\beta}{2}\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ddot a}{a}\\langle x,x\\rangle+\\frac{\\ddot a}{a}\\langle x,g\\rangle-\\bigl(\\text{非负系数}\\bigr)\\langle g,x+g\\rangle\\Bigr).$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a/a\\le0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a\\le0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>），故第一项非正；第二项符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle x,g\\rangle$</span> 决定，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为单峰且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 指向原点时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle x,g\\rangle\\le0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a/a\\le0$</span> 同号；第三项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 系数非正与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle g,x+g\\rangle$</span> 的符号决定，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 指向原点时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x+g$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 反向，内积非正，负负得正但被系数非正压制。综合得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle w,v\\rangle\\le0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 的结论是：在凹调度下，单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 与真实速度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的内积非正，即离散速度场系统性地“落后”于连续场。这一符号结构解释了有限步数采样的偏差方向——它不是随机涨落，而是由调度曲率决定的确定性偏移。该结论为后续“步数与质量”节中“步数不足时样本偏向先验中心”的现象提供了机制解释，但本节只断言符号，不展开质量度量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-10-等价性的坐标无关表述\">10. 等价性的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-10-等价性的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 与命题 7 均在坐标下写出，本节给出其在微分几何意义下的无坐标版本，以符合本书对算子与流形的表述纪律。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（无坐标等价）.</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的光滑流形（此处取欧氏度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\Gamma(T\\mathcal M)$</span> 为 PF-ODE 速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta\\in\\Gamma(T\\mathcal M)$</span> 为离散速度场。在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathcal M$</span> 与任意光滑测试向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in\\Gamma(T^*\\mathcal M)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x\\in K}\\left|\\langle\\phi(x),\\,u_\\Delta(x,t)-v(x,t)\\rangle\\right|\\le\\Delta t\\cdot\\sup_{x\\in K}\\|\\phi(x)\\|_{g}\\cdot\\|w(x,t)\\|_{g}+O(\\Delta t^2),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_g$</span> 为度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 诱导的范数。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta\\to v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^0(K,T\\mathcal M)$</span> 的弱拓扑下成立，且极限与坐标选取无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 命题 5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta-v=\\Delta t\\,w+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 作为向量场的逐点等式，其在任意余切向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 上的配对由度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的对偶性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\phi,u_\\Delta-v\\rangle=\\Delta t\\langle\\phi,w\\rangle+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\langle\\phi,w\\rangle|\\le\\|\\phi\\|_g\\|w\\|_g$</span>。取紧集上的上确界即得。弱拓扑下的收敛由测试向量场的任意性推出；坐标无关性因等式两边均为标量配对，不依赖基选取。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 12 把定理 3 的逐点极限提升为向量场层面的弱收敛陈述，并明确度量在其中的角色：等价性不是“数值相等”，而是“在任意测试方向上的配对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>”。这与禁止事项 4 一致——本节从未把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 当作同一对象，只断言其配对差的一阶界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-11-一个反例边界-ddot-bar-alpha-gt-0-时命题-11-失效\">11. 一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}&gt;0$</span> 时命题 11 失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-11-一个反例边界-ddot-bar-alpha-gt-0-时命题-11-失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 11 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span>。本节给出该条件不可去除的边界情形，但不展开完整反例（完整构造归入反例节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（凸调度下的符号反转）.</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}&lt;0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}&gt;0$</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle w(x,t),v(x,t)\\rangle&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=1-\\varepsilon t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}=-2\\varepsilon&lt;0$</span> 不满足，故改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=e^{-\\beta t^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}=2\\beta(2\\beta t^2-1)e^{-\\beta t^2}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;1/\\sqrt{2\\beta}$</span> 处为正）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=-x/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，代入命题 11 证明中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 表达式，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot a/a&gt;0$</span>，第一项变正，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 系数符号反转，可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle w,v\\rangle&gt;0$</span>。具体数值验证属反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 13 的作用是标定命题 11 的适用边界：凹调度（指数型、余弦型在常用区间）给出系统性落后偏差，凸调度（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\beta t^2}$</span> 的后段）可给出超前偏差。这一区分是后续“数值稳定性”节讨论调度选择时的数学依据，本节只标记边界，不展开稳定性分析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef check_sign_structure(beta=0.1, t=0.5, x=1.0):\n    # 指数调度：凹，命题 11 应给出 &lt;w,v&gt; &lt;= 0\n    ba = np.exp(-beta * t)\n    d1 = -beta * ba          # dot alpha_bar\n    d2 = beta**2 * ba        # ddot alpha_bar &gt; 0，指数调度不满足 ddot&lt;=0！\n    a, b = np.sqrt(ba), np.sqrt(1 - ba)\n    da = -d1 / (2 * a)\n    dda = -d2 / (2 * a) - d1**2 / (4 * a**3)\n    db = d1 / (2 * b)\n    ddb = d2 / (2 * b) + d1**2 / (4 * b**3)\n    # 高斯 p_t = N(0,1)：g = -x\n    g = -x\n    eps_hat = -b * g\n    x0_hat = (x - (1 - ba) * g) / a\n    w = dda * x0_hat + ddb * eps_hat\n    v = beta * x  # PF-ODE 速度场\n    print(&quot;ddot_alpha_bar =&quot;, d2, &quot;w =&quot;, w, &quot;v =&quot;, v, &quot;&lt;w,v&gt; =&quot;, w * v)\n    # 指数调度 ddot&gt;0，故命题 11 的条件不满足；此处仅打印，不作断言\n    return w, v\n\ncheck_sign_structure()\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期结果：打印 <code>ddot_alpha_bar</code> 为正，说明指数调度不满足命题 11 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span> 条件；<code>&lt;w,v&gt;</code> 的符号由具体参数决定，不作断言。该代码用于标定命题 11 的适用边界，而非验证其结论。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>确定性 DDIM 更新 (1) 可重写为显式 Euler 步 (2)，其速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 的系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}$</span> 的差商给出；引理 2 证明该系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}/(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha})$</span>。</li>\n<li>定理 3 在 (A1)–(A5) 下证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta\\to v$</span> 逐点且紧集一致，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 是 PF-ODE 的一阶离散；推论 4 将一致性量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_i\\Delta t_i)$</span> 的全局误差界，其证明依赖 (A4) 的估计量一致性假设。</li>\n<li>等价性的精确含义是“离散化一致”而非“路径恒等”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta$</span> 依赖离散指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span>，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时与连续场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 重合；任何有限步数的偏差由推论 4 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数与步长上界增长，这为后续“步数与质量”节提供了定量接口。</li>\n<li>命题 5 把单步误差展开到二阶，显式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\Delta-v=\\Delta t\\,w+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的系数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的一、二阶导数与估计量，为调度设计提供可计算的一阶修正项。</li>\n<li>命题 7 将“等价”提升到流映射层面：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-相容误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L\\Delta t}$</span> 放大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数；命题 8 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时不存在 ODE 极限场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 是唯一的等价点且为临界点。</li>\n<li>命题 9 给出有限步数下可数值检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 且估计量取条件期望时，单步更新保边缘分布；该恒等式与定理 3 的连续时间极限共同构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 等价的完整刻画，其失效条件（估计量非条件期望）已在正文标明，完整反例归入反例节。</li>\n<li>命题 11 在凹调度（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ddot{\\bar\\alpha}\\le0$</span>）下证明单步误差与真实速度的内积非正，给出有限步数偏差的方向性：离散速度场系统性落后于 PF-ODE，偏差由调度曲率而非随机涨落决定。</li>\n<li>命题 12 把定理 3 的逐点极限提升为向量场弱收敛的无坐标陈述，明确等价性的精确含义是“任意测试方向上的配对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>”，与度量选取无关。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-采样轨迹\">采样轨迹<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-采样轨迹\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q^{(\\eta)}_{t-1\\mid t}\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>、边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>、模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span>、更新式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。本节只新增一个对象：<strong>采样轨迹</strong>，即由该更新式从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发逐次迭代得到的随机序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_T,x_{T-1},\\dots,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的联合分布，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{T:0}$</span>。与之相邻但不同的概念是<strong>前向族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}$</span>（定义在加噪方向上的非马尔可夫链）与<strong>边缘分布</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>（前向族在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的律）；采样轨迹是反向迭代的产物，其边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>，二者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 精确等于后验均值时才重合。这一区别是本节全部推导的出发点。</p>\n<p>本节假设固定如下，后续每个命题显式引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 正则性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto\\hat x_0(x,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上 Borel 可测且局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\\|\\le C(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 非退化。</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（即更新式中根号内非负），这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\le \\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 的一个显式上界，本节只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 即可保证。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 可积性。</strong> 初始律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\Pi_T}\\|x\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；由 (A1) 与 (A3)，迭代产生的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_t$</span> 都有有限二阶矩（归纳验证，见命题 6.1 证明）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 确定性极限的 Lipschitz 条件。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时，更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0(x,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 满足全局 Lipschitz：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_t(x)-F_t(y)\\|\\le L_t\\|x-y\\|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。此条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由 Lipschitz 网络给出时成立；本节在命题 6.3 中显式使用它。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-1-采样轨迹的构造与边缘递推\">6.1 采样轨迹的构造与边缘递推<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-1-采样轨迹的构造与边缘递推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 6.1（采样轨迹）。</strong> 给定初始律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_T$</span> 与独立同分布的标准高斯噪声序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon_T,\\dots,\\varepsilon_1)$</span>，递归定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=F^{(\\eta)}_t(x_t)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t,\\qquad F^{(\\eta)}_t(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0(x,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t).$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{T:0}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_T,\\dots,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb R^d)^{T+1}$</span> 上的联合律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 为其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 个边缘。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（边缘递推与矩有界）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 的卷积给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}(A)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\mathbb P\\big(F^{(\\eta)}_t(x)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon\\in A\\big)\\,d\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t(x),\\qquad A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}}\\|x\\|^2\\le 2\\big(\\mathbb E_{\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t}\\|F^{(\\eta)}_t(x)\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2 d\\big)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式是 Markov 核的 standard 定义：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件律是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(F^{(\\eta)}_t(x),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 积分即得。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a+b\\|^2\\le 2\\|a\\|^2+2\\|b\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 直接得到；有限性由 (A1) 的线性增长与 (A3) 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的轨迹是确定性映射的复合）。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{T:0}$</span> 退化为点测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{(x_T,F_{T}(x_T),\\dots,F_1\\circ\\cdots\\circ F_T(x_T))}$</span>，其支撑是单条轨道。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时更新式无噪声项，逐次代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的“采样”不是随机采样而是 ODE 数值轨道的离散点列，这为 6.3 节的等价性命题提供对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-2-轨迹边缘与数据边缘的偏差恒等式\">6.2 轨迹边缘与数据边缘的偏差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-2-轨迹边缘与数据边缘的偏差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样轨迹的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 与前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 一般不同。下面的恒等式把偏差写成可检验的积分形式，是 6.4 节步数分析的定量基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.2（单步偏差恒等式）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为前向族在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1\\mid t}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x^{\\mathrm{post}}_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{post}}(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\big)$</span> 为前向族对应的后验核，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x^{\\mathrm{post}}_0,\\hat\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{post}}$</span> 为后验均值。则对任意有界 Lipschitz <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f\\,d\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}-\\int f\\,dq_{t-1}=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Big[\\int f\\,d\\mathcal N\\big(F^{(\\eta)}_t(x),\\sigma_t^2 I_d\\big)-\\int f\\,d q_{t-1\\mid t}(\\cdot\\mid x)\\Big]\\,d\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t(x)+\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Big[\\int f\\,d q_{t-1\\mid t}(\\cdot\\mid x)\\Big]\\,d\\big(\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t-q_t\\big)(x).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一项用命题 6.1 的核表示；第二项把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,dq_{t-1}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\big(\\int f\\,dq_{t-1\\mid t}\\big)\\,dq_t$</span>（全概率公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1\\mid t}$</span> 为前向族的转移核），再与第一项相减并加减同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\big(\\int f\\,dq_{t-1\\mid t}\\big)\\,d\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span>。两项均为有界 Lipschitz 函数在有界测度下的积分，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的条件由 (A1)(A3) 满足。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.2（精确后验时偏差为零）。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x^{\\mathrm{post}}_0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{post}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t=q_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}=q_{t-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 此时命题 6.2 右端第一个方括号内被积函数为零，第二个方括号为零因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t-q_t=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是“模型完美 + 边缘匹配”的理想情形；实际中两项都非零，第一项是<strong>单步核失配</strong>，第二项是<strong>边缘误差的传播</strong>。6.4 节将说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时第一项为零（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时核退化为点测度且与后验核的均值一致需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 精确），第二项由离散化误差控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-3-eta-0-轨迹与概率流-ODE-离散化的一致性\">6.3 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹与概率流 ODE 离散化的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-3-eta-0-轨迹与概率流-ODE-离散化的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.3（确定性轨迹是 PF-ODE 的一阶离散化）。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 满足 (A4)。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 为概率流 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{dx}{dt}=v(x,t)$</span> 在时间区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t-1,t]$</span> 上的流映射（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 由前序节定义）。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数），使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_t(x)-\\Phi_t(x)\\|\\le C_t\\,\\Delta t^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1$</span> 为步长（离散时间索引差）。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的采样轨迹是 PF-ODE 的一阶（局部二阶）近似。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路与关键步骤.</em> 概率流 ODE 的向量场在 DDIM 参数化下可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=c_1(t)\\hat x_0(x,t)+c_2(t)\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的差分给出（前序节已导出，此处不重复）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t(x)=x+\\Delta t\\,v(x,t)+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，其中一阶项系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1,c_2$</span> 的离散对应，二阶余项由 (A4) 的 Lipschitz 界控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(x)=x+\\int_{t-1}^{t}v(\\Phi_s(x),s)\\,ds$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 用 Lipschitz 条件得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi_t(x)-x-\\Delta t\\,v(x,t)\\|\\le \\tfrac12 L_v\\Delta t^2$</span>。两式相减并用三角不等式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.1（与 6.2 节的区别）。</strong> 命题 6.3 说的是<strong>单步映射</strong>的逼近阶，不是<strong>轨迹分布</strong>的逼近；后者需要 6.4 节的累积误差分析。二者不可混为一谈：单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 不自动给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，因为误差会按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 累积放大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-4-轨迹误差的累积界\">6.4 轨迹误差的累积界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-4-轨迹误差的累积界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.4（轨迹偏差的累积上界）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_t$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发的精确轨道，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^{\\mathrm{ddim}}_t$</span> 为命题 6.3 的离散轨道。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x^{\\mathrm{ddim}}_0-x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_0\\|\\le \\Big(\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}L_s\\Big)\\,C_t\\,\\Delta t^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,\\dots,1$</span> 归纳：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x^{\\mathrm{ddim}}_t-x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_t\\|\\le e_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x^{\\mathrm{ddim}}_{t-1}-x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_{t-1}\\|\\le \\|F_t(x^{\\mathrm{ddim}}_t)-F_t(x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_t)\\|+\\|F_t(x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_t)-\\Phi_t(x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_t)\\|\\le L_t e_t+C_t\\Delta t^2.$$</div>\n从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_T=0$</span> 递推即得所述上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.3（步数与误差的权衡）。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t\\le L&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（收缩映射），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}L_s\\le L^{T-t}$</span>，累积界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2/(1-L))$</span>，即误差随步长平方缩小且不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 爆炸；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t\\ge 1$</span>（扩张），误差可指数放大，此时减少步数（增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>）反而可能因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\Delta t^2$</span> 增大而恶化——这正是 6.4 节标题“采样轨迹”要强调的：<strong>轨迹质量由单步逼近阶与累积放大因子的乘积决定，二者对步数的依赖方向相反</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接代入几何级数求和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-5-具体例子-一维线性模型下的轨迹闭式\">6.5 具体例子：一维线性模型下的轨迹闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-5-具体例子-一维线性模型下的轨迹闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 6.1.</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\kappa x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=\\lambda x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa,\\lambda$</span> 为常数，且满足一致性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\kappa+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\lambda=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的精确分解）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t(x)=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\kappa+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\lambda)x$</span>。由约束可验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 是线性收缩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\kappa+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\lambda|$</span>。轨迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=F_t(x_t)$</span>，闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\big(\\prod_{t=1}^{T}F_t\\big)x_T$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 几何衰减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}&lt;1$</span>，累积界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\prod_{s&gt;t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{s-1}/\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,C_t$</span>，可用数值验证命题 6.4 的上界不空。</p>\n<p><em>验证.</em> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\kappa=1$</span>，约束要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch, math\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd, T = 4, 10\nabar = torch.tensor([math.prod([0.9]*t) for t in range(1, T+1)])  # abar_1..abar_T\nx = torch.randn(d)\ntraj = [x.clone()]\nfor t in range(T, 0, -1):\n    at, at1 = abar[t-1], abar[t-2] if t &gt; 1 else torch.tensor(1.0)\n    # 线性模型 kappa=1/sqrt(abar_t), lambda=0 =&gt; F_t = sqrt(abar_{t-1}/abar_t)\n    F = math.sqrt(float(at1/at))\n    x = F * x\n    traj.append(x.clone())\nassert len(traj) == T+1\nassert all(t.shape == (d,) for t in traj)\nprint(&quot;traj len:&quot;, len(traj), &quot;final shape:&quot;, traj[-1].shape, &quot;final norm:&quot;, float(traj[-1].norm()))\n# 预期：final norm 远小于初始 norm（收缩），且轨迹单调收缩\nassert float(traj[-1].norm()) &lt; float(traj[0].norm())\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-6-轨迹的支撑与可达集刻画\">6.6 轨迹的支撑与可达集刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-6-轨迹的支撑与可达集刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五小节给出了轨迹的构造、边缘偏差与误差累积界，但尚未回答一个结构性问题：给定初始点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的轨迹究竟落在什么集合里？这一刻画对 6.7 节的步数分析是必需的，因为误差界（命题 6.4）只给出上界，而可达集给出轨迹的<strong>几何约束</strong>，二者共同决定采样轨迹能否覆盖数据支撑。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6.2（可达集）。</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，定义时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的可达集为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R_t(x_T):=\\big\\{F_{t+1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ F_T(x_T)\\big\\}\\subset\\mathbb R^d,$$</div>\n即单点（推论 6.1 已证轨迹在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为单条轨道）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，定义随机可达集为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 的支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹的紧支撑判据）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为紧 Lipschitz 映射（即把有界集映为相对紧集），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t(x_T)$</span> 为紧集；若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_t(x)\\|\\le L_t\\|x\\|$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t}L_t&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_0(x_T)$</span> 含于半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\prod_t L_t\\big)\\|x_T\\|$</span> 的球内。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 紧性由紧映射的复合保持（有限个紧映射复合仍紧）。半径界由逐次不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t-1}\\|\\le L_t\\|x_t\\|$</span> 连乘得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.2（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的对比）。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时每一步注入方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的高斯噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}\\,\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t=\\mathbb R^d$</span>（高斯卷积的支撑为全空间，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的轨迹在支撑意义上“覆盖”全空间，但这不等于它逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>：支撑相同而测度可以完全不同。这正是 6.2 节偏差恒等式要处理的内容——<strong>支撑匹配是必要不充分条件</strong>，不能把“支撑覆盖”误当作“分布正确”。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.4（确定性轨迹的坍缩率）。</strong> 在命题 6.5 的收缩条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diam}\\,\\mathcal R_0(x_T)\\le 2\\big(\\prod_t L_t\\big)\\|x_T\\|$</span>，即所有初始点经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后坍缩到半径按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t L_t$</span> 衰减的球内。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T,y_T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_1\\circ\\cdots\\circ F_T(x_T)-F_1\\circ\\cdots\\circ F_T(y_T)\\|\\le\\big(\\prod_t L_t\\big)\\|x_T-y_T\\|$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_T=-x_T$</span> 得直径界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 在收缩映射下是<strong>信息压缩</strong>的——不同初始点被压到相近终点，这与扩散模型“从噪声恢复数据”的直觉一致，但也意味着若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 过小（步长过大导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 收缩过强），轨迹会丢失初始噪声中携带的多样性，对应 6.7 节“步数过少导致模式坍缩”的定量来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-7-步数与轨迹误差的显式标度\">6.7 步数与轨迹误差的显式标度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-7-步数与轨迹误差的显式标度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 6.4 的累积界含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t^2$</span>，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的关系。实际采样中“步数”指从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的子序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\le T$</span>，每步跨越 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/S$</span> 个离散索引。下面把累积界改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的显式函数。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.6（子序列采样的误差标度）。</strong> 设采样用等距子序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=T&gt;t_1&gt;\\cdots&gt;t_S=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/S$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t\\le L&lt;1$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的子序列轨迹与 PF-ODE 精确轨道的偏差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x^{\\mathrm{sub}}_0-x^{\\mathrm{ode}}_0\\|\\le \\frac{C\\,T^2}{S^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-L},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sup_t C_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 把命题 6.4 的求和按子序列步重组：每步贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t\\Delta t^2$</span>，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 步，放大因子按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 的几何级数求和，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^{S}L^{S-k}C\\Delta t^2\\le C\\Delta t^2/(1-L)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/S$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.5（步数—质量权衡的定量形式）。</strong> 误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^{-2}$</span> 衰减；要把误差压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 以下，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\ge T\\sqrt{C/(\\epsilon(1-L))}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\to1$</span>（临界收缩）时所需步数发散，这与 6.4 节“扩张情形减少步数反而恶化”的定性结论一致，但此处给出的是<strong>收缩情形下的精确标度</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 令右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon$</span> 解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.3（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的步数效应区别）。</strong> 上述标度只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时每步注入的噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t$</span> 使轨迹成为随机对象，误差不能再用确定性轨道偏差衡量；此时“步数—质量”关系需在分布层面（如 Wasserstein 距离）陈述，属于 6.7 节之后的内容，本节不展开。本节只强调：<strong>确定性轨迹的误差标度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^{-2}$</span>，随机轨迹的误差标度含噪声累积项，二者不可混用同一公式</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-8-轨迹的-Markov-性与非马尔可夫前向的对照\">6.8 轨迹的 Markov 性与非马尔可夫前向的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-8-轨迹的-Markov-性与非马尔可夫前向的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章主旨是“非马尔可夫前向 + 确定性反向”。一个自然的疑问是：反向采样轨迹本身是否 Markov？答案对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 不同，这一区别澄清了“非马尔可夫”一词的作用域。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.7（反向轨迹的 Markov 性）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_T,\\dots,x_0)$</span> 关于其自身 filtration 是 Markov 的，转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(F^{(\\eta)}_t(x),\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时退化为点测度）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时一般<strong>非</strong> Markov：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}_{t-1\\mid t,0}\\ne q^{(\\eta)}_{t-1\\mid t}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的选取使前向转移依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验结构。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 由构造：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t+1},\\dots,x_T)$</span> 条件独立，因更新式只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与新鲜噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与过去独立。(ii) 由本章第 1 节已建立的非马尔可夫性，此处只引用其结论作为对照，不重复证明。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.4（作用域澄清）。</strong> “DDIM 是非马尔可夫过程”指的是<strong>前向族</strong>，不是反向采样轨迹。反向轨迹永远是 Markov 的（命题 6.7(i)），因为它是显式递推构造。把“非马尔可夫”误加到反向轨迹上是常见混淆；本节明确：非马尔可夫性属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}$</span>，Markov 性属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}$</span>，二者是同一构造的两侧，不可互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-9-轨迹期望的递推恒等式\">6.9 轨迹期望的递推恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-9-轨迹期望的递推恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可检验的恒等式，把轨迹的一阶矩与前向边缘的一阶矩联系起来，作为 6.2 节偏差恒等式在矩层面的具体化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.8（一阶矩递推）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t:=\\mathbb E_{\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t}[x]$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\mathbb E_{\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t}\\big[\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\big]+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E_{\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t}\\big[\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)\\big],$$</div>\n且噪声项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的期望为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varepsilon_t=0$</span>），故不贡献。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对更新式取期望，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sigma_t\\varepsilon_t]=0$</span> 与线性性；可积性由 (A1)(A3) 保证，交换期望与线性组合无需额外条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.6（精确模型下的一阶矩匹配）。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为精确后验均值且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t=q_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q_t}[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x^{\\mathrm{post}}_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon^{\\mathrm{post}}]$</span>，此即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}$</span> 的一阶矩（由前向族定义）。故一阶矩在理想情形下精确匹配，偏差只出现在二阶及以上矩。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 代入命题 6.8 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}$</span> 的一阶矩表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择不影响理想情形下的一阶矩匹配（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 项期望为零），但影响二阶矩——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 直接进入方差。这为 6.10 节（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移）提供矩层面的入口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的偏差首先在二阶矩显形，一阶矩是“盲”的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch, math\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\nd, T = 3, 6\nabar = torch.tensor([math.prod([0.85]*t) for t in range(1, T+1)])\n# 线性精确模型：hat_x0 = x/sqrt(abar_t)（即 kappa=1/sqrt(abar_t), lambda=0）\ndef F(x, t, eta):\n    at = float(abar[t-1]); at1 = float(abar[t-2]) if t &gt; 1 else 1.0\n    sig2 = eta**2 * (1-at1)/(1-at) * (1 - at/at1)\n    assert sig2 &gt;= -1e-12 and sig2 &lt; 1 - at1 + 1e-12\n    return math.sqrt(at1/at) * x, math.sqrt(max(sig2, 0.0))\n# 检验命题 6.8：eta=0 时 m_{t-1} = sqrt(at1/at) * m_t\nx = torch.randn(1000, d)\nm = x.mean(0)\nfor t in range(T, 0, -1):\n    Fv, sig = F(torch.ones(1), t, 0.0)\n    m_new = Fv * m\n    assert torch.allclose(m_new, Fv * m)\n    m = m_new\nprint(&quot;eta=0 mean recursion OK, final mean shape:&quot;, m.shape)\n# eta=1 时噪声项期望为零，均值递推仍成立但含 sigma 项系数\nm2 = x.mean(0)\nfor t in range(T, 0, -1):\n    at = float(abar[t-1]); at1 = float(abar[t-2]) if t &gt; 1 else 1.0\n    sig2 = (1-at1)/(1-at) * (1 - at/at1)\n    coef = math.sqrt(max(1 - at1 - sig2, 0.0))\n    # 线性模型 lambda=0 =&gt; hat_eps 项系数乘 0，均值只由 hat_x0 项贡献\n    m2 = math.sqrt(at1/at) * m2\nprint(&quot;eta=1 mean recursion (lambda=0) OK, final mean shape:&quot;, m2.shape)\nassert m2.shape == (d,)\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_{T:0}$</span> 是反向迭代的联合律，其边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 一般不等于前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>；命题 6.2 把偏差分解为单步核失配与边缘误差传播两项，二者在精确后验时同时为零。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时轨迹退化为确定性映射的复合（推论 6.1），单步映射是 PF-ODE 流映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 逼近（命题 6.3），但轨迹级误差需按命题 6.4 的累积界控制，收缩与扩张情形对步数的依赖方向相反（推论 6.3）。</li>\n<li>轨迹质量由单步逼近阶与累积放大因子的乘积决定；线性例子（例 6.1）给出闭式轨迹并验证累积界不空，代码可复现收缩行为。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时轨迹退化为确定性映射的复合（推论 6.1），单步映射是 PF-ODE 流映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 逼近（命题 6.3），轨迹级误差按命题 6.4 累积，子序列采样下误差标度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^{-2}$</span>（命题 6.6），收缩与扩张情形对步数的依赖方向相反（推论 6.3、6.5）。</li>\n<li>轨迹的支撑由可达集刻画（命题 6.5）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 为紧集且按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t L_t$</span> 坍缩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 支撑为全空间但测度未必匹配；反向轨迹恒为 Markov（命题 6.7），非马尔可夫性只属于前向族；一阶矩递推（命题 6.8）表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的偏差首先在二阶矩显形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-步数与质量\">步数与质量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-步数与质量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，噪声日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 单调不减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span>；DDIM 更新式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声估计，二者满足前序节的一致性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0-x_t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。记采样步序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>（反向采样时按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0$</span> 递减遍历），步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n=t_n-t_{n-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 为步数。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t^{\\eta}(x_t)$</span> 表示 DDIM 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的转移核均值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为退化核，即 Dirac 测度）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_N$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步离散采样轨迹诱导的分布与真实数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span>（二次 Wasserstein）距离上界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{Lip}}$</span> 表示得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V$</span> 表示 PF-ODE 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in(0,T]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，Lipschitz 常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上有界，记上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{Lip}}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t)\\in L^2(p_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 为前向族在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘分布；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{p_t}\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2\\le \\delta_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 为得分估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差界。</p>\n<p>(A3) PF-ODE 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\hat x_0(x,t)\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（前序节已定义）关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> Lipschitz，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V&lt;\\infty$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p>(A4) 采样步序列满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_n h_n\\le h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Nh=T$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A5) 数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有有限二阶矩。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下的成立性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由神经网络参数化，其 Lipschitz 性由激活函数与权重范数控制，工程上通过谱归一化或权重裁剪保证 (A1)；(A2) 是得分匹配的训练目标所直接控制的量；(A3) 由 (A1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的光滑性推出；(A4) 是步数选择的定义；(A5) 是生成建模的标准假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一-步数离散化的误差分解\">一、步数离散化的误差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一-步数离散化的误差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 DDIM 采样所诱导的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span> 与真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的距离如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 变化。我们把它分解为三项：得分估计误差、离散化误差、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 引入的随机性误差。前序节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 更新与 PF-ODE 的显式 Euler 离散化一致；本节要给出这一致性的定量版本，并说明步数如何进入误差界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.1（误差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 出发、按 DDIM 更新式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>）走 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span> 为从同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 出发沿 PF-ODE 精确积分到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的分布。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)\\le \\underbrace{W_2(p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}},p_0)}_{\\text{得分误差}}+\\underbrace{W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}})}_{\\text{离散化误差}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 三角不等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)\\le W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}})+W_2(p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}},p_0)$</span>。两项均有定义：由 (A5) 与 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span> 均有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>第一项由得分误差控制：前序节已建立 PF-ODE 的适定性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 通过 Grönwall 型估计传播到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\delta_t\\cdot e^{L_V T}$</span>。本节聚焦第二项，即离散化误差如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 收缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-二-离散化误差的阶\">二、离散化误差的阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-二-离散化误差的阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.2（Euler 离散化的局部截断误差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t)$</span> 为 PF-ODE 的精确解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 迭代值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x(t_n)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n-1}=x(t_{n-1})$</span>。在 (A3) 下，单步截断误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x(t_n)-x_{n}\\|\\le \\frac{L_V}{2}h_n^2\\sup_{t\\in[t_{n-1},t_n]}\\|v(x(t),t)\\|+\\frac{L_V}{2}h_n\\|x(t_{n-1})-x_{n-1}\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的更新式（前序节已证）等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{n}=x_{n-1}+h_n\\,v(x_{n-1},t_{n-1}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 PF-ODE 速度场。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(t_n)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{n-1}$</span> 处 Taylor 展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x(t_n)=x(t_{n-1})+h_n v(x(t_{n-1}),t_{n-1})+\\int_{t_{n-1}}^{t_n}(t_n-s)\\frac{d}{ds}v(x(s),s)\\,ds.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\frac{d}{ds}v(x(s),s)\\|=\\|\\nabla_x v\\cdot v+\\partial_t v\\|\\le L_V\\|v\\|+\\|\\partial_t v\\|$</span>；在紧时间区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\partial_t v\\|$</span> 有界，合并记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V\\sup\\|v\\|$</span> 的量级。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x(t_n)-x_n\\|\\le \\|x(t_{n-1})-x_{n-1}\\|+h_n L_V\\|x(t_{n-1})-x_{n-1}\\|+\\frac{L_V}{2}h_n^2\\sup\\|v\\|.$$</div>\n<p>整理即得所述不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.3（全局离散化误差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 DDIM 与 PF-ODE 精确解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_n\\|x(t_n)-x_n\\|\\le \\frac{L_V}{2}h\\,T\\,e^{L_V T}\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\|v(x(t),t)\\|.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，离散化误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)=O(1/N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_n=\\|x(t_n)-x_n\\|$</span>。由命题 16.7.2，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_n\\le (1+L_V h_n)e_{n-1}+\\frac{L_V}{2}h_n^2\\sup\\|v\\|.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 归纳并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+L_V h_n\\le e^{L_V h_n}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_n\\le \\sum_{k=1}^{n}e^{L_V(t_n-t_k)}\\frac{L_V}{2}h_k^2\\sup\\|v\\|\\le \\frac{L_V}{2}h\\sup\\|v\\|\\sum_{k=1}^{n}h_k e^{L_V(t_n-t_k)}\\le \\frac{L_V}{2}h\\,T\\,e^{L_V T}\\sup\\|v\\|.$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k h_k e^{L_V(t_n-t_k)}\\le T e^{L_V T}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论给出本节对“步数与质量”的第一条定量回答：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性采样下，分布误差的离散化部分随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 线性收缩。注意这是路径偏差的界，转化为分布距离需再经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的 pushforward 不等式：若映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\mapsto x_0$</span> 关于初值 Lipschitz（由 (A3) 保证），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}})\\le e^{L_V T}\\cdot\\sup_n\\|x(t_n)-x_n\\|$</span>，仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-三-eta-gt-0-时步数对质量的双重作用\">三、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时步数对质量的双重作用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-三-eta-gt-0-时步数对质量的双重作用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，每步注入方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的噪声。前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 DDIM 退化为 DDPM 的祖先采样。此时离散化误差不再是唯一误差源：随机性本身引入的蒙特卡洛波动与步数相关。我们给出一个可检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步数的联合效应写成方差分解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 注入噪声的累积方差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 固定，采样从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_N=T$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0$</span>，每步注入独立标准高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_n$</span>。则在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 的条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的协方差中由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 注入的部分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\eta}(x_0\\mid x_T)=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\ldots$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_n=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的缩放因子，则注入项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_1^2A_2^2\\cdots A_{n-1}^2$</span> 累积传播，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\eta}(x_0\\mid x_T)=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}A_k^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> DDIM 更新式（前序节）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{n-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}}-\\sigma_{t_n}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n.$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 的确定性函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 固定时更新核的均值部分），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{n-1}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span> 的依赖是仿射的，注入噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_n}$</span>。沿迭代展开，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步注入的噪声在后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-1$</span> 步中每步被乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>（因为下一步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}$</span>，而当前步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 被代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的线性化中，缩放因子即该比值）。由独立性，方差逐项相加，得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步数的权衡）</strong> 在命题 16.7.4 的设定下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta(x_0\\mid x_T)$</span> 收敛到一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的极限，其值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 乘以连续时间 SDE 的累积扩散；而当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 较小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\prod A_k^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 的离散和，步数减少不改变注入噪声的总量级，但改变其时间分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_n\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}}\\approx \\beta_{t_n}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\approx\\eta^2\\beta_{t_n}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{n-1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_n})$</span>，求和收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\int_0^T \\frac{\\beta(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,dt=\\eta^2\\int_0^T\\beta(t)\\,dt$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，步数不影响注入噪声的总方差量级，只影响其离散化精度；因此步数对质量的作用在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时纯粹是离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时则是离散化误差与随机性时间分辨率的混合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">四、具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-四-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，前向族为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，得分估计精确（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span>），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t/(\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=x_t$</span>（此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为单位方差、前向噪声为单位方差的标准高斯情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 特定取值下成立；为简化取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=x_t/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的线性估计，这是精确后验均值当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span> 时的形式）。验证推论 16.7.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 阶。</p>\n<p><strong>例 16.7.6</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{-t}$</span>（连续时间极限），<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=-\\frac{1}{2}x$</span>（PF-ODE 对标准高斯的精确速度场）。取均匀步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=1/N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。则精确解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x(0)=x(1)e^{-1/2}$</span>，Euler 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_n=x_{n-1}(1-h/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_T(1-h/2)^N$</span>。两者之差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|x(0)-x_0|=|x_T|\\left|e^{-1/2}-(1-\\tfrac{h}{2})^{N}\\right|\\le |x_T|\\cdot\\frac{h}{8}e^{-1/2}+O(h^2),$$</div>\n<p>与推论 16.7.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 界一致（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|v\\|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 有界时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x_T|/2$</span>）。数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=10$</span>：精确 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1/2}\\approx0.6065$</span>，Euler <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.95)^{10}\\approx0.5987$</span>，差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0078$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=100$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.995)^{100}\\approx0.6058$</span>，差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0007$</span>，比值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，验证一阶收敛。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-五-步数与质量的实践含义\">五、步数与质量的实践含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-五-步数与质量的实践含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由命题 16.7.1 与推论 16.7.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时总误差上界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)\\le \\sup_t\\delta_t\\,e^{L_V T}+\\frac{L_V}{2}h\\,T\\,e^{L_V T}\\sup\\|v\\|.$$</div>\n<p>第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关，是得分估计的固有误差；第二项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 线性下降。因此存在一个“收益饱和点”：当离散化误差降到得分误差以下时，继续增加步数不再改善分布质量。这解释了为何在得分网络精度有限时，超过某一步数后质量曲线趋于平坦——不是步数无用，而是误差源切换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，由推论 16.7.5，注入噪声的总方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关，但小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下噪声的时间分辨率粗糙，会在轨迹上留下不可忽略的离散随机波动，其影响需由第 8 节（数值稳定性）与第 10 节（反例）处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-六-步数与质量的定量权衡-得分误差与离散化误差的交点\">六、步数与质量的定量权衡：得分误差与离散化误差的交点<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-六-步数与质量的定量权衡-得分误差与离散化误差的交点\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的误差上界只说明两项的相对量级，未给出“最优步数”的显式表达。本小节把上界当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的函数，求其极小点，从而得到一个可检验的推论：当得分误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 给定时，存在一个使总误差最小的步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\ast$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^\\ast$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 成反比。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.7（最优步数的显式估计）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\delta_t=\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\|v(x(t),t)\\|=V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V$</span> 为速度场 Lipschitz 常数。则命题 16.7.1 与推论 16.7.3 给出的误差上界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(N)=\\delta\\,e^{L_V T}+\\frac{L_V V T}{2N}\\,e^{L_V T}$$</div>\n<p>关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 单调递减且无下界为零，但若把离散化误差的系数取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c/N$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\frac{L_V V T}{2}e^{L_V T}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(N)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，不存在有限极小点。真正决定“收益饱和”的不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(N)$</span> 的极小，而是离散化误差项降到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span> 同阶的步数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$N_{\\mathrm{sat}}=\\frac{c}{\\delta\\,e^{L_V T}}=\\frac{L_V V T}{2\\delta}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(N)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-c/N^2&lt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}B(N)=\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，无有限极小点。令离散化项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c/N$</span> 等于得分项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=c/(\\delta e^{L_V T})$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sat}}=L_V V T/(2\\delta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一命题澄清了一个常见误解：增加步数永远“有益”，但边际收益递减；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\gg N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 时，总误差已被得分误差主导，继续增加步数只降低一个已经可忽略的项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 成反比，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 成正比：速度场越陡、轨迹越长、得分越准，需要的步数越多。这与工程直觉一致，但此处给出了显式的比例关系而非定性描述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.8（步数的边际收益）</strong> 在命题 16.7.7 的设定下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 时，每增加一倍步数，总误差上界下降约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{c}{N}e^{L_V T}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 时，每增加一倍步数，总误差上界下降不足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，即相对改善小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$50\\%$</span> 且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N'=2N$</span>。误差上界之差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$B(N)-B(2N)=\\frac{c}{N}-\\frac{c}{2N}=\\frac{c}{2N}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{N}\\ge \\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，故差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge \\frac{1}{2}\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，相对改善 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{B(N)-B(2N)}{B(N)}\\ge \\frac{\\delta e^{L_V T}/2}{\\delta e^{L_V T}+c/N}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\ge N_{\\mathrm{sat}}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{c}{N}\\le\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\delta e^{L_V T}$</span>，相对改善 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{\\delta e^{L_V T}/2}{2\\delta e^{L_V T}}=\\frac{1}{4}$</span>，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-七-eta-对步数-质量曲线的调制\">七、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对步数-质量曲线的调制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-七-eta-对步数-质量曲线的调制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节只处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，离散化误差与注入噪声的时间分辨率共同作用，步数-质量曲线不再是单调的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 衰减。本小节给出一个把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 显式纳入误差界的命题，说明为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 较大时，过小的步数反而可能损害质量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时的误差上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N,\\eta)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步、参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的 DDIM 采样诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 分布。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span>（只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_V,T,V$</span>）使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N,\\eta)},p_0)\\le \\delta e^{L_V T}+\\frac{C_1}{N}+\\eta\\,C_2\\,\\sqrt{h}\\,\\sup_t\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}_{\\eta}(x_0\\mid x_t)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为命题 16.7.4 的累积注入方差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的采样看成“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性轨迹 + 每步注入的独立噪声”。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> Lipschitz，故注入噪声对后续轨迹的影响可经 Lipschitz 传播估计：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步注入的噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_n}\\varepsilon_n$</span> 在剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步中被放大至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_V(t_n-t_0)}$</span> 倍。由命题 16.7.4，注入噪声的累积方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_n\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\prod_{k&lt;n}A_k^2$</span>。把每步注入视为对确定性轨迹的扰动，扰动的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\sum_n\\sigma_{t_n}^2\\prod A_k^2}$</span>，而离散化误差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>（确定性部分）。两项相加并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 的三角不等式与 pushforward 不等式，得所述上界，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{h}$</span> 因子来自每步扰动的时间局部化（步长越小，单步扰动越局部，但其累积效应由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta$</span> 控制）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 诱导的非单调性）</strong> 在命题 16.7.9 的设定下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时，第一项不变、第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 下降、第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta C_2\\sqrt{h}\\sup_t\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 减小而下降但受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta$</span> 的连续极限约束（推论 16.7.5）。因此总误差上界关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 仍单调递减，但递减速率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 较大时被第三项主导，且第三项的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta C_2$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 越大，达到同一误差水平所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 越大。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 16.7.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_\\eta(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_\\eta$</span>，故第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta C_2\\sqrt{h}\\sqrt{V_\\eta}\\to 0$</span>，但收敛速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{h}=O(1/\\sqrt{N})$</span>，慢于第二项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta C_2\\sqrt{V_\\eta}$</span> 足够大时，第三项在中等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 区间主导误差，故总误差的下降速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{h}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论给出本节对“步数与质量”的第二条定量回答：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，误差上界的收敛速率从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{N})$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 主导区间），因此大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 采样需要更多步数才能达到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 相同的误差水平。这与第 10 节（反例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移）的构造相衔接：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 过大且步数不足时，注入噪声的时间分辨率粗糙，分布偏移不可忽略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-八-可检验的恒等式-步数与质量的乘积关系\">八、可检验的恒等式：步数与质量的乘积关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-八-可检验的恒等式-步数与质量的乘积关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个把步数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>、得分误差三者联系起来的恒等式，它可作为数值实验的检验目标（代码见本章第 13、14 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.7.11（误差-步数-<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的乘积恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，前向族为标准高斯扩散，得分估计精确。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 DDIM 采样的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_0^{(N)}$</span> 仍为高斯，其协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_N=\\left(1-\\frac{h}{2}\\right)^{2N}I_d,\\qquad h=\\frac{T}{N},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)=\\|\\Sigma_N^{1/2}-I_d\\|_F=\\sqrt{d}\\left|(1-\\tfrac{h}{2})^{N}-1\\right|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 标准高斯扩散的 PF-ODE 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=-\\frac{1}{2}x$</span>（前序节已证），其 Euler 离散为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{n}=x_{n-1}(1-h/2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_T(1-h/2)^N$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,(1-h/2)^{2N}I_d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_N=(1-h/2)^{2N}I_d$</span>。两个同中心高斯分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 距离为协方差矩阵平方根之差的 Frobenius 范数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Sigma_N^{1/2}-I_d\\|_F=\\sqrt{d}|(1-h/2)^N-1|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.7.12（小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 展开）</strong> 在命题 16.7.11 的设定下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to 0$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)=\\sqrt{d}\\cdot\\frac{T}{2N}e^{-T/2}+O(1/N^2),$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\cdot W_2(\\hat p_0^{(N)},p_0)\\to \\sqrt{d}\\,\\frac{T}{2}e^{-T/2}$</span>，即误差与步数的乘积收敛到常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-h/2)^N=\\exp(N\\log(1-h/2))=\\exp(-\\frac{T}{2}-\\frac{T h}{8}+O(h^2))=e^{-T/2}(1-\\frac{T h}{8}+O(h^2))$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(1-h/2)^N-1|=e^{-T/2}\\frac{T h}{8}+O(h^2)=\\frac{T^2}{8N}e^{-T/2}+O(1/N^2)$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{d}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一恒等式是可数值检验的：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=10$</span>，预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2\\approx\\frac{1}{2\\cdot10}e^{-1/2}\\approx0.0303$</span>；实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.95)^{10}=0.5987$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|0.5987-1|=0.4013$</span>，与预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0303$</span> 不符——原因是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=0.1$</span> 不够小，展开的高阶项不可忽略。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.9995)^{1000}\\approx0.6064$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|0.6064-1|=0.3936$</span>；预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2000}e^{-1/2}\\approx0.000303$</span>，仍不符。此处需注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2$</span> 是协方差平方根之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_N^{1/2}=(1-h/2)^N$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2=|(1-h/2)^N-1|$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=1000$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-h/2)^N\\approx e^{-1/2}\\approx0.6065$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_2\\approx0.3935$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0003$</span>。推论 16.7.12 的展开对象是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-h/2)^N-e^{-T/2}$</span>（离散解与连续解之差），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-h/2)^N-1$</span>（离散解与数据分布之差）。后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|e^{-T/2}-1|$</span>，不趋于零——这正说明：即使步数趋于无穷，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 出发也收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{\\mathrm{ODE}}=p_0$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 恰为前向族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的边缘分布时成立。命题 16.7.11 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I_d)$</span> 并非前向族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的边缘（后者方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T+(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)=1$</span>，恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{N}(0,1)$</span>，故此处一致），但离散解与数据分布之差含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-T/2}$</span> 因子，说明有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 也有残差。这一细节由第 9 节（与 DDPM 的关系）处理，本节只记录：步数趋于无穷时误差趋于一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与日程决定的非零常数，而非零。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 是 PF-ODE 的一阶 Euler 离散化，全局路径偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)=O(1/N)$</span>（推论 16.7.3），分布误差经 pushforward 后仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。</li>\n<li>总分布误差可分解为与步数无关的得分估计误差和随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 收缩的离散化误差（命题 16.7.1），存在收益饱和点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时注入噪声的累积方差由命题 16.7.4 的恒等式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到与步数无关的连续极限（推论 16.7.5）；步数只影响离散化精度与噪声的时间分辨率，不改变注入噪声的总量级。</li>\n<li>总分布误差可分解为与步数无关的得分估计误差和随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 收缩的离散化误差（命题 16.7.1），存在收益饱和点；饱和步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_{\\mathrm{sat}}=L_VVT/(2\\delta)$</span> 与得分误差成反比（命题 16.7.7），超过该点后步数的边际收益不足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$50\\%$</span> 并趋于零（推论 16.7.8）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时注入噪声的累积方差由命题 16.7.4 的恒等式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到与步数无关的连续极限（推论 16.7.5）；步数只影响离散化精度与噪声的时间分辨率，不改变注入噪声的总量级；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 主导区间内误差上界的收敛速率从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{N})$</span>（推论 16.7.10），故大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 采样需要更多步数才能达到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 相同的误差水平。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-数值稳定性\">数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 为累积噪声调度系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 为离散时间指标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由第 3 节公式给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 为随机性参数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>），并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t:=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\in[0,1)$</span> 且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有界性)</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0,M_\\varepsilon&lt;\\infty$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与采样轨迹上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t)\\|\\le M_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)\\|\\le M_\\varepsilon$</span>。此假设在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由训练好的网络给出，网络输出经有界激活（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tanh$</span> 末端或裁剪）或训练数据紧支撑保证有界；若网络无界，则下述稳定性结论须替换为局部版本。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) Lipschitz 正则性)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto(\\hat x_0(x_t,t),\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t))$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>-Lipschitz 的，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设在工程中由网络权重的谱范数控制成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 非退化调度)</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t-b_{t-1}=\\beta_t\\ge\\delta$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\le 1-\\delta$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=b_t$</span> 不趋于零、比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}$</span> 有界远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的退化端点。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 步长一致性)</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t:=1/T$</span>，并设离散指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span> 的对应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b(\\tau):=1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\lfloor \\tau T\\rfloor}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 的且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|b'(\\tau)|\\le L_b$</span>。此假设使第 5 节 PF-ODE 等价性的离散化误差分析可在此节复用。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义是<strong>数值稳定性</strong>：称 DDIM 迭代在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上数值稳定，若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&lt;\\infty$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关），使得对任意两条由同一调度、同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>、但初值相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t'\\}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|x_t-x_t'\\|\\le C\\epsilon$</span>。这与第 6 节“采样轨迹”讨论的轨迹几何形状不同：那里刻画单条轨迹的走向，这里刻画轨迹对初值与舍入扰动的敏感度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一-单步更新的压缩性\">一、单步更新的压缩性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一-单步更新的压缩性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.1（单步 Lipschitz 常数）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，DDIM 单步更新映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_t(x)=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t)+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(F_t)\\le \\sqrt{a_{t-1}}\\,L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{(0)},L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，右端不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,x'$</span>，由三角不等式与 (A2)：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|F_t(x)-F_t(x')\\|\\le \\sqrt{a_{t-1}}\\|\\hat x_0(x,t)-\\hat x_0(x',t)\\|+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)-\\hat\\varepsilon(x',t)\\|$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\le \\big(\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}\\big)\\|x-x'\\|.$$</div>\n<p>随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，故不贡献 Lipschitz 常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.8.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的全局压缩估计）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 下，若进一步假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}\\le \\rho&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则整条 DDIM 轨迹关于初值是压缩的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|x_t-x_t'\\|\\le \\frac{1}{1-\\rho}\\epsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t:=x_t-x_t'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{t-1}=F_t(x_t)-F_t(x_t')$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{t-1}\\|\\le\\rho\\|e_t\\|$</span>。反向递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_0\\|\\le\\rho^T\\|e_T\\|$</span>，即正向（采样方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to 0$</span>）有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_t\\|\\le\\rho^{T-t}\\|e_T\\|$</span>，求和几何级数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 的确定性更新在 Lipschitz 常数小于 1 时是收缩的，初值扰动沿采样方向被指数衰减，这正是数值稳定性的来源。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 每步注入独立噪声，扰动不再收缩而是被噪声底噪支配，见下文命题 16.8.3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-二-随机项的方差累积\">二、随机项的方差累积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-二-随机项的方差累积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的扰动方差上界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 为独立标准高斯，两条轨迹使用<strong>同一组</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varepsilon_t\\}$</span>（即耦合噪声，用于比较），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时初值扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后的方差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|e_0\\|^2\\le \\Big(\\prod_{t=1}^{T}\\rho_t^2\\Big)\\epsilon^2+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sigma_t^2\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}\\rho_s^2\\Big)\\cdot 2d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t:=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{t-1}=F_t(x_t)-F_t(x_t')$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_t$</span> 的随机项相同（耦合），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|e_{t-1}\\|\\le\\rho_t\\|e_t\\|$</span> 逐点成立，取平方期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 及独立性（不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 独立）展开即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时即便 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t&lt;1$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2\\cdot 2d$</span> 不为零，扰动不会衰减到零，而是稳定在由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 决定的噪声底。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的 DDIM 在少步数下对初值更敏感：噪声底与步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 耦合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大（由第 3 节公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\propto\\sqrt{b_{t-1}/b_t}\\sqrt{1-a_t/a_{t-1}}$</span>，步长增大时比值增大）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-三-sigma_t-公式的数值条件\">三、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式的数值条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-三-sigma_t-公式的数值条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 实值性与单调性）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，第 3 节公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{a_t}{a_{t-1}}}$$</div>\n<p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\sigma_t^2\\le b_{t-1}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 线性、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调（沿采样方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减小则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 首先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}/b_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 单调不减且 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\ge\\delta$</span>；其次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-a_t/a_{t-1}=1-\\alpha_t=\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。故根号内非负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}\\beta_t\\le \\eta^2 b_{t-1}\\le b_{t-1}$</span>，实值性得证。线性性显然。单调性：沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}/b_t$</span> 增大（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 单调），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 增大（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 单调减），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题排除了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;b_{t-1}$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 为虚数的情形，是更新公式良定义的前提。工程中若调度表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 非单调或含零，则 (A3) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 可能越界，此时须在采样前对调度做单调化与截断。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-四-具体例子-线性调度的稳定性常数\">四、具体例子：线性调度的稳定性常数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-四-具体例子-线性调度的稳定性常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=0.9^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=1-0.9^t$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=4$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_3=0.729$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_3=0.271$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_4=0.6561$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_4=0.3439$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_4=0.1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_4=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_3}=0.5206$</span>。若网络满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{(0)}=L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_4=\\sqrt{0.729}\\cdot0.5+\\sqrt{0.271}\\cdot0.5=0.854\\cdot0.5+0.5206\\cdot0.5=0.687$</span>。四步乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t=1}^4\\rho_t$</span> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.687\\times0.72\\times0.76\\times0.80\\approx0.30$</span>，故初值扰动经四步衰减至约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$30\\%$</span>，与推论 16.8.2 的几何级数估计一致。此例验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时压缩性估计的可计算性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-六-有限精度下的舍入误差累积\">六、有限精度下的舍入误差累积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-六-有限精度下的舍入误差累积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.8.1 与推论 16.8.2 讨论的是初值扰动在精确算术下的传播。实际采样在浮点算术下进行，每步引入相对舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（单精度约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6\\times10^{-8}$</span>，双精度约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-16}$</span>）。本节将舍入视为每步叠加的有界扰动，给出其累积上界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.5（舍入误差累积界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步浮点计算的实际输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde F_t(x)=\\mathrm{fl}(F_t(x))$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde F_t(x)-F_t(x)\\|\\le\\delta(1+\\|F_t(x)\\|)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（这是标准浮点模型，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 为机器 epsilon 的常数倍）。则从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发的浮点轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tilde x_t\\}$</span> 与精确轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{0\\le t\\le T}\\|\\tilde x_t-x_t\\|\\le \\frac{\\delta}{1-\\rho}\\Big(1+\\sup_t\\|F_t(x_t)\\|\\Big)\\sum_{s=0}^{T-t}\\rho^{s},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho:=\\sup_t\\rho_t&lt;1$</span> 为推论 16.8.2 的压缩常数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_t:=\\tilde x_t-x_t$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_{t-1}=\\tilde F_t(\\tilde x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=F_t(x_t)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|e_{t-1}\\|\\le\\|\\tilde F_t(\\tilde x_t)-F_t(\\tilde x_t)\\|+\\|F_t(\\tilde x_t)-F_t(x_t)\\|\\le\\delta(1+\\|F_t(\\tilde x_t)\\|)+\\rho\\|e_t\\|.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_t(\\tilde x_t)\\|\\le\\|F_t(x_t)\\|+\\rho\\|e_t\\|$</span>，代入并递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-t$</span> 步，几何级数求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时舍入误差不随步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无界增长，而是被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\rho)$</span> 放大后封顶；这是确定性 DDIM 在少步数下仍能保持数值稳定的定量表述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时命题 16.8.3 的噪声底已远大于舍入项，舍入不再主导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-七-eta-与稳定性的权衡\">七、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与稳定性的权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-七-eta-与稳定性的权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 对应确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 对应 DDPM。本节从稳定性角度补充这一参数选择的定量后果，但不重复第 3 节与第 9 节的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.6（稳定性关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定调度与网络，命题 16.8.1 中的单步 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不增；命题 16.8.3 中的噪声底项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2(\\eta)\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2(\\eta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)=\\eta\\cdot c_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:=\\sqrt{b_{t-1}/b_t}\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\ge0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2(\\eta)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不增，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)$</span> 单调不增。噪声底项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2(\\eta)=\\eta^2c_t^2$</span> 单调不减，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2(\\eta)$</span> 单调不减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_s$</span> 单调不增则其平方单调不增，乘积单调不增……此处需注意方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_s$</span> 减小则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_s^2$</span> 减小，乘积减小，故噪声底项的两个因子一增一减，不能直接断言单调）。更精确地说，噪声底项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调性不成立，仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 本身单调不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上段证明中第二项的单调性不能成立，故命题 16.8.6 应仅陈述第一部分。这提示一个可检验的推论：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.8.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大降低压缩性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大时单步压缩性减弱（Lipschitz 常数变小），初值扰动在确定性部分被更快衰减，但随机项注入的噪声底同时抬高。两者方向相反，故不存在使总扰动最小的统一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>；最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与网络 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p>此推论说明：稳定性不能单独作为选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的准则，须与第 7 节“步数与质量”的采样质量指标联合考虑。第 10 节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移的反例，那里会用到本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)$</span> 的单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-八-调度退化时的稳定性失效\">八、调度退化时的稳定性失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-八-调度退化时的稳定性失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>(A3) 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge\\delta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\le1-\\delta$</span>。若调度在末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}/b_t$</span> 的比值可能爆炸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 失去实值性。本节给出这一失效的定量边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.8（末端退化的临界条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span>（采样末端），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim c\\,b_t$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/b_{t-1}\\to\\eta^2 c/(1+c)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le b_{t-1}$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c\\le 1+c$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\sqrt{(1+c)/c}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时条件化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\le1+c$</span>，恒成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 时可能失效。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}=b_t-\\beta_t=b_t(1-c+o(1))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}\\beta_t=\\eta^2(1-c)\\cdot c\\,b_t+o(b_t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}=(1-c)b_t+o(b_t)$</span>，故比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/b_{t-1}\\to\\eta^2 c/(1-c)\\cdot(1-c)=\\eta^2 c/(1+c)$</span>（此处按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/b_t\\to c$</span> 重算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/b_{t-1}=\\eta^2\\frac{\\beta_t}{b_t}\\cdot\\frac{b_t}{b_{t-1}}=\\eta^2 c/(1-c)$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&lt;1$</span>）。更精确地说，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&lt;1$</span>，则比值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c/(1-c)$</span>，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c\\le1-c$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le\\sqrt{(1-c)/c}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上段两次重算暴露了参数化选择对结论的影响，故命题 16.8.8 的正确陈述应固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/b_t\\to c\\in(0,1)$</span>，结论为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/b_{t-1}\\to\\eta^2 c/(1-c)$</span>，实值性条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c\\le1-c$</span>。工程含义：末端调度若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span> 过大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 接近 1），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 稍大便可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;b_{t-1}$</span>，更新公式失效；此时须在末端强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 或截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。这与 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 下界互为补充：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 保证整段不退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&lt;1$</span> 保证末端局部不退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-九-稳定性与-PF-ODE-离散化误差的关系\">九、稳定性与 PF-ODE 离散化误差的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-九-稳定性与-PF-ODE-离散化误差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 与概率流 ODE 的离散化一致。本节补充该一致性的<strong>稳定性</strong>侧面：PF-ODE 的显式 Euler 离散在刚性调度下可能不稳定，而 DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 更新因其隐式结构（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 而非速度场）具有更好的稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.9（DDIM 与 Euler 的稳定性对比）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 下，设 PF-ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_v$</span>-Lipschitz 的。则 PF-ODE 的显式 Euler 步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau-\\Delta\\tau}=x_\\tau-\\Delta\\tau\\,v(x_\\tau,\\tau)$</span> 的稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau\\,L_v\\le2$</span>；而 DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 步在推论 16.8.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho&lt;1$</span> 条件下对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 稳定。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> Euler 步的放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\Delta\\tau L_v|$</span>，稳定当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\Delta\\tau L_v|\\le1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau L_v\\le2$</span>。DDIM 步的放大因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t&lt;1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t,b_t$</span> 与网络 Lipschitz 常数），故对任意步长稳定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见混淆：DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 更新并非 PF-ODE 的 Euler 离散（后者用速度场），而是用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span> 参数化的另一种离散，其稳定性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的有界性 (A1) 与压缩性，而非速度场的 Lipschitz 条件。第 5 节的等价性是在连续时间极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 下成立的，有限步数下两者离散化误差不同，稳定性行为也不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十-条件数视角\">十、条件数视角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十-条件数视角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可检验的恒等式，将单步更新的条件数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 联系起来，用于诊断数值稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.10（单步 Jacobian 的条件数界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可微，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_0=\\partial\\hat x_0/\\partial x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\varepsilon=\\partial\\hat\\varepsilon/\\partial x$</span>。则 DDIM 单步的 Jacobian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$J_{F_t}=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}\\,J_0+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,J_\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其谱范数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J_{F_t}\\|_2\\le\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}\\|J_0\\|_2+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\|J_\\varepsilon\\|_2$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，右端取到最大压缩系数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由链式法则与三角不等式直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\varepsilon$</span> 的贡献被压低，但随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的方差增大；条件数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa(J_{F_t})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大时可能改善（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\varepsilon$</span> 项减弱），但整体稳定性由命题 16.8.3 的噪声底主导。故条件数不能单独作为稳定性判据，须与噪声底联合使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十一-稳定性与-eta-的联合判据\">十一、稳定性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的联合判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十一-稳定性与-eta-的联合判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.8.3 给出的扰动方差上界与命题 16.8.10 给出的条件数界分别刻画了随机项与确定性项对稳定性的贡献。本节将二者合并为一个可计算的判据，用于在给定步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与网络 Lipschitz 常数时选取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.8.11（稳定裕度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 与调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_t\\}_{t=0}^T$</span>，定义稳定裕度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S(\\eta):=\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{\\mathbb E\\|e_0\\|^2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|e_0\\|^2$</span> 由命题 16.8.3 的上界给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 为初值扰动范数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)\\in(0,1]$</span> 度量初值扰动经整条轨迹后的相对保留比例；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 越接近 1，扰动保留越多，稳定性越差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.12（稳定裕度的显式表达）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，取命题 16.8.3 的上界为等式（即忽略高阶项），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S(\\eta)=\\Big(\\prod_{t=1}^{T}\\rho_t(\\eta)^2+\\frac{2d}{\\epsilon^2}\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sigma_t(\\eta)^2\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}\\rho_s(\\eta)^2\\Big)^{-1}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T\\rho_t(0)^{-2}\\ge1$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(0)&lt;1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(0)&gt;1$</span>，扰动被压缩）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 取第 3 节公式的最大值，第二项主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(1)$</span> 由噪声底决定。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 将命题 16.8.3 的上界代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 的定义，直接整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时第二项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(0)=(\\prod_t\\rho_t^2)^{-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的价值在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择转化为一个显式的代数表达式：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T,d,\\epsilon$</span> 与网络 Lipschitz 常数，可数值计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 并选取使其最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 未必单峰，因第一项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大而减小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 单调不增，乘积减小，其倒数增大），第二项随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增大），二者竞争。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 的极值点须通过一阶条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d\\mathcal S/\\mathrm d\\eta=0$</span> 数值求解，无闭式解。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.8.13（小扰动极限下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2\\ll 2d$</span>（初值扰动远小于噪声尺度），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 由第二项主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不增，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2\\gg 2d$</span>，则第一项主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t\\rho_t(\\eta)^2$</span> 决定，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 未必为零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2\\ll2d$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2d}{\\epsilon^2}\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2\\gg\\prod_t\\rho_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S\\approx(\\frac{2d}{\\epsilon^2}\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2)^{-1}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调增、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调减，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 因子主导，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 单调不增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2\\gg2d$</span> 时第一项主导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S\\approx(\\prod_t\\rho_t^2)^{-1}$</span>，其单调性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)$</span> 的单调性决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 单调不增故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\rho_t^2$</span> 单调不增，其倒数单调不减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S$</span> 单调不减，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个反直觉的结论：当初值扰动远小于噪声尺度时（工程中常见，因浮点舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim10^{-7}$</span> 而噪声尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sim10^2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 是稳定裕度最大的选择；但当初值扰动较大时（如用户指定的初始噪声幅度大），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 反而更稳定。这解释了为何工程实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性 DDIM 在标准精度下表现稳定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的随机采样对初始噪声幅度更敏感。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十二-多步累积的谱半径判据\">十二、多步累积的谱半径判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十二-多步累积的谱半径判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.8.1 给出单步 Lipschitz 常数，推论 16.8.2 给出整条轨迹的压缩估计。本节将二者统一为谱半径判据，适用于非对称 Jacobian 的情形（命题 16.8.10 的谱范数界对非对称矩阵是保守的）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.14（多步谱半径判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{F_t}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的 Jacobian。则整条轨迹的扰动传播矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P:=\\prod_{t=1}^{T}J_{F_t}$</span>（乘积按采样方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to0$</span> 排列）。扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 经整条轨迹后的范数满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|P\\epsilon\\|\\le\\prod_{t=1}^{T}\\|J_{F_t}\\|_2\\cdot\\|\\epsilon\\|,$$</div>\n<p>且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(J_{F_t})&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 为谱半径），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P\\epsilon\\|\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>（在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式由矩阵范数的次乘性直接得。第二式：谱半径小于 1 的矩阵其幂次趋于零（Gelfand 公式），但此处是不同矩阵的乘积，须用联合谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(J_{F_1},\\dots,J_{F_T})&lt;1$</span> 的条件；若各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{F_t}$</span> 可交换（如均为同一线性映射的标量倍），则联合谱半径等于各谱半径之积，结论成立。一般情形下联合谱半径小于各谱半径之积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(J_{F_t})&lt;1$</span> 不足以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P\\epsilon\\|\\to0$</span>，须联合谱半径条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上段证明暴露了谱半径判据的局限：各步 Jacobian 不可交换时，谱半径小于 1 不保证乘积收敛。故命题 16.8.14 的正确陈述应加入可交换性假设或联合谱半径条件。工程中若网络在各时间步共享权重（如时间嵌入仅作条件），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{F_t}$</span> 近似可交换，谱半径判据可用；若各步权重独立，则须用联合谱半径，计算代价高，实践中退化为命题 16.8.1 的 Lipschitz 常数判据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.8.15（线性网络的特例）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=A_0x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=A_\\varepsilon x$</span> 为固定线性映射（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{F_t}=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}A_0+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}}A_\\varepsilon$</span> 可交换（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_0,A_\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合），联合谱半径等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t\\rho(J_{F_t})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(J_{F_t})&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立即保证整条轨迹压缩。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 线性组合的矩阵可交换当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_0,A_\\varepsilon$</span> 可交换；若二者可交换，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_{F_t}$</span> 两两可交换，联合谱半径等于各谱半径之积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：线性网络下谱半径判据与 Lipschitz 判据一致，非线性网络下二者可能分歧。第 10 节的反例将利用这一分歧构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移的情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十三-稳定性判据的计算流程\">十三、稳定性判据的计算流程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十三-稳定性判据的计算流程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 16.8.1、16.8.3、16.8.10、16.8.12，本节给出一个可执行的计算流程，用于在给定调度与网络时诊断数值稳定性。流程不依赖具体数据集或实验，仅用调度表与网络 Lipschitz 常数。</p>\n<p><strong>算法 16.8.16（稳定性诊断）</strong> 输入：调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_t\\}_{t=0}^T$</span>，网络 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{L_t^{(0)},L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}\\}_{t=1}^T$</span>，维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，初值扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，随机性参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。输出：稳定裕度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 与诊断标志。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，由第 3 节公式计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t(\\eta)$</span>，并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le b_{t-1}$</span>；若不满足，置诊断标志 <code>SIGMA_INVALID</code> 并终止。</li>\n<li>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(\\eta)=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。</li>\n<li>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 由命题 16.8.12 的公式。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_t\\rho_t(\\eta)&lt;1$</span>，置 <code>CONTRACTIVE</code>；否则置 <code>NON_CONTRACTIVE</code>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)&lt;\\mathcal S(0)$</span>，置 <code>ETA_SUBOPTIMAL</code>，建议减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>此流程的每一步均为代数运算，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span>，可在采样前离线执行。第 13 节的代码节将实现此流程的一个简化版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十四-与第-7-节步数-质量关系的接口\">十四、与第 7 节步数-质量关系的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十四-与第-7-节步数-质量关系的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节讨论了步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与采样质量的关系，本节从稳定性角度补充一个定量约束：步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大（命题 16.8.4 的单调性），噪声底抬高，稳定裕度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 下降。故少步数采样不仅影响质量，也影响数值稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.17（步数与稳定裕度的关系）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 与调度函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(\\tau)$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\sigma_t^2\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2\\to\\int_0^1\\sigma^2(\\tau)\\exp(-\\int_\\tau^1\\ell(s)\\mathrm ds)\\mathrm d\\tau$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\tau):=-\\ln\\rho(\\tau)$</span> 为连续时间的压缩率。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大时噪声底项趋于有限积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 趋于稳定值；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小时噪声底项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span> 增长（每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增大且步数减少但单步贡献增大），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S(\\eta)$</span> 下降。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 (A4) 的步长一致性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma^2(t/T)+O(\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\rho_s^2=\\exp(-\\sum_{s&lt;t}\\ell(s/T)\\Delta t)+O(\\Delta t)=\\exp(-\\int_{t/T}^1\\ell(s)\\mathrm ds)+O(\\Delta t)$</span>，求和趋于积分（Riemann 和收敛，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2,\\ell$</span> 的有界性与连续性，用 Dominated Convergence 于离散测度）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 增大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 在每步的代表值增大（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 随步长增大），故噪声底项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span> 增长。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 7 节的步数-质量关系互补：第 7 节从采样质量角度说明少步数的偏差，本节从稳定性角度说明少步数的噪声底抬高。二者共同构成少步数采样的代价：质量下降与稳定性下降同时发生，且均由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 随步长增大驱动。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十五-边界情形-eta-的端点行为\">十五、边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的端点行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十五-边界情形-eta-的端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补充 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在两个端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的稳定性行为的精确刻画，作为第 3 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数讨论的稳定性补充。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.8.18（端点稳定性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(0)=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(0)&lt;1$</span> 则整条轨迹压缩，舍入误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\rho)$</span> 封顶（命题 16.8.5）。</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}=\\sqrt{b_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t/b_t)}=\\sqrt{b_{t-1}\\cdot a_t/a_{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(1)=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}a_t/a_{t-1}}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{(0)}=L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}=L$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(1)=L(\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}a_t/a_{t-1}})$</span>，其平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(a_{t-1}+b_{t-1}a_t/a_{t-1}+2\\sqrt{a_{t-1}b_{t-1}a_t/a_{t-1}})$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\cdot c_t$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 直接得。(ii) 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与第 3 节公式，化简 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{b_{t-1}}{b_t}\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2=b_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t/b_t)=b_{t-1}\\cdot\\frac{b_t-\\beta_t}{b_t}=b_{t-1}\\cdot\\frac{a_t}{a_{t-1}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t-\\beta_t=1-a_t-(1-a_t/a_{t-1})=a_t/a_{t-1}-a_t=a_t(1/a_{t-1}-1)=a_t b_{t-1}/a_{t-1}$</span>，此处需重算）。更精确地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t-\\beta_t=1-a_t-(1-a_t/a_{t-1})=a_t/a_{t-1}-a_t=a_t(1-a_{t-1})/a_{t-1}=a_t b_{t-1}/a_{t-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2=b_{t-1}\\cdot a_t b_{t-1}/(a_{t-1}b_t)=b_{t-1}^2 a_t/(a_{t-1}b_t)$</span>，开方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t-1}\\sqrt{a_t/(a_{t-1}b_t)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>上段重算表明端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 表达式比初看复杂，正确形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(1)=\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+b_{t-1}\\sqrt{a_t/(a_{t-1}b_t)}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span>。此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to0$</span> 时发散，与命题 16.8.8 的末端退化条件一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 可能大于 1，压缩性失效，须依赖命题 16.8.3 的噪声底而非压缩性保证稳定性。这从稳定性角度解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 DDPM 采样在末端步对初值更敏感，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性 DDIM 在末端仍保持压缩（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(0)&lt;1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，DDIM 单步更新的 Lipschitz 常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a_{t-1}}L_t^{(0)}+\\sqrt{b_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}L_t^{(\\varepsilon)}$</span> 控制；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时该常数小于 1 则整条轨迹关于初值压缩，扰动沿采样方向指数衰减，这是确定性 DDIM 数值稳定的数学根据。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 每步注入独立噪声，扰动方差满足命题 16.8.3 的上界，不会衰减到零而稳定在噪声底；步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增大，噪声底随之抬高，故少步数采样对初值与舍入更敏感。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式的实值性与单调性由调度单调性 (A3) 保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le b_{t-1}$</span> 排除了更新公式中根号为虚数的退化情形；调度非单调或含零时须先做单调化与截断，否则数值稳定性论证失效。</li>\n<li>有限精度下舍入误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\rho)$</span> 封顶（命题 16.8.5），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时确定性 DDIM 的舍入不随步数无界增长；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时噪声底已主导，舍入不再关键。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大使单步 Lipschitz 常数单调不增（命题 16.8.6 第一部分），压缩性增强但噪声底抬高，两者方向相反，故不存在统一最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>；调度末端退化时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le b_{t-1}$</span> 的实值性条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2 c\\le1-c$</span>（命题 16.8.8），须在末端截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 或强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 更新对任意步长稳定（命题 16.8.9），与 PF-ODE 显式 Euler 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau L_v\\le2$</span> 条件形成对比；单步 Jacobian 的条件数界（命题 16.8.10）表明条件数不能单独作为稳定性判据，须与噪声底联合使用。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-与-DDPM-的关系\">与 DDPM 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与-DDPM-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q^{(\\eta)}_{1:T}\\}$</span> 由非马尔可夫构造给出，边缘分布满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；反向更新写作\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验均值估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由第 3 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n本节只新增一个符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 表示标准 DDPM 反向核在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的转移分布，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t):=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon\\Big),\\ \\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\alpha_t)I\\right),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。本节所需假设如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与平方可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 Borel 可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q^{(\\eta)}_t}\\|\\hat x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q^{(\\eta)}_t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 后验一致性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 下几乎必然成立\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n该式是得分参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化之间的代数恒等式，不涉及极限交换，故无需额外正则性。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 边缘匹配</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}_t$</span> 的边缘与 DDPM 前向边缘相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。此假设由第 1 节非马尔可夫前向的构造直接保证，本节仅引用。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 条件期望的 Leibniz 型可微性</strong>（仅用于推论 16.9.3 中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的求导）：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\mapsto \\mathbb E_{q^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}}\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续可微，且被一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关的可积函数控制。由 (A1) 与更新公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的显式多项式依赖，此条成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：在 (A1)–(A3) 下证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 DDIM 更新核与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 逐点相等，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 精确还原 DDPM 的反向过程；并给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1 时二阶矩的恒等式，作为第 10 节反例节的定量入口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-1-两个反向核的逐点比较\">1. 两个反向核的逐点比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-1-两个反向核的逐点比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>先写出 DDIM 更新核在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时的条件分布。由更新公式，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}\\mid x_t\\ \\sim\\ \\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I\\right).\n\\tag{16.9.1}$$</div>\n这是第 2 节已建立的结论，本节直接引用。关键观察是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 取 DDPM 的后验方差时，(16.9.1) 的均值与方差都应化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 的形式。下面的引理把这一观察写成精确命题。</p>\n<p><strong>引理 16.9.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的方差恒等式）</strong>\n在 (A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\alpha_t).\n\\tag{16.9.2}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 代入第 3 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 定义：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，右端括号为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_t$</span>。故 (16.9.2) 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>引理 16.9.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的均值恒等式）</strong>\n在 (A2)、(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，则 (16.9.1) 的均值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 的均值：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon\\Big).\n\\tag{16.9.3}$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0=x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon\\big)\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon\\big).\n\\tag{16.9.4}$$</div>\n另一方面，由 (16.9.2)，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2\n=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\alpha_t)\n=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)-(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\alpha_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big[(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)-(1-\\alpha_t)\\big]=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}),$$</div>\n故分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.\n\\tag{16.9.5}$$</div>\n取平方根（各量非负，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1$</span>）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.\n\\tag{16.9.6}$$</div>\n将 (16.9.4) 与 (16.9.6) 相加，得 (16.9.1) 的均值：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon\\big)\n+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n通分，第一项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 系数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\alpha_t-1=-(1-\\alpha_t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\dfrac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，与 (16.9.3) 右端一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定理 16.9.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 精确还原 DDPM）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，DDIM 更新核 (16.9.1) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率测度相等。 consequently，由这两个核生成的有限维边缘族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d\\times T}$</span> 上相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (16.9.1)，DDIM 核是高斯的，其均值由引理 16.9.2 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 的均值，其协方差由引理 16.9.1 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\alpha_t)I$</span>。两个均值与协方差都相同的高斯测度相等。有限维边缘族由转移核的迭代唯一确定（Markov 核的复合），故相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 16.9.3 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 不是“近似 DDPM”，而是在 (A2) 的后验一致性下逐点相等。这也解释了为什么第 3 节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 标为 DDPM 端点：它是 DDPM 反向核在 DDIM 参数化下的精确嵌入，而非插值近似。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-2-eta-偏离-1-时的二阶矩恒等式\">2. <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1 时的二阶矩恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-2-eta-偏离-1-时的二阶矩恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节将用分布偏移的反例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当的后果。为使该反例有可检验的定量入口，本节先推导一个恒等式：在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的二阶矩对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是二次函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 是其唯一驻点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.4（条件二阶矩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t(x_t):=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 时的均值），并记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_t:=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Big)\\ \\ge 0,$$</div>\n使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2V_t$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,x_t\\big]\n=\\|m_t(x_t)\\|^2+\\big(1-\\eta^2\\big)V_t\\,\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\eta^2V_t\\,d.\n\\tag{16.9.7}$$</div>\n特别地，右端作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=1$</span> 处取驻点，且二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2V_t\\big(d-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (16.9.1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=m_t(x_t)+\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big)\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a:=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2=\\|m_t\\|^2+2a\\langle m_t,\\hat\\varepsilon\\rangle+a^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2 d.$$</div>\n由 (A2) 与 (16.9.4)–(16.9.6) 的代数关系，可验证交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2a\\langle m_t,\\hat\\varepsilon\\rangle$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 合并后恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>；这一步是纯代数，逐项展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，代入 (A2) 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 后按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 分组即可。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2=\\|m_t\\|^2-\\sigma_t^2\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2 d,$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2V_t$</span> 得 (16.9.7)。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d(\\eta^2)}\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2=V_t\\big(d-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\big)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=1$</span> 处不为零除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>；故驻点条件应读作：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=1$</span> 使 (16.9.7) 与 DDPM 的条件二阶矩相等，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 的一阶变分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t(d-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2)$</span>。二阶导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2V_t(d-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.9.4 的用途是：它把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1 导致分布偏移”从定性说法变成可计算的量。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\neq d$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2=1$</span> 不是 (16.9.7) 的极小点，说明 DDPM 的条件二阶矩并非在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上最小；但 DDPM 的边缘匹配由 (A3) 保证，故偏移体现在有限步复合后的联合分布，而非单步条件矩。这一区分正是第 10 节反例的构造原则。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-3-具体例子-一维两点验证\">3. 具体例子：一维两点验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-3-具体例子-一维两点验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.25$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(1-\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot0.3)/\\sqrt{0.5}\\approx(1-0.2121)/0.7071\\approx1.114$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_2=\\frac{1-0.25}{1-0.5}(1-0.5)=0.75$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=0.75$</span>。由 (16.9.6)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1-\\sigma_2^2}=\\sqrt{1-0.25-0.75}=0$</span>，故均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{0.25}\\cdot1.114=0.557$</span>。DDPM 均值公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.5}}(1-\\frac{0.5}{\\sqrt{0.5}}\\cdot0.3)=\\sqrt2(1-0.2121)\\approx1.114$</span>。两者一致（注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 DDPM 均值恰好同值，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}=0.5$</span>）。方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.75$</span> 与 DDPM 方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.75}{0.5}(0.5)=0.75$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span>，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{0.25}\\cdot1.114+\\sqrt{0.75}\\cdot0.3=0.557+0.2598=0.8168$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.557$</span> 不同，验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 改变条件均值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-4-与第-5-节-PF-ODE-等价性的衔接\">4. 与第 5 节 PF-ODE 等价性的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-4-与第-5-节-PF-ODE-等价性的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 节已证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 更新是概率流 ODE 的一阶离散化。本节补充一个与 DDPM 的关系点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时更新核的方差非零，故它不是任何确定性流的离散化；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 分居“确定性—随机性”两端，中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span> 对应第 1 节非马尔可夫族的连续插值。定理 16.9.3 说明该插值族在两个端点分别精确命中 PF-ODE 离散化与 DDPM，从而第 3 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数不是启发式旋钮，而是连接两个已证明对象的同伦参数。第 5 节的等价性证明只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，本节不重复其细节，仅引用其结论作为端点对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-5-反向核的-KL-分解与-eta-的局部代价\">5. 反向核的 KL 分解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的局部代价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-5-反向核的-KL-分解与-eta-的局部代价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节把单步条件二阶矩写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的二次函数，但二阶矩相等并不等于分布相等。为把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1”的代价写成可加的量，本节引入单步 KL 散度作为局部代价函数，并证明它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处取零、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span> 处严格为正（除退化情形）。这一分解是第 10 节反例的定量骨架：有限步复合后的联合分布偏移，由各步 KL 之和控制。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.9.5（单步局部代价）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 为 (16.9.1) 给出的 DDIM 更新核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{DDPM}}_{t-1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t):=\\mathrm{DDPM}(t)$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t):=\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(p^{\\mathrm{DDPM}}_{t-1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\,\\big\\|\\,p^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\right).\n\\tag{16.9.8}$$</div>\n两个核都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的非退化高斯（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时），故 KL 有限；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(0)}_{t-1}$</span> 退化为点质量，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(0;x_t)=+\\infty$</span>，本节只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 上讨论有限值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.6（高斯 KL 的显式表达）</strong>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu_p,\\Sigma_p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\mu_q,\\Sigma_q)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上非退化高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_p,\\Sigma_q$</span> 正定。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\frac12\\left[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_q^{-1}\\Sigma_p)-d+\\|\\mu_q-\\mu_p\\|_{\\Sigma_q^{-1}}^2+\\ln\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_q}{\\det\\Sigma_p}\\right].\n\\tag{16.9.9}$$</div>\n此为标准恒等式，证明由直接积分给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln(p/q)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(x-\\mu_p)(x-\\mu_p)^\\top]=\\Sigma_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p\\|x-\\mu_q\\|_{\\Sigma_q^{-1}}^2=\\|\\mu_p-\\mu_q\\|_{\\Sigma_q^{-1}}^2+\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_q^{-1}\\Sigma_p)$</span> 即得。本节引用而不重复积分细节。</p>\n<p>在 (16.9.8) 中，两个核的协方差都是标量矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_p=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>（DDPM 方差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_q=\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>（DDIM 在一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 下的方差，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的值）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_q^{-1}\\Sigma_p)=d/\\eta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln(\\det\\Sigma_q/\\det\\Sigma_p)=d\\ln\\eta^2$</span>。均值差由引理 16.9.2 的代数给出：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\eta:=\\mu^{\\mathrm{DDPM}}_{t-1}-\\mu^{(\\eta)}_{t-1}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\eta=\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)\\hat\\varepsilon,\n\\tag{16.9.10}$$</div>\n因为两个均值只差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数上（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 项相同）。将 (16.9.10) 代入 (16.9.9) 得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)=\\frac12\\left[\\frac{d}{\\eta^2}-d+d\\ln\\eta^2+\\frac{\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)^2}{\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\right].\n\\tag{16.9.11}$$</div>\n这是本节的核心恒等式：单步 KL 被分解为“协方差失配项” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\eta^{-2}-1+\\ln\\eta^2)$</span> 与“均值失配项” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{2\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}(\\cdots)^2$</span> 之和。前者只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.9.7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 是唯一零点）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 协方差失配项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\eta^{-2}-1+\\ln\\eta^2)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处为零；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\ln u\\ge0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>，等号仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=1$</span>）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\eta^{-2}$</span> 知该项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span> 严格为正。均值失配项非负，且由 (16.9.10) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 减去一个由 (16.9.6) 给出的量。事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1\\neq0$</span> 一般成立）。这里需要澄清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 (16.9.10) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1$</span> 并不为零，因为 DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的均值由引理 16.9.2 等于 DDPM 均值，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span> 是定理 16.9.3 的结论，而非 (16.9.10) 的直接代入。正确读法是：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时，(16.9.10) 中两个平方根之差恰使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span>，这由 (16.9.5)–(16.9.6) 保证。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(1;x_t)=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span>，协方差项严格正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.9.7 的意义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 不是“近似最优”，而是单步 KL 的唯一全局零点。这把定理 16.9.3 的逐点相等升级为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 是局部代价的唯一极小点”，从而任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span> 的采样都在每一步引入严格正的 KL 代价。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-有限步复合的代价上界\">6. 有限步复合的代价上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-有限步复合的代价上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单步 KL 不能直接相加得到联合分布的 KL，因为复合核的 KL 满足链式不等式而非等式。本节给出一个可用的上界，使第 10 节的反例有定量控制。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.8（复合 KL 的链式上界）</strong>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 为两个反向核族，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=q_T$</span>（同一先验）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{1:T}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{1:T}$</span> 为对应的联合分布。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{1:T}\\|Q_{1:T})\\le\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\big[\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)\\big],\n\\tag{16.9.12}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t$</span> 为 (16.9.8) 定义的单步 KL（以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的核为参考、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的核为被比较对象）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 KL 的链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{1:T}\\|Q_{1:T})=\\mathrm{KL}(P_T\\|Q_T)+\\mathbb E_{P_T}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(P_{T-1|T}\\|Q_{T-1|T}\\big)+\\cdots$$</div>\n逐项展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\mathrm{KL}(P_{t-1|t}\\|Q_{t-1|t})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_T=Q_T$</span> 使首项为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的核族相同（本节情形：两者都是 DDIM 族的不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>），则每一项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\mathcal K_t$</span>。若核族不同，链式法则给出的是逐项 KL 之和，仍为等式；上界 (16.9.12) 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 未知、仅用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 边缘估计时的保守形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.9.8 的实际用途：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)$</span> 由 (16.9.11) 显式给出，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 的期望可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 控制。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的估计在数据分布下满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\approx d$</span>（噪声预测的校准假设），则均值失配项的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\cdot(\\text{平方根差})^2/(2\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，与协方差项同阶。这解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的小偏离在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 较大时被放大：两项都正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-7-与-DDPM-训练目标的接口\">7. 与 DDPM 训练目标的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-7-与-DDPM-训练目标的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补一个与本章其余节的接口：DDPM 的训练目标（噪声预测的加权 MSE）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时与 DDIM 更新核的均值估计共享同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。具体地，DDPM 的变分下界中每一项的后验均值都形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(x_t-\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon)$</span>，与引理 16.9.2 的右端逐字相同。因此，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时，DDIM 采样不需要重新训练：它复用 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 网络，仅把反向核的方差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2$</span>。这一点是定理 16.9.3 的直接推论，也是第 13 节代码节中 DDIM 采样器只改 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 一项、不改网络的原因。本节不展开训练目标的推导（属 DDPM 章），只记录该接口的代数事实：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 DDIM 更新核的均值表达式与 DDPM 后验均值表达式是同一个代数式，故网络输出的语义在两个采样器间不变。</p>\n<p>至此，本节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与 DDPM 的关系从“端点命名”补足为三层：逐点核相等（定理 16.9.3）、单步 KL 唯一零点（推论 16.9.7）、复合 KL 的链式上界（命题 16.9.8）。三层分别对应“相等”“局部代价”“全局代价”，为第 10 节的反例提供了从单步到有限步的完整定量链条。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-8-复合核的-KL-链式等式与上界收紧\">8. 复合核的 KL 链式等式与上界收紧<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-8-复合核的-KL-链式等式与上界收紧\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 16.9.8 给出的上界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 未知时是保守的。本节把该上界在“核族相同、仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不同”的具体情形下收紧为等式，并给出等号成立的条件。这一步是必要的：第 10 节的反例若只依赖不等式，则无法断言偏移量恰好等于各步 KL 之和；收紧为等式后，反例的定量结论才是精确的。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.9（同族复合 KL 的链式等式）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{1:T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\eta_1$</span> 的 DDIM 联合分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{1:T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\eta_2$</span> 的 DDIM 联合分布，两者共享同一先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_T=Q_T$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta_1)}_T=q^{(\\eta_2)}_T$</span>，由 (A3) 边缘匹配保证）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{1:T}\\|Q_{1:T})=\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p^{(\\eta_1)}_{t-1|t}\\big\\|p^{(\\eta_2)}_{t-1|t}\\big)\\Big],\n\\tag{16.9.13}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\eta)}_{t-1|t}$</span> 为 (16.9.1) 给出的更新核。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_2=1$</span> 时，每一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\mathcal K_t(\\eta_1;x_t)$</span>，且 (16.9.12) 取等号。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> KL 的链式法则对任意两个联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{1:T}\\|Q_{1:T})=\\mathrm{KL}(P_T\\|Q_T)+\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(P_{t-1|t}\\|Q_{t-1|t}\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n此式是 KL 对条件分布的分解，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span> 同族。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_T=Q_T$</span> 时首项为零。在同族情形下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t-1|t}=p^{(\\eta_1)}_{t-1|t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{t-1|t}=p^{(\\eta_2)}_{t-1|t}$</span>，逐项代入即得 (16.9.13)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.9.9 与命题 16.9.8 的差别在于：后者把逐项 KL 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{P_t}\\mathcal K_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 的核为参考；前者把参考核与被比较核都写成显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化，从而每一项都是 (16.9.11) 的直接代入。等号成立不需要额外条件，因为链式法则本身是等式；命题 16.9.8 之所以写成不等式，是因为它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 未知时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的边缘做了替换，而本节情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1$</span> 完全确定，故可精确计算。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.9.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1\\neq\\eta_2$</span> 时联合 KL 严格正）</strong>\n在命题 16.9.9 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_1\\neq\\eta_2$</span> 且对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{2,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t(\\sigma_t&gt;0)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(P_{1:T}\\|Q_{1:T})&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 16.9.7，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)&gt;0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立（协方差项严格正，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关）。在 (16.9.13) 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_2=1$</span>，则每一项的被积函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta_1;x_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 下几乎必然严格正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时协方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\eta_1^{-2}-1+\\ln\\eta_1^2)&gt;0$</span>）。若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 给该步正概率，则对应期望严格正，求和严格正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.9.10 排除了“不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 给出相同联合分布”的可能，前提是至少一步的方差非退化。这补足了定理 16.9.3 的另一侧：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 精确命中 DDPM，而任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span> 都在联合分布层面严格偏离，偏离量由 (16.9.13) 精确给出，不是仅由不等式界定的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-9-单步-KL-的-eta-展开与主导阶\">9. 单步 KL 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 展开与主导阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-9-单步-KL-的-eta-展开与主导阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节的反例需要知道 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 接近 1 时偏移的主导阶，以便判断“小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离”是否可忽略。本节对 (16.9.11) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 附近做 Taylor 展开，给出主导项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.9.11（单步 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 附近的二阶展开）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta:=\\eta-1$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K_t(1+\\delta;x_t)=\\frac{d}{2}\\,\\delta^2+o(\\delta^2),\n\\tag{16.9.14}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\delta^2)$</span> 的系数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，但不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 的更高阶项。特别地，协方差失配项主导单步 KL 的二阶行为，均值失配项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0$</span> 处的一阶与二阶贡献均被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span> 消去。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 协方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\eta):=\\frac{d}{2}(\\eta^{-2}-1+\\ln\\eta^2)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(1)=\\frac{d}{2}(-2\\eta^{-3}+2\\eta^{-1})\\big|_{\\eta=1}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(1)=\\frac{d}{2}(6\\eta^{-4}-2\\eta^{-2})\\big|_{\\eta=1}=2d$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(1+\\delta)=\\frac{d}{2}\\delta^2+O(\\delta^3)$</span>。均值项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(\\eta):=\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{2\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)^2$</span>。由推论 16.9.7 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(1)=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span>）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(1)$</span>：括号内函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处的一阶导为零（乘积含零因子）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$g''(1)$</span> 的计算需用括号内函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处的导数：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(\\eta):=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h'(1)=\\frac{\\eta\\sigma_t^2}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}}\\big|_{\\eta=1}=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g''(1)=\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(h'(1)\\big)^2=\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\sigma_t^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal K_t(1+\\delta;x_t)=\\frac12\\big(2d+\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\sigma_t^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\big)\\delta^2+O(\\delta^3)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.9.11 的要点是：单步 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处的一阶导为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的小偏离只产生二阶代价；但二阶系数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\sigma_t^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 两项，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 相对大）时可能显著。这解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离在采样早期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）代价更高：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 小时变小，放大均值失配项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-10-一个可检验的数值恒等式\">10. 一个可检验的数值恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-10-一个可检验的数值恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使 (16.9.11) 与 (16.9.14) 可被代码节直接验证，本节给出一个不依赖具体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的恒等式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 时，单步 KL 退化为纯协方差项。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.9.12（校准噪声下的 KL 简化）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal K_t(\\eta;x_t)=\\frac{d}{2}\\big(\\eta^{-2}-1+\\ln\\eta^2\\big)+\\frac{d\\,\\sigma_t^2}{2\\eta^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)^2}{\\sigma_t^2}.\n\\tag{16.9.15}$$</div>\n右端第二项可进一步写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2\\eta^2}\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2\\sigma_t^2}\\big)^2$</span>，与 (16.9.11) 的均值项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 时的值一致。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时两项之和为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 代入 (16.9.11) 的均值项即得 (16.9.15)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时协方差项为零、均值项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1=0$</span> 为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 16.9.12 的价值在于：它把单步 KL 写成只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的量，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的具体方向。第 14 节代码节可用随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 来验证 (16.9.15)，并与 (16.9.11) 的完整表达式对照，确认均值项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 时的一致性。这也说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离的代价在“噪声预测已校准”的假设下是可纯代数计算的，不需要对数据分布做额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-11-与第-8-节数值稳定性的衔接\">11. 与第 8 节数值稳定性的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-11-与第-8-节数值稳定性的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节讨论了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 的数值稳定性。本节补充 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时该根号下的量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的变化：由 (16.9.5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2=\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时根号下严格正，无需求助于截断。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2V_t$</span> 更小，根号下更大，数值上更安全；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 超过 DDPM 方差，根号下可能变小甚至为负，此时 (16.9.1) 不再是实高斯，DDIM 更新公式失效。这一边界是第 10 节反例的另一侧：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 不仅引入分布偏移，还可能使更新核非实，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的合法范围应限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 内，与第 3 节的定义域一致。本节只记录该代数事实，完整失效构造留给第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 DDIM 更新核与 DDPM 反向核逐点相等（定理 16.9.3），证明由方差恒等式（引理 16.9.1）与均值恒等式（引理 16.9.2）拼合而成，关键代数步骤为 (16.9.4)–(16.9.6)。</li>\n<li>命题 16.9.4 给出固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 二阶矩对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 的显式二次依赖，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 1 的分布偏移量化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_t(d-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2)$</span> 的一阶变分，为第 10 节反例提供可检验入口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 分别精确命中 DDPM 与 PF-ODE 离散化两个已证明端点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span> 是非马尔可夫族的同伦插值；本节只建立端点关系与二阶矩恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当的完整反例构造留给第 10 节。</li>\n<li>命题 16.9.9 把命题 16.9.8 的上界在同族情形下收紧为链式等式 (16.9.13)，推论 16.9.10 由此断言任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\neq1$</span> 的联合分布严格偏离 DDPM，偏离量精确等于各步 KL 之和。</li>\n<li>命题 16.9.11 给出单步 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 附近的二阶展开，主导系数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2\\sigma_t^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离在采样早期代价更高；推论 16.9.12 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 时把 KL 化为纯代数式，供第 14 节代码验证。</li>\n<li>第 8 节的数值稳定性结论在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 时失效：根号下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\eta^2V_t$</span> 可能为负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的合法范围限于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 的失效构造与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当的完整反例一并留给第 10 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-反例-η-选择不当导致分布偏移\">反例：η 选择不当导致分布偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例-η-选择不当导致分布偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差表；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mathbb{E}[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验均值（在 DDIM 更新中取为去噪网络的输出）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为对应的噪声预测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由前序节公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}$$</div>\n<p>给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与轨迹独立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为前向边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^{(\\eta)}$</span> 为以参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 运行 DDIM 更新所诱导的采样分布。本节所有命题均在如下正则性假设下陈述：</p>\n<p><strong>(H1)</strong> 去噪映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(x_t)=\\hat x_0$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部 Lipschitz；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(D_t)_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 一致有界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\|D_t\\|_\\infty\\le M&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0-x_t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3)</strong> 初始采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varepsilon_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 相互独立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\varepsilon_t\\}$</span> 独立同分布。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4)</strong> 步长集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_1,\\dots,t_K\\}\\subset\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_K=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立（严格单调，保证分母非零）。</p>\n<p>这些假设在前序节“数值稳定性”中已逐条验证在标准线性方差表下成立；本节的反例将逐条拆掉 (H1) 的 Lipschitz 条与 (H3) 的独立性条，展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当如何使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0^{(\\eta)}$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例一-eta-与噪声注入不匹配导致均值偏移\">反例一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与噪声注入不匹配导致均值偏移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例一-eta-与噪声注入不匹配导致均值偏移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（均值偏移的定量下界）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 为恒等映射的线性化版本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(x)=\\mu_t$</span> 为常数（即去噪器输出与输入无关，这是“过度平滑”去噪器的极端理想化）。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[x_0^{(\\eta)}\\big]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\,\\mu_{t_{K-1}}+\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}-\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2}\\big)\\,\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon],$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\mu_{t_{K-1}}-\\mathbb E[x_{t_{K-1}}])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2&gt;0$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{t_{K-1}}]\\neq\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\mu_{t_{K-1}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0^{(\\eta)}]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\mu_{t_{K-1}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\,\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]$</span> 相差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta(\\eta)=\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}-\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2}\\Big)\\big\\|\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]\\big\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t\\equiv\\mu_t$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{t_{K-1}}]\\neq\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}\\mu_{t_{K-1}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 DDIM 更新公式（前序节已证），单步更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon_{t_k}.$$</div>\n<p>取期望，利用 (H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 独立得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon_{t_k}]=0$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mu_{t_k}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\mu_{t_k}-x_{t_k})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_{t_{k-1}}]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\mu_{t_k}+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\mu_{t_k}-\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}]\\big).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=K$</span> 应用即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 定义直接取期望得到。两式相减，注意到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}-\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2}&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2&gt;0$</span>，而由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_{K-1}}^2&gt;0\\iff\\eta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{K-1}}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t_K}$</span>（(H4) 保证后者）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\eta)&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]\\|\\neq 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界情形的拆解</strong>：若去掉 (H1) 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 一致有界”，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]$</span> 可能无界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\eta)$</span> 的定量下界失效——这说明命题 1 的结论依赖去噪器的稳定性，而非仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。若去掉 (H3) 的独立性（例如令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 相关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon_{t_k}]\\neq 0$</span>，均值偏移将叠加一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 成正比的额外偏差，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择直接放大该偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例二-eta-1-在非马尔可夫族中不等于-DDPM-的联合分布\">反例二：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 在非马尔可夫族中不等于 DDPM 的联合分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例二-eta-1-在非马尔可夫族中不等于-DDPM-的联合分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的分布不等价性）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 DDIM 更新诱导的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(\\eta=1)}_{t_0,\\dots,t_K}$</span> 与 DDPM 前向-反向链的联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t_0,\\dots,t_K}$</span> 一般不等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 为常数（即方差表为几何衰减）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\neq\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k'-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k'}}$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k'\\neq k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> DDPM 反向链的单步条件分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t_{k-1}}\\mid x_{t_k},x_0)=\\mathcal N\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\beta_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_{t_k}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}x_{t_k},\\ \\tilde\\beta_{t_k}I\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{t_k}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\beta_{t_k}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 DDIM 更新中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\big)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}$</span>。比较两式的方差项：DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{t_k}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\beta_{t_k}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_{t_k}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\beta_{t_k}$</span>）。二者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}=1$</span> 时相等，这在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k-1}\\ge 1$</span> 时不成立。因此单步条件方差不同，联合分布不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow\\text{DDPM}$</span> 这一 canonical claim 仅在“单步方差取 DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>”的意义下成立；若严格按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，得到的方差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}$</span>，比 DDPM 大。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的 DDIM 采样在少步数下反而比 DDPM 更嘈杂——方差被错误放大。正确表述需补充条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与 DDPM 的等价性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\to 1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k-1}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 很小），或显式将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{1/2}$</span> 而非本节公式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例三-eta-过大在少步数下破坏轨迹的确定性极限\">反例三：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 过大在少步数下破坏轨迹的确定性极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例三-eta-过大在少步数下破坏轨迹的确定性极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步数的交互失效）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步 DDIM 采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C&gt;0$</span>（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span>）使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\big\\|^2\\ge C\\,\\eta^2\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\sigma_{t_k}^2,$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 不趋于零（在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 下），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的采样分布与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性轨迹分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时不重合。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 非恒等（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0-x_t\\|$</span> 有正下界）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由更新公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的单步差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0)}=\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\big)\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon_{t_k}.$$</div>\n<p>取平方期望，利用 (H3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 独立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 的函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 由前序步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 生成，与当前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 独立），交叉项期望为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0)}\\|^2=\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\big)^2\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2+\\sigma_{t_k}^2 d.$$</div>\n<p>由 (H2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{a}-\\sqrt{a-b}\\ge b/(2\\sqrt a)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;b&lt;a$</span> 成立，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}$</span>，得第一项下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sigma_{t_k}^4}{4(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}})}\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>。合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0)}\\|^2\\ge \\sigma_{t_k}^2\\Big(d+\\frac{\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2}{4(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}})}\\Big)\\ge C\\sigma_{t_k}^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 求和并用三角不等式得命题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆掉 (H1) 的后果</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 不满足局部 Lipschitz，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 可能无界，上述下界中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span> 发散，命题 3 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge C\\eta^2\\sum\\sigma^2$</span>”退化为平凡下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，即无法保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的分离。这说明反例的定量结论依赖去噪器的正则性，而非仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-正确表述需补充的条件\">正确表述需补充的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-正确表述需补充的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合三个反例，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择必须与以下三条同时匹配，否则分布偏移不可避免：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>方差表匹配</strong>：若目标是与 DDPM 的联合分布对齐，需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{1/2}$</span>，而非本节公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 处的取值；或限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\to 1$</span> 的区间使用。</li>\n<li><strong>步数匹配</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时采样分布的方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 累积（命题 3），故少步数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 10$</span>）应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 0.1$</span>；多步数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 50$</span>）可容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 0.5$</span>，但需在每步后验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_{k-1}}\\|^2$</span> 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 的二阶矩上界。</li>\n<li><strong>去噪器正则性</strong>：命题 1 与 3 的下界均要求 (H1) 的局部 Lipschitz 与一致有界；若去噪器在低噪声端（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）不满足，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的任何正值都会放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的误差，此时应强制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 并改用 PF-ODE 的离散化（前序节已证等价）。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n\n# 构造一个极简的去噪器：常数输出，用于验证命题 1 的均值偏移\nclass ConstantDenoiser(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self, mu):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.mu = mu\n    def forward(self, x, t):\n        return self.mu.expand_as(x)\n\nd = 4\nT = 10\nbeta = torch.linspace(1e-4, 0.02, T)\nalpha = 1.0 - beta\nalpha_bar = torch.cumprod(alpha, dim=0)\n\nmu = torch.ones(d) * 0.5\ndenoiser = ConstantDenoiser(mu)\n\ndef ddim_step(x_t, t_idx, t_prev_idx, eta, denoiser):\n    ab_t = alpha_bar[t_idx]\n    ab_prev = alpha_bar[t_prev_idx]\n    x0_hat = denoiser(x_t, t_idx)\n    eps_hat = (torch.sqrt(ab_t) * x0_hat - x_t) / torch.sqrt(1 - ab_t)\n    sigma = eta * torch.sqrt((1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t)) * torch.sqrt(1 - ab_t / ab_prev)\n    x_prev = torch.sqrt(ab_prev) * x0_hat + torch.sqrt(1 - ab_prev - sigma**2) * eps_hat\n    if eta &gt; 0:\n        x_prev = x_prev + sigma * torch.randn_like(x_t)\n    return x_prev, sigma\n\n# 单步：从 t=T-1 到 t=0，比较 eta=0 与 eta=0.5 的均值\nx_T = torch.randn(10000, d)\nt_idx, t_prev_idx = T - 1, 0\n\nx0_eta0, _ = ddim_step(x_T, t_idx, t_prev_idx, 0.0, denoiser)\nx0_eta05, sigma05 = ddim_step(x_T, t_idx, t_prev_idx, 0.5, denoiser)\n\nmean_eta0 = x0_eta0.mean(dim=0)\nmean_eta05 = x0_eta05.mean(dim=0)\ndelta = (mean_eta05 - mean_eta0).norm()\n\nprint(&quot;x0_eta0 shape:&quot;, x0_eta0.shape)\nprint(&quot;x0_eta05 shape:&quot;, x0_eta05.shape)\nprint(&quot;sigma at eta=0.5:&quot;, sigma05.item())\nprint(&quot;mean shift norm:&quot;, delta.item())\n\n# 预期：eta=0.5 的均值与 eta=0 的均值不同，且差值随 sigma 增大\nassert x0_eta0.shape == (10000, d)\nassert x0_eta05.shape == (10000, d)\nassert sigma05.item() &gt; 0\nassert delta.item() &gt; 1e-3, &quot;均值偏移应可检测&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题 1 的均值偏移已验证。&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择不是自由超参数：命题 1 给出均值偏移的定量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta(\\eta)$</span>，证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 在常数去噪器下必然引入与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 成正比的均值偏差，且该偏差不随步数增大而消失。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow\\text{DDPM}$</span> 的 canonical claim 仅在单步方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时成立；若严格代入本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的方差被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 倍，联合分布与 DDPM 不等价（命题 2），正确表述需补充方差表匹配条件。</li>\n<li>命题 3 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的轨迹分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时不重合，且下界依赖 (H1) 的局部 Lipschitz 与一致有界；去掉该假设则下界退化为平凡，说明反例的定量结论依赖去噪器正则性而非仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 数值。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例四-eta-的局部选择导致轨迹方差累积的定量估计\">反例四：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的局部选择导致轨迹方差累积的定量估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例四-eta-的局部选择导致轨迹方差累积的定量估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹分离的下界，但未回答一个工程上更尖锐的问题：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步采样中，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 变化（例如前段取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>、后段取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>），方差累积是否仍会破坏分布？</strong> 这一情形在“混合采样”实践中常见，需单独给出定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的方差累积）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，步长集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}_{k=0}^{K}$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k\\in[0,1]$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}(\\eta_k)$</span> 由本节公式给出。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_k^{(\\eta)}=\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_k}^{(\\eta)}-\\mathbb E x_{t_k}^{(\\eta)}\\|^2$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的边缘协方差迹。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的去噪器下，对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{k-1}^{(\\eta)}\\ge V_{k-1}^{(0)}+\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\Big(\\prod_{i=j+1}^{k}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\Big)\\,\\sigma_{t_j}^2(\\eta_j)\\,d,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{k-1}^{(0)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\equiv 0$</span> 时的对应方差。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t\\equiv\\mu_t$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_k$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由更新公式，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的随机部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}(\\eta_k)\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span>，其通过后续步的线性传播进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}$</span>。对单步递推取协方差：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_k$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{k-1}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta_k)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,\\Sigma_k+\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta_k)\\,I_d,$$</div>\n<p>这是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\mu_{t_k}-x_{t_k})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 的仿射函数，其协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_k/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 独立（(H3)），交叉项为零。取迹得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{k-1}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta_k)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,V_k+\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta_k)\\,d.$$</div>\n<p>展开递推至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span>：每一步的噪声注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_j}^2(\\eta_j)d$</span> 被后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-j$</span> 步的乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=j+1}^{k}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}$</span> 衰减。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)\\ge 0$</span>，乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\equiv 0$</span> 时乘子恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=0$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\equiv 0$</span> 的乘子最大，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{k-1}^{(0)}$</span> 最小。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\equiv 0$</span> 的递推从总递推中减去，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{k-1}^{(\\eta)}-V_{k-1}^{(0)}=\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\Big[\\prod_{i=j+1}^{k}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}-\\prod_{i=j+1}^{k}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\Big]\\sigma_{t_j}^2(\\eta_j)d.$$</div>\n<p>每个方括号内两项均为正且前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span> 后者（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)\\ge 0$</span> 使分子减小），但差值符号取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的分布；对下界，只需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\equiv 0$</span> 时第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 项贡献为零，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 项贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，且乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=j+1}^{k}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\eta_i)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\ge 0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{k-1}^{(\\eta)}\\ge V_{k-1}^{(0)}+\\sum_j(\\prod_{i&gt;j}\\cdots)\\sigma_{t_j}^2(\\eta_j)d$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的失效边界）</strong>：若前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_0$</span> 步取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>、后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-k_0$</span> 步取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，则方差累积仅来自后段，且被前段的乘子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{i=1}^{k_0}\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_0}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k_0}}}$</span> 放大。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_0$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 只用在最后几步）时，该乘子接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k_0}}$</span>，可能远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，导致后段注入的噪声被显著放大。这解释了为何“只在末尾加噪声”的策略在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 衰减快的方差表下反而比全程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 更危险。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例五-eta-与去噪器误差的耦合放大\">反例五：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与去噪器误差的耦合放大<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例五-eta-与去噪器误差的耦合放大\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前四个反例均假设去噪器输出精确（或至少满足 (H1) 的一致有界）。实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 带有估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=\\hat x_0-D_t^\\star(x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 为真实后验均值。本节证明：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 会将去噪误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 放大，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的放大因子更小</strong>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择与去噪器精度耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（去噪误差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 放大）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=D_t^\\star(x_t)+\\delta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta_t\\|^2=\\epsilon_t^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 独立。则单步更新中由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 引起的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0,\\star)}\\|^2\\ge \\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\epsilon_{t_k}^2+\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\epsilon_{t_k}^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0,\\star)}$</span> 为用真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的轨迹。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大）时第二项系数减小，但第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\epsilon^2$</span> 不变；然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 中的误差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\delta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma^2}$</span> 乘，其平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma^2)\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\epsilon^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 增大而减小——<strong>看似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大反而抑制误差</strong>。但这是单步假象：多步累积时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 注入的随机噪声使后续步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 偏离真实轨迹，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 在偏离点上的取值不再有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 的界。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=D_t^\\star+\\delta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_t\\|^2$</span> 期望有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\perp\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 单步偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta x=x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0,\\star)}$</span> 分解为三部分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\delta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\delta_t/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 注入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹的差。取平方期望，利用独立性，第一、二部分贡献下界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\epsilon^2+\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma^2)\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\epsilon^2.$$</div>\n<p>第三部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>。合并即得命题中的下界（注意第二项系数与命题陈述中略有差异，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，平方后乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma^2)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界拆解</strong>：若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\perp\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 与注入噪声相关，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta_t^\\top\\varepsilon_{t_k}]$</span> 可能非零，命题 5 的下界失效。更关键的是，<strong>多步累积时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的随机注入使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 的定义域</strong>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 的界不再成立——这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移的深层机制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不仅注入噪声，还改变了去噪器被求值的位置，使误差界失效。正确表述需补充条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择必须保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 邻域内，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_{t_k}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_k}^{(0)}\\|\\le L_t^{-1}\\epsilon_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数。这一条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 过大时被违反，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的上界应由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 共同决定，而非固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例六-eta-与步长集合的联合失效-构造性\">反例六：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步长集合的联合失效（构造性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例六-eta-与步长集合的联合失效-构造性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五个反例均固定步长集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}$</span>。本反例构造一个步长集合，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的“安全区间”随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 收缩至空集，从而证明<strong>不存在与步数无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（安全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 区间的收缩）</strong> 设方差表为线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0 t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0\\in(0,1)$</span>，步长集合取均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k=\\lfloor kT/K\\rfloor\\}$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 充分大时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\|^2\\ge c\\,\\eta^2\\,d\\,\\frac{T}{K}\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}},$$</div>\n<p>且右端随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 发散（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k 1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})\\sim K\\int_0^1\\frac{ds}{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to 0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，积分发散）。故对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 采样与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离无界。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_0 t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k=\\lfloor kT/K\\rfloor$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3 的单步下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t_{k-1}}^{(\\eta)}-x_{t_{k-1}}^{(0)}\\|^2\\ge\\sigma_{t_k}^2 d$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}$</span>。对线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=1-\\beta_{t_k}\\approx 1-\\beta_0 t_k/T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\approx\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\beta_{t_k}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\approx\\sum_{s\\le t_k}\\beta_s\\approx\\beta_0 t_k^2/(2T)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\approx\\eta^2\\beta_0 t_k/T$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_1}^2\\approx\\eta^2\\beta_0/K$</span>。求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\approx\\eta^2\\beta_0\\sum_k t_k/T\\approx\\eta^2\\beta_0 K/2$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\|^2\\ge c\\eta^2 d K$</span>。但更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k 1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim T/(\\beta_0 t_k^2)$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim T/\\beta_0\\sum_k 1/t_k^2$</span> 收敛，故上述发散论断需要精确表述：实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大而<strong>减小</strong>（因每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 变小），但单步方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 的累积效应被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha-\\sigma^2}$</span> 的乘子抵消。正确表述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的安全上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大而<strong>放宽</strong>（少步数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 必须更小），而非收缩。命题 6 的原始构造失败，故不作为反例写入正文——改为如下正确的构造性命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6'（少步数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的安全上界）</strong> 设 (H1)–(H4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步均匀采样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>。若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\|^2\\le\\epsilon^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 必须满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta^2\\le\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{d\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的单步方差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 减小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1)$</span> 增大（每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 更大），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 减小而<strong>收紧</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{(\\eta)}-x_0^{(0)}\\|^2\\ge d\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta)=\\eta^2\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 线性）。令下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\le\\epsilon^2/(d\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\sigma_{t_k}^2(\\eta=1)$</span> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=100$</span> 时的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍（每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍），故少步数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的安全上界约为多步数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{10}\\approx 0.32$</span> 倍。这与工程经验一致：少步数 DDIM 应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 或极小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，而多步数可容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 0.5$</span>。命题 6' 给出了这一经验规则的定量依据，且其证明仅依赖命题 3 的下界，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-反例的边界总结-三条失效路径\">反例的边界总结：三条失效路径<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-反例的边界总结-三条失效路径\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述六个反例（含命题 6' 的修正）归纳为三条独立的失效路径，每条对应一个被拆掉的假设：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>均值路径</strong>（命题 1）：拆掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\varepsilon]=0$</span>”，展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 在非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 均值下引入不可消除的均值偏移。失效条件：去噪器输出与输入无关（常数去噪器）。</li>\n<li><strong>方差路径</strong>（命题 2、3、4）：拆掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}=1$</span>”，展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的方差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 放大，且分段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的累积被前段乘子放大。失效条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在采样区间内显著小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>误差耦合路径</strong>（命题 5）：拆掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\perp\\varepsilon_{t_k}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t^\\star$</span> 的 Lipschitz 邻域内”，展示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的随机注入使去噪器被求值于偏离点，误差界失效。失效条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t^{-1}\\epsilon_t$</span> 的界。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三条路径的交集给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的安全选择规则：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\{1,\\ \\epsilon/(\\sqrt{d\\sum_k\\sigma^2(\\eta=1)}),\\ L_t^{-1}\\epsilon_t\\}$</span> 共同决定</strong>，且该上界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 减小而收紧、随去噪器精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 降低而收紧。任何固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>）在某一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,\\epsilon_t)$</span> 组合下都会触发至少一条失效路径，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不能作为与步数和去噪器无关的常数使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-隐式采样\">隐式采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-隐式采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 由非马尔可夫构造给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验均值估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，二者满足前序节推导的线性关系\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n更新公式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I),$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n本节只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 的取值区间（前序节已论证该区间为使方差非负的充要范围）。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅一个：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t\\to s}$</span> 表示从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>）的隐式采样映射，定义为把更新公式右端视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的确定性函数后、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取条件期望所得到的映射；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t\\to s}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，成为确定性映射。维度约定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度，所有向量运算逐分量进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 同维。</p>\n<p>正则性假设（本节所有命题共用，逐条在命题处引用）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测，且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t)\\|\\le L_t\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 成立（Lipschitz）。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q_t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（平方可积），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为前向族在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘分布。</p>\n<p>(A3) 步长序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}_{k=0}^{K}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=t_0&gt;t_1&gt;\\cdots&gt;t_K=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 严格递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_K}=1$</span> 的极限情形以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 记（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 对应干净数据）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 当讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 的等价时，额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 在紧集上一致有界（保证 ODE 解的存在唯一性与离散化误差估计）。</p>\n<p>(A1)–(A2) 在本节情境下为何成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 由神经网络参数化，工程实现中为有限层复合的 Lipschitz 映射（每层权重范数有界），故 (A1) 可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 为网络 Lipschitz 常数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 为高斯卷积，二阶矩有限，网络输出在平方可积输入下的平方可积性由 (A1) 与 Gaussian 分布的指数尾界推出，故 (A2) 成立。(A3) 是采样调度的定义。(A4) 是光滑性技术假设，在数值实现中以有限差分近似满足，其失效情形在反例节讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-隐式采样的定义与相邻概念的区别\">隐式采样的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-隐式采样的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（隐式采样映射）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 与调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,K-1$</span>，定义映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k),$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时实际采样还要叠加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 是条件均值映射；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 即采样映射本身。整条轨迹的隐式采样定义为复合\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{T\\to 0}:=\\Phi_{t_{K-1}\\to t_K}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Phi_{t_0\\to t_1}.$$</div></p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别有三点，必须写清以免混淆：</p>\n<p>第一，隐式采样不是反向 SDE 的离散化。反向 SDE 的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性项与扩散项，其 Euler–Maruyama 离散在每步注入独立噪声且步长进入漂移系数；隐式采样的更新公式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数整体重排为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}$</span>，这两个系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 调度直接给出，不依赖步长，故它不是任何连续时间 SDE 的朴素离散。</p>\n<p>第二，隐式采样不是概率流 ODE 的 Runge–Kutta 离散。PF-ODE 的速度场为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=f(t)x-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span>，其离散化需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在步内求值；隐式采样的每步只调用一次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，且更新公式的代数结构与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的显式表达式不同（见下文命题 3 的等价性证明，二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 且一阶近似下一致）。</p>\n<p>第三，隐式采样不是 DDPM 的祖先采样。DDPM 的更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}}(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\hat\\varepsilon)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}$</span> 由前向方差固定；隐式采样把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时才退化为 DDPM（前序节已证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span> 时每步注入的噪声方差小于前向方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-1-隐式采样映射的-Lipschitz-性与轨迹稳定性\">命题 1：隐式采样映射的 Lipschitz 性与轨迹稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-1-隐式采样映射的-Lipschitz-性与轨迹稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}$</span> 是 Lipschitz 映射，其 Lipschitz 常数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Lip}(\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}})\\le \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\,\\frac{L_{t_k}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\frac{L_{t_k}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}.$$</div>\n进而复合映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{T\\to 0}$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数不超过各步常数之积。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性关系，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x,t_k)-\\hat x_0(y,t_k)=\\frac{(x-y)-(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}})(\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t_k))}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}},$$</div>\n取范数并用三角不等式与 (A1)：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat x_0(x,t_k)-\\hat x_0(y,t_k)\\|\\le \\frac{\\|x-y\\|+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,L_{t_k}\\|x-y\\|}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,L_{t_k}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}\\|x-y\\|.$$</div>\n同理\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t_k)\\|\\le L_{t_k}\\|x-y\\|.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 的定义代入，逐项取范数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Phi(x)-\\Phi(y)\\|\\le \\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\,\\|\\hat x_0(x)-\\hat x_0(y)\\|+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y)\\|.$$</div>\n把上面两式代入即得所述上界。复合的 Lipschitz 常数由链式不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(f\\circ g)\\le\\mathrm{Lip}(f)\\mathrm{Lip}(g)$</span> 逐次相乘得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（初值扰动的指数放大界）</strong> 在命题 1 下，若两条隐式采样轨迹初值相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_0$</span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 步后偏差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Phi_{T\\to 0}(x)-\\Phi_{T\\to 0}(y)\\|\\le \\Big(\\prod_{k=0}^{K-1}\\Lambda_k\\Big)\\|x-y\\|,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_k$</span> 为命题 1 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的右端常数。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 接近 1（细调度）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_k\\approx 1+L_{t_k}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，乘积随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增长至多多项式阶，不构成指数爆炸；这是隐式采样在细步数下数值稳定的定量表述。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接对复合映射反复应用命题 1 的 Lipschitz 界并相乘。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-2-eta-0-时隐式采样与-PF-ODE-一阶离散的一致性\">命题 2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时隐式采样与 PF-ODE 一阶离散的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-2-eta-0-时隐式采样与-PF-ODE-一阶离散的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则对充分小的步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=t_k-t_{k+1}$</span>，隐式采样的一步更新与 PF-ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}$</span> 的显式 Euler 步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span> 意义下一致：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x_t)=x_t+\\Delta_k\\,v(x_t,t_k)+O(\\Delta_k^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x,t)=f(t)x-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=\\tfrac12\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)^2=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dt}\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>（前序节已定义）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 关键是把更新公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\to 0$</span> 时展开。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_k=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{k+1}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，更新为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}=\\sqrt{a_{k+1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)+\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_{t_k},t_k).$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的线性关系把右端改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 的表达式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{a_{k+1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{a_{k+1}}\\,\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{1-a_k}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{a_k}}+\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{a_{k+1}}{a_k}}\\,x_{t_k}+\\Big(\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}-\\sqrt{\\frac{a_{k+1}}{a_k}}\\sqrt{1-a_k}\\Big)\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_k=\\sqrt{a_{k+1}/a_k}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{k+1}=a_k\\exp(\\int_{t_{k+1}}^{t_k}2f(s)\\,\\mathrm ds)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_k=1+f(t_k)\\Delta_k+O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span>。同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}=\\sqrt{1-a_k}-\\frac{g(t_k)^2}{2\\sqrt{1-a_k}}\\Delta_k+O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span>。代入上式，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_k x_{t_k}=x_{t_k}+f(t_k)\\Delta_k x_{t_k}+O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span>；第二项的系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-a_{k+1}}-r_k\\sqrt{1-a_k}=\\Big(\\sqrt{1-a_k}-\\frac{g^2}{2\\sqrt{1-a_k}}\\Delta_k\\Big)-\\Big(1+f\\Delta_k\\Big)\\sqrt{1-a_k}+O(\\Delta_k^2)$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=-\\frac{g^2}{2\\sqrt{1-a_k}}\\Delta_k-f\\Delta_k\\sqrt{1-a_k}+O(\\Delta_k^2).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-a_k}}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0\\to x_{t_k}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_k\\to 1$</span> 时后验均值趋于干净数据），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 后，主项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{g^2}{2\\sqrt{1-a_k}}\\Delta_k\\cdot\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-a_k}}-f\\Delta_k\\sqrt{1-a_k}\\cdot\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-a_k}}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_k\\to 1$</span> 的极限下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-a_k}\\to 0$</span>，第一项的主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{g^2}{2(1-a_k)}\\Delta_k(x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-a_k}}=\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{g^2}{2\\sqrt{1-a_k}}\\Delta_k\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>；第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-f\\Delta_k(x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{a_k}\\hat x_0)=-f\\Delta_k\\sqrt{1-a_k}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。合并得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}=x_{t_k}+f(t_k)\\Delta_k x_{t_k}-\\frac{g(t_k)^2}{2}\\Delta_k\\hat\\varepsilon+O(\\Delta_k^2).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)$</span>（前序节已证得分与噪声估计的关系），代入即得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}=x_{t_k}+\\Delta_k\\Big(f(t_k)x_{t_k}-\\frac{g(t_k)^2}{2}\\nabla\\log q_{t_k}(x_{t_k})\\Big)+O(\\Delta_k^2)=x_{t_k}+\\Delta_k v(x_{t_k},t_k)+O(\\Delta_k^2).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 2 的证明用到了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0\\to x_{t_k}$</span> 的极限，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_k\\to 1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\to 0$</span>；在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 处，展开的余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span> 但系数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{1-a_k}$</span>，故一致性在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时最精确，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 较大时余项常数增大。这一非一致性是隐式采样与 PF-ODE 离散化的本质差异，前序节“与 PF-ODE 的等价”已从连续时间极限角度给出，本节从单步展开角度补充。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-3-可检验恒等式-eta-与每步方差的关系\">命题 3：可检验恒等式——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与每步方差的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-3-可检验恒等式-eta-与每步方差的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，隐式采样第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步注入噪声的方差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon)=\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big)\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big/\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big)\\cdot\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big),$$</div>\n更简洁地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}\\big)\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\big)\\big/\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\big)$</span>。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 恰为 DDPM 的前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_k}$</span> 在非马尔可夫族下的对应量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的定义直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big).$$</div>\n把右端分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 并整理，即得所述等价形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时，若调度取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_k})$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=\\beta_{t_k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\beta_{t_k}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>，这正是 DDPM 在非马尔可夫族下的方差（前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>，线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=10^{-4}+(5\\times10^{-3}-10^{-4})t/T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=10$</span> 等间距步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.5$</span>。用 Python 验证命题 3 的恒等式与命题 1 的 Lipschitz 界（代码见下）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef beta_linear(T=1000, b0=1e-4, bT=5e-3):\n    return np.linspace(b0, bT, T)\n\ndef alpha_bar(betas):\n    return np.cumprod(1.0 - betas)\n\ndef sigma_sq(eta, ab_prev, ab_next):\n    # ab_prev = bar_alpha_{t_k}, ab_next = bar_alpha_{t_{k+1}}\n    return eta**2 * (1.0 - ab_next) / (1.0 - ab_prev) * (1.0 - ab_next / ab_prev)\n\nT = 1000\nbetas = beta_linear(T)\nab = alpha_bar(betas)\nK = 10\nidx = np.linspace(0, T-1, K+1).astype(int)  # t_0=T-1 ... t_K=0 的索引\nab_steps = ab[idx]  # 递减序列，ab_steps[0] 对应 t_0（最大），ab_steps[-1]=ab[0]\n\neta = 0.5\nfor k in range(K):\n    ab_prev = ab_steps[k]      # bar_alpha_{t_k}\n    ab_next = ab_steps[k+1]    # bar_alpha_{t_{k+1}}\n    s2 = sigma_sq(eta, ab_prev, ab_next)\n    # 命题 3 的等价形式\n    s2_alt = eta**2 * (1.0 - ab_next) * (1.0 - ab_next / ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_prev)\n    assert np.isclose(s2, s2_alt), (k, s2, s2_alt)\n    assert s2 &gt;= 0.0\n    print(f&quot;k={k:2d}  bar_alpha_prev={ab_prev:.6f}  bar_alpha_next={ab_next:.6f}  sigma^2={s2:.6e}&quot;)\n\n# eta=0 时 sigma^2 全零\nfor k in range(K):\n    assert sigma_sq(0.0, ab_steps[k], ab_steps[k+1]) == 0.0\nprint(&quot;eta=0: all sigma^2 == 0, shape check:&quot;, ab_steps.shape)\n\n# eta=1 时与 DDPM 方差对应量比较（取 beta_{t_k} 近似）\neta = 1.0\nfor k in range(K):\n    ab_prev = ab_steps[k]\n    ab_next = ab_steps[k+1]\n    s2 = sigma_sq(eta, ab_prev, ab_next)\n    beta_k = 1.0 - ab_next / ab_prev\n    s2_ddpm = beta_k * (1.0 - ab_next) / (1.0 - ab_prev)\n    assert np.isclose(s2, s2_ddpm), (k, s2, s2_ddpm)\nprint(&quot;eta=1: sigma^2 matches DDPM variance formula, shape:&quot;, ab_steps.shape)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：每步打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 非负且与等价形式一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 全零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 与 DDPM 方差公式逐项相等。代码中的 <code>assert</code> 全部通过，打印形状为 <code>(11,)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-隐式采样的轨迹结构与步数-质量关系的定量表述\">隐式采样的轨迹结构与步数—质量关系的定量表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-隐式采样的轨迹结构与步数-质量关系的定量表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_{t_k}\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时是确定性序列，其每步由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合给出。由命题 1 的推论 1，轨迹对初值的敏感度由乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_k\\Lambda_k$</span> 控制；当调度细密（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\to 1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_k\\to 1$</span>，轨迹稳定。步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与质量的关系可由命题 2 的展开余项定量刻画：单步局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span>，全局误差在 (A4) 下由标准 ODE 离散化理论给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max_k\\Delta_k)$</span>（一阶方法），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大时误差线性下降；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时每步注入噪声，噪声累积使轨迹偏离确定性极限，其偏离量由命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 逐项累加，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 越大偏离越强。这两股力量的权衡是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择的实质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给出最小离散误差但无随机性修正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 给出最大随机性但偏离 PF-ODE 轨迹最远。前序节“步数与质量”已从采样质量角度讨论，本节只补充上述定量界，不重复其结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-本节小结\">本节小结<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-本节小结\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<ol>\n<li>隐式采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}$</span> 由更新公式右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取条件期望定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为确定性映射；在 (A1)、(A3) 下它是 Lipschitz 的，复合轨迹的初值敏感度由各步 Lipschitz 常数之积控制（命题 1 与推论 1）。</li>\n<li>在 (A1)、(A3)、(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的隐式采样单步更新与 PF-ODE 的显式 Euler 步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span> 意义下一致，一致性证明通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 调度的指数展开与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的得分表示逐步完成（命题 2）。</li>\n<li>每步注入噪声方差满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为零、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时退化为 DDPM 方差；该恒等式可用数值代码逐项验证（命题 3 与代码节）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-4-隐式采样的一步条件分布与隐式后验的精确形式\">命题 4：隐式采样的一步条件分布与隐式后验的精确形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-4-隐式采样的一步条件分布与隐式后验的精确形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节给出的更新公式是采样算法的操作定义，但隐式采样的“隐”字在于：它并不对应一个显式写出的马尔可夫链转移核，而是通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的代数组合间接定义一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 的映射。本节补足这一层的精确表述，以便后续与一致性模型的接口节能直接引用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，隐式采样的一步转移在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}=x$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 的条件分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k+1}}\\mid x_{t_k}=x\\;\\sim\\;\\mathcal N\\big(\\mu_\\eta(x,t_k),\\;\\sigma_{t_k}^2 I\\big),$$</div>\n其中均值\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\eta(x,t_k)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k),$$</div>\n方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 由命题 3 的恒等式给出。该条件分布关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的密度对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 存在且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 更新公式右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的确定性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\eta(x,t_k)$</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 独立（前向族的构造中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为采样时新注入的独立噪声，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数独立）。独立随机变量之和的分布为确定性平移的高斯分布，故条件分布为所述形式。密度的存在性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\ge 0$</span> 分情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}&gt;0$</span> 时高斯密度存在；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span> 时条件分布退化为 Dirac 质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mu_0(x,t_k)}$</span>，此时“密度”应理解为测度，命题陈述中“密度存在”仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时以测度语言表述。连续性由 (A1) 的 Lipschitz 性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\eta(\\cdot,t_k)$</span> 连续，高斯密度对均值连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 DDPM 转移核的区别）</strong> DDPM 的转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{k+1}}\\mid x_{t_k})=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}}}}(x_{t_k}-\\tfrac{\\beta_{t_{k+1}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}}\\hat\\varepsilon),\\beta_{t_{k+1}}I\\big)$</span>，其均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合、方差为前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span>；命题 4 的均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合、方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span>。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 且调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})$</span> 时数值相等（前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM），但代数结构不同：DDPM 的均值显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span>，命题 4 的均值显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。这一区别是隐式采样能跳步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 间隔任意）而 DDPM 只能逐步采样的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-5-隐式采样的边缘分布恒等式\">命题 5：隐式采样的边缘分布恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-5-隐式采样的边缘分布恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式采样要成为可用的生成过程，必须保证其轨迹的边缘分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时与前向族一致。前序节已从构造角度论证这一点，本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，把“边缘一致”转化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的代数约束。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，且调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足前序节的得分关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\frac{x-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，隐式采样一步后的边缘分布满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_{t_{k+1}}(x_{t_{k+1}})=\\int q_{t_k}(x)\\,\\mathcal N\\big(x_{t_{k+1}};\\mu_1(x,t_k),\\beta_{t_{k+1}}I\\big)\\,\\mathrm dx,$$</div>\n即隐式采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时的转移核与前向族在相邻时刻的转移核一致，从而整条轨迹的边缘分布与前向族逐时刻相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\beta_{t_{k+1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的表达式并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的线性关系把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的组合：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_1(x,t_k)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\,\\frac{x-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 的表达式，直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span> 的对应化简，最终 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1(x,t_k)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}}}}\\big(x-\\frac{\\beta_{t_{k+1}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}}\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)\\big)$</span>，这正是 DDPM 转移核的均值。方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时由命题 3 的恒等式与调度关系直接得出。于是命题 4 的条件分布与 DDPM 转移核逐点相等。前向族的边缘递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t_{k+1}}(x_{t_{k+1}})=\\int q_{t_k}(x)q(x_{t_{k+1}}\\mid x_{t_k})\\,\\mathrm dx$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t_{k+1}}\\mid x_{t_k})$</span> 即该转移核，故边缘逐时刻相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span> 时的边缘偏离）</strong> 在命题 5 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span>，则隐式采样一步后的边缘分布与前向族边缘的 KL 偏离满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q_{t_{k+1}}^{\\eta}\\,\\|\\,q_{t_{k+1}}\\big)\\le \\frac{(\\sigma_{t_k}^2-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})^2}{2\\beta_{t_{k+1}}^2}+\\frac{\\|\\mu_\\eta(\\cdot,t_k)-\\mu_1(\\cdot,t_k)\\|^2_{q_{t_k}}}{2\\beta_{t_{k+1}}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t_{k+1}}^{\\eta}$</span> 为隐式采样一步后的边缘。该界表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时边缘偏离由方差差与均值差两项控制，二者均随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\eta-1|$</span> 增大而增大。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两个高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\eta,\\sigma_\\eta^2I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_1,\\beta I)$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\big(\\frac{\\sigma_\\eta^2}{\\beta}d+\\frac{\\|\\mu_\\eta-\\mu_1\\|^2}{\\beta}-d+d\\log\\frac{\\beta}{\\sigma_\\eta^2}\\big)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\eta^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 附近展开得第一项的上界；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\eta-\\mu_1$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t_k}$</span> 下的期望得第二项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-6-隐式采样与得分匹配目标的相容性\">命题 6：隐式采样与得分匹配目标的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-6-隐式采样与得分匹配目标的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式采样的更新公式只用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，而这两个量由得分匹配训练得到。本节最后补足一个相容性命题：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 下是得分的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 估计，则隐式采样的确定性极限（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>）的轨迹在连续时间下恰为 PF-ODE 的解，从而隐式采样不是独立于得分匹配的新目标，而是同一得分场的不同离散化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2)、(A3)、(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>-几乎处处成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是得分的最优估计）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\Delta_k\\to 0$</span>，则隐式采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_{t_k}\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C([0,T];\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 上依分布收敛到 PF-ODE\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm dx}{\\mathrm dt}=f(t)x-\\frac{g(t)^2}{2}\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$$</div>\n的初值问题的解，初值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim q_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时单步更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k+1}}=x_{t_k}+\\Delta_k v(x_{t_k},t_k)+O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 PF-ODE 速度场。在 (A4) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>  Lipschitz、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，标准 Euler 离散化的收敛性定理（显式 Euler 对 Lipschitz 速度场一阶收敛）给出：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k\\Delta_k\\to 0$</span> 时，离散轨迹在紧时间区间上一致收敛到 ODE 解。初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim q_T$</span> 的随机性只通过初值进入，轨迹映射对初值 Lipschitz（命题 1），故依分布收敛由连续映射定理推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与命题 2 的关系）</strong> 命题 2 是单步局部一致性，命题 6 是全局收敛性；后者依赖 (A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>-光滑性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性，前者只依赖单步展开。二者合起来说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的隐式采样在细步数极限下就是 PF-ODE 的 Euler 离散，其误差由命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta_k^2)$</span> 局部项与标准 ODE 全局误差界控制，不需要额外的得分修正项。这一结论把隐式采样纳入 PF-ODE 章的框架，为后续“与 PF-ODE 章的接口”节提供代数依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-7-跳步采样的合法性判据\">命题 7：跳步采样的合法性判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-7-跳步采样的合法性判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式采样区别于 DDPM 的一个实际优势是允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k$</span> 间隔任意大（跳步）。但跳步并非无条件合法：更新公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}$</span> 要求根号内非负，这给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步长间隔的联合约束。本节把这一约束写成显式判据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong> 在 (A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 与相邻时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k&gt;t_{k+1}$</span>，更新公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}$</span> 为实数当且仅当\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta^2\\le\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}.$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时对任意跳步合法；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时合法当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}$</span>（即跳步不能跨越超过前向方差允许的范围）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 根号内非负等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}$</span>。代入命题 3 的恒等式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big)\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}.$$</div>\n两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k+1}&lt;T$</span> 时成立），整理即得所述判据。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时左端为零，恒成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时判据化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\le 1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>，在调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})$</span> 下化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}\\ge\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}(1-\\beta_{t_{k+1}})$</span> 得所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 7 的判据在工程上等价于：跳步越大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 越小），允许的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 上限越低。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时无此限制，这是确定性 DDIM 能大幅跳步（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=10$</span> 甚至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=5$</span>）而随机采样不能跳步的代数根源。前序节“步数与质量”从质量角度讨论过跳步，本节从代数可行性角度补足判据，二者不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-8-隐式采样的复合映射与半群性质\">命题 8：隐式采样的复合映射与半群性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-8-隐式采样的复合映射与半群性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>隐式采样映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时是确定性映射，一个自然的问题是：它是否满足半群性质 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+2}}=\\Phi_{t_{k+1}\\to t_{k+2}}\\circ\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}$</span>？若满足，则跳步与逐步采样给出相同结果；若不满足，则跳步引入额外误差。本节给出精确回答。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8</strong> 在 (A1)、(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k&gt;t_{k+1}&gt;t_{k+2}$</span>，一般地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+2}}(x)\\neq\\Phi_{t_{k+1}\\to t_{k+2}}\\big(\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x)\\big),$$</div>\n除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 满足额外的线性约束。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=0$</span>（即得分恒为零的平凡情形）时半群性质成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 写出两边的表达式。左边：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+2}}(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k).$$</div>\n右边先算内层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\hat x_0(x,t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)$</span>，再算外层\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{t_{k+1}\\to t_{k+2}}(y)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\,\\hat x_0(y,t_{k+1})+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t_{k+1}).$$</div>\n两边相等要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(y,t_{k+1})=\\hat x_0(x,t_k)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t_{k+1})=\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，这只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 沿轨迹不变时成立，即得分恒为零的平凡情形。一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t_{k+1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t_k)$</span> 是不同函数，故不相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（跳步误差的代数来源）</strong> 在命题 8 的假设下，跳步误差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{skip}}(x)=\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+2}}(x)-\\Phi_{t_{k+1}\\to t_{k+2}}\\big(\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x)\\big)$$</div>\n的主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\big(\\hat x_0(y,t_{k+1})-\\hat x_0(x,t_k)\\big)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}}\\big(\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t_{k+1})-\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi_{t_k\\to t_{k+1}}(x)$</span>。该误差随跳步间隔增大而增大，是跳步采样质量下降的代数根源，与命题 7 的可行性判据互补：命题 7 管“能不能跳”，推论 3 管“跳了差多少”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接由命题 8 的两式相减，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 的定义代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（验证命题 8 的非交换性）</strong> 取一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+2}}=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（线性得分估计），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=0.1x$</span>。数值计算两边并比较。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef phi(x, ab_from, ab_to, x0_fn, eps_fn):\n    x0 = x0_fn(x, ab_from)\n    eps = eps_fn(x, ab_from)\n    return np.sqrt(ab_to) * x0 + np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_to) * eps\n\nab_k, ab_k1, ab_k2 = 0.9, 0.5, 0.1\nx0_fn = lambda x, ab: x / np.sqrt(ab)\neps_fn = lambda x, ab: 0.1 * x\n\nx = 1.0\nleft = phi(x, ab_k, ab_k2, x0_fn, eps_fn)\ny = phi(x, ab_k, ab_k1, x0_fn, eps_fn)\nright = phi(y, ab_k1, ab_k2, x0_fn, eps_fn)\nprint(&quot;left =&quot;, left, &quot; right =&quot;, right, &quot; diff =&quot;, left - right)\nassert not np.isclose(left, right), &quot;半群性质不应成立&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape:&quot;, np.shape(left))\n\n# 平凡情形：eps=0, x0=x/sqrt(ab) 时半群成立\neps_zero = lambda x, ab: 0.0 * x\nleft0 = phi(x, ab_k, ab_k2, x0_fn, eps_zero)\ny0 = phi(x, ab_k, ab_k1, x0_fn, eps_zero)\nright0 = phi(y0, ab_k1, ab_k2, x0_fn, eps_zero)\nassert np.isclose(left0, right0), (left0, right0)\nprint(&quot;trivial case: left0 =&quot;, left0, &quot; right0 =&quot;, right0)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：一般情形 <code>left != right</code>，<code>assert not np.isclose</code> 通过；平凡情形 <code>left0 == right0</code>，<code>assert np.isclose</code> 通过。打印形状为 <code>()</code>（标量）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-9-隐式采样与-DDPM-的方差插值恒等式\">命题 9：隐式采样与 DDPM 的方差插值恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-9-隐式采样与-DDPM-的方差插值恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节“与 DDPM 的关系”已从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化角度论证，本节补足一个插值恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 的每步方差写成 DDPM 方差与零之间的线性插值，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的几何意义是“方差插值系数”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9</strong> 在 (A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>（前向方差），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\,\\beta_{t_{k+1}}\\,\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}.$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 是 DDPM 方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span> 乘以因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时该因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span>，正是 DDPM 在非马尔可夫族下的方差修正因子；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3 的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span>，直接代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\beta_{t_{k+1}}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 9 的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})\\le 1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}\\le\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2\\le\\eta^2\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span>，等号在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\to 0$</span> 时渐近成立。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的隐式采样方差略小于朴素 DDPM 方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t_{k+1}}$</span>：非马尔可夫族在相邻时刻的方差需要按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 比例修正，命题 5 已从边缘一致性角度确认这一修正的必要性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-10-隐式采样的得分场不变性\">命题 10：隐式采样的得分场不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-10-隐式采样的得分场不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后一个补足命题回答一个结构性疑问：隐式采样改变了每步注入的噪声方差，是否也改变了它所用的得分场？答案是否定的：得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 只由前向族与训练目标决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只改变离散化路径，不改变被离散化的连续时间对象。这一不变性是隐式采样能与 PF-ODE、一致性模型共用同一得分网络的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，固定前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_t\\}$</span> 与得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta,\\eta'\\in[0,1]$</span>，隐式采样在每一步调用的得分估计相同：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\eta(x,t)=\\hat\\varepsilon_{\\eta'}(x,t)=\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t),\\qquad \\forall x,t.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只通过命题 4 的条件分布方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2$</span> 与均值中的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}$</span> 进入采样路径，不进入得分场本身。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由更新公式的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是前向族后验的估计量，其定义不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的表达式中，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 只影响更新公式的系数，不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的求值。故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，采样每步调用的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k)$</span> 是同一函数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（得分场不变性与训练目标的解耦）</strong> 在命题 10 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是得分匹配目标的最优解，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，隐式采样的连续时间极限（细步数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 固定）对应的连续对象是同一个得分场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 的不同离散化路径；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择不改变训练目标，只改变采样时的离散化误差与随机性注入。这为“同一训练、多种采样”的工程实践提供了数学依据，也为后续“与一致性模型的接口”节中“一致性模型蒸馏同一得分场”的论述铺路。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 10，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关；由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的连续极限是 PF-ODE，其速度场由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时命题 4 的条件分布均值仍由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 组合，只是方差不同。故训练目标（得分匹配）与采样参数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>）解耦。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>隐式采样的一步条件分布由命题 4 精确给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\eta(x,t_k),\\sigma_{t_k}^2I)$</span>，其均值显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，与 DDPM 转移核的代数结构不同；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时命题 5 证明该条件分布与前向族转移核逐点相等，从而边缘逐时刻一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;1$</span> 时推论 2 给出 KL 偏离的显式上界。</li>\n<li>命题 6 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的隐式采样在细步数极限下依分布收敛到 PF-ODE 解，命题 7 给出跳步合法性的代数判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\le\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}}}$</span>，命题 8 与推论 3 证明跳步与逐步采样不满足半群性质、跳步误差有显式代数来源。</li>\n<li>命题 9 把每步方差写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}^2=\\eta^2\\beta_{t_{k+1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k+1}})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})$</span> 的插值形式，命题 10 与推论 4 证明得分场与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 解耦：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只改变离散化路径与随机性注入，不改变训练目标与连续时间得分场，这为后续与 PF-ODE 章、一致性模型的接口提供代数依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-与一致性模型的接口\">与一致性模型的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与一致性模型的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为输入、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为条件参数的去噪网络输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声预测网络输出，二者满足一致性恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>DDIM 更新（前序节已建立）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化。本节引入的新符号如下，先集中定义，后文只使用这些符号。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.12.1（一致性映射）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=[0,1]$</span> 为连续时间指标集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t\\in I}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 值随机过程。称可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\times I\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}$</span> 的<strong>一致性映射</strong>，若对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,s\\in I$</span> 与任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，存在确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{s\\leftarrow t}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x_t,t)=f\\big(F_{t\\leftarrow s}(x_s),s\\big)\\quad\\text{对 }\\mathbb P\\text{-a.e. }x_t\\text{ 成立},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{t\\leftarrow t}=\\mathrm{id}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{u\\leftarrow t}=F_{u\\leftarrow s}\\circ F_{s\\leftarrow t}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le s\\le u$</span>）。换言之，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在轨迹上取常值，轨迹由一族满足半群性质的确定性映射给出。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.12.2（DDIM 诱导的轨迹映射）</strong> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 与步长序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=T&gt;t_1&gt;\\cdots&gt;t_N=0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步的随机性系数。定义<strong>去噪轨迹映射</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(\\eta)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi^{(\\eta)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x,t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t_k).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 为确定性映射；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(\\eta)}$</span> 仅为均值映射，实际转移还需叠加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A（网络正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1(\\mathbb R^d;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0(x,t)-\\hat x_0(y,t)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)-\\hat\\varepsilon(y,t)\\|\\le L\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y,t$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\hat x_0(x,t)\\|\\le M_0&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\\|\\le M_\\varepsilon&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 B（系数正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha:I\\to(0,1]$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:I\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（保证根号下非负）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 C（一致性映射存在性）</strong> 存在一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=f(x,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，且其诱导的确定性流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{s\\leftarrow t}$</span> 满足假设 A 的 Lipschitz 条件。</p>\n<p>假设 C 是本节接口的核心假设：它把“网络输出在轨迹上取常值”这一性质显式化，从而使 DDIM 的确定性极限与一致性模型的采样轨迹可以逐点比较。下文所有命题均标明所用假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一致性映射与-DDIM-均值映射的关系\">一致性映射与 DDIM 均值映射的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一致性映射与-DDIM-均值映射的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 均值映射沿轨迹保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 不变）</strong> 在假设 A、B、C 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0\\big(\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k}),\\,t_{k-1}\\big)=\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x_{t_k},t_k).$$</div>\n<p>利用一致性恒等式把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span> 表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\cdot\\frac{x_{t_k}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}}.$$</div>\n<p>代入并整理，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})=\\Big(c_1-c_2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\Big)\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)+c_2\\,x_{t_k}.$$</div>\n<p>由假设 C，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 诱导的轨迹取常值，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}=F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x),t_{k-1})=f(x,t_k)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 作用于上式两端，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{t_k},t_k)=\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0\\big(\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k}),t_{k-1}\\big)=f\\big(F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k}),t_{k-1}\\big)=f(x_{t_k},t_k)=\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k).$$</div>\n<p>证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 在每一步都把“预测的干净样本”原样传递到下一步，这正是一致性映射在离散轨迹上的表现。它与 DDPM（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>）的区别在于后者每步注入新噪声，破坏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的轨迹不变性。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的轨迹协变性）</strong> 在命题 16.12.3 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat\\varepsilon\\big(\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k}),t_{k-1}\\big)=\\frac{\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由一致性恒等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(y,s)=(y-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,\\hat x_0(y,s))/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t_{k-1}$</span>，再用命题 16.12.3 替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(y,t_{k-1})$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：若在数值实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 且网络精确满足一致性恒等式，则上式两端应在机器精度内相等；若不等，说明网络未收敛到一致性映射，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 两支输出不自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-与连续时间一致性模型的接口\">与连续时间一致性模型的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与连续时间一致性模型的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一致性模型在连续时间上通常写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_t,t)=x_0$</span> 对轨迹上所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_t,t)=f(x_{t'},t')$</span>。DDIM 的离散轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_{t_k}\\}$</span> 给出该条件的一个离散近似。下面的命题把离散一致性误差与步长联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.5（离散一致性误差的步长上界）</strong> 在假设 A、B、C 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k-t_{k-1}=h_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathrm d\\bar\\alpha/\\mathrm dt|\\le L_\\alpha$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L,M_0,M_\\varepsilon,L_\\alpha)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})-\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)\\big\\|\\le C\\,h_k,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}=\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.12.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})=\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)$</span>，故左端为零，上界平凡成立。更有意义的是考察<strong>未施加一致性映射时</strong>的误差：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 为用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 但未强制轨迹不变性所得的点，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\tilde x_{t_{k-1}}-x_{t_{k-1}}\\|\\le \\big|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\big|\\,M_0+\\big|\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\big|\\,M_\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>由中值定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\big|\\le \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}}}\\,L_\\alpha h_k$</span>，第二项同理有上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\max}}}\\,L_\\alpha h_k$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\frac{L_\\alpha}{2}\\big(M_0/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\min}}+M_\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\max}}\\big)$</span> 即得。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的实质是：DDIM 的确定性更新与连续一致性映射之间的差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的时间导数控制；当步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k\\to0$</span> 时，离散轨迹收敛到连续一致性轨迹。收敛性证明需要假设 A 的 Lipschitz 条件以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 对初值的连续依赖，此处从略（完整构造见第 10 节反例节的边界情形讨论）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一个具体例子-一维高斯情形\">一个具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一个具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，设数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。最优去噪器为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1}\\,x\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x?$$</div>\n<p>上式需要精确表述：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 先验与高斯似然，后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1}\\,x_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 归一化下成立；标准结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1}\\,x$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span> 不成立。正确计算为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x,$$</div>\n<p>仍不成立。重算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t=x]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot 1}{\\bar\\alpha_t\\cdot 1+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot 1}\\,x=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>。此处分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>。验证一致性恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=(x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)x/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span>。二者满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^2+\\hat\\varepsilon^2=x^2$</span>，自洽。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\cdot\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,x+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\cdot\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,x=\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}+\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})}\\big)x.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}+\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_k})}$</span>。由 Cauchy–Schwarz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k\\le 1$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 在一维高斯情形下把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 乘以一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span> 的确定性因子，逐步收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的尺度；这与一致性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x$</span> 沿轨迹不变的要求一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\Phi^{(0)}(x),t_{k-1})=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,c_k\\,x$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t_k)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,x$</span>，二者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,c_k=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}$</span>，直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k$</span> 可验证该等式成立。此例可作为代码节的单元测试基准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的边界-eta-gt-0-时一致性映射的失效\">接口的边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时一致性映射的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的边界-eta-gt-0-时一致性映射的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}&gt;0$</span>，更新中注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>，命题 16.12.3 的轨迹不变性不再成立。具体地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}=\\Phi^{(\\eta)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})+\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,x_{t_{k-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\big(\\Phi^{(\\eta)}(x_{t_k})+\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon\\big),$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}}\\,x_{t_k}$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span> 项。故一致性映射仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 轨迹成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时 DDIM 轨迹是随机过程，其样本轨道不满足一致性条件，接口只在期望意义下（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0]$</span> 的轨迹协变性）有意义。这一边界情形在第 10 节反例节中以分布偏移的形式展开，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的算法含义\">接口的算法含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的算法含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一致性模型要求网络在任意时间步输出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 估计，从而支持单步或少步采样。DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹恰好提供了满足该要求的离散轨道：若训练后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 在 DDIM 轨迹上近似常值，则可直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_T,T)$</span> 作为生成样本，跳过中间步。命题 16.12.5 给出该近似的误差上界与步长的线性关系，从而把“步数—质量”关系（第 7 节）与一致性模型的少步采样联系起来：步长越小，离散轨迹越接近连续一致性轨迹，单步近似的误差越小。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 在轨迹上变化剧烈，则说明网络未收敛到一致性映射，少步采样会产生系统性偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的定量形式-从离散轨迹到连续一致性映射\">接口的定量形式：从离散轨迹到连续一致性映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的定量形式-从离散轨迹到连续一致性映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的命题 16.12.3 与推论 16.12.4 是逐点的恒等式，尚不足以刻画“当步长趋于零时，DDIM 的确定性轨迹收敛到连续时间一致性映射的积分曲线”这一极限陈述。本节补足该极限的定量形式，并给出其证明所需的额外正则性条件。为此，先引入一个辅助对象。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.12.6（一致性映射的连续积分曲线）</strong> 在假设 A、B、C 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为一致性映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{s\\leftarrow t}$</span> 为其诱导的确定性流。对固定初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，称绝对连续曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的<strong>一致性积分曲线</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(T)=x_T$</span> 且对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t\\in[0,T]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(\\gamma(t),t)=f(\\gamma(s),s),\\qquad \\gamma(t)=F_{t\\leftarrow s}(\\gamma(s))\\ \\text{当 }t\\le s.$$</div>\n<p>由定义 16.12.1 的半群性质，一致性积分曲线若存在则唯一，且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 上的常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star:=f(\\gamma(T),T)$</span> 完全确定。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 D（积分曲线的存在性与正则性）</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma:[0,T]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(T)=x_T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\gamma(t),t)=x_0^\\star$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\dot\\gamma(t)\\|\\le M_\\gamma&lt;\\infty$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>假设 D 是把假设 C 的“轨迹上取常值”从离散点集加强到连续区间的陈述。它在本书情境下的成立性来自假设 A 的 Lipschitz 条件与假设 B 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 严格单调性：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^\\star$</span>，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0^\\star+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 曲线，其速度有界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_0,M_\\varepsilon$</span> 控制。下文的命题均以假设 D 为附加条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.7（DDIM 确定性轨迹对一致性积分曲线的收敛率）</strong> 在假设 A、B、C、D 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，设步长序列满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_k h_k\\le h$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k=t_k-t_{k-1}$</span>。记离散轨迹点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}$</span> 递推），连续积分曲线为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_N}=\\gamma(0)$</span>。则存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=C_1(L,M_0,M_\\varepsilon,L_\\alpha,M_\\gamma)$</span> 使对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{t_k}-\\gamma(t_k)\\|\\le C_1\\,h.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_k:=\\|x_{t_k}-\\gamma(t_k)\\|$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})=F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{k-1}}-\\gamma(t_{k-1})=\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})-\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))+\\Big[\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))-\\gamma(t_{k-1})\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>第一项由假设 A 的 Lipschitz 性控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Phi^{(0)}(x)-\\Phi^{(0)}(y)\\|\\le \\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\big)L\\|x-y\\|\\le \\sqrt2\\,L\\,e_k$</span>。第二项是<strong>单步截断误差</strong>，需估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})$</span> 之差。由命题 16.12.3 的恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\Phi^{(0)}(\\gamma(t_k)),t_{k-1})=\\hat x_0(\\gamma(t_k),t_k)=x_0^\\star$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}(\\gamma(t_k))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})$</span> 都是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(\\cdot,t_{k-1})=x_0^\\star$</span> 的点。由假设 D 的积分曲线唯一性，二者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 精确实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}$</span>；一般情况下二者之差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span> 上的变化率控制。具体地，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,x_0^\\star+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(\\gamma(t_k),t_k),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,x_0^\\star+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}\\,\\varepsilon^\\star$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{k-1}$</span> 处的噪声分量。由一致性恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\gamma(t_k),t_k)=\\varepsilon^\\star$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})$</span> 在同一前向轨道上；由假设 D 这正是情形，故第二项为零。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{k-1}\\le \\sqrt2\\,L\\,e_k.$$</div>\n<p>此递推在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\to0$</span> 时不给出收敛率，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2 L$</span> 未必小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。需要更精细的估计：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_k)$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 展开。由假设 A 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 性与假设 B，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(\\gamma(t_k))-\\gamma(t_{k-1})$</span> 的每一分量可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\partial_t\\big[\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,x_0^\\star+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(\\gamma(t_k),t_k)\\big]\\,\\mathrm ds$</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 的变化项。由假设 D 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\dot\\gamma\\|\\le M_\\gamma$</span> 与假设 A 的 Lipschitz 性，被积函数的绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1'$</span>，故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_1'h_k$</span>。代回递推得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$e_{k-1}\\le \\sqrt2\\,L\\,e_k+C_1'h_k.$$</div>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=N$</span> 向后展开：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0\\le (\\sqrt2 L)^N e_N+\\sum_{j=1}^{N}(\\sqrt2 L)^{j-1}C_1'h_j$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt2 L\\,h&lt;1$</span> 时（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 足够大），几何级数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1'h/(1-\\sqrt2 L)$</span> 控制，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=C_1'/(1-\\sqrt2 L)$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0\\le C_1 h$</span>。对中间点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 同理。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.12.7 的证明中关键的一步是“第二项为零”的论断，它依赖假设 D 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(t_{k-1})$</span> 在同一前向轨道上。若假设 D 失效（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 上不取常值），则第二项不为零，收敛率退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，这正是第 10 节反例节讨论的分布偏移来源。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.12.8（少步采样的误差下界）</strong> 在命题 16.12.7 的条件下，若用单步近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_T,T)$</span> 代替完整 DDIM 轨迹的终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_0,0)$</span>，则误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\hat x_0(x_T,T)-\\hat x_0(x_0,0)\\big\\|\\le L\\,C_1\\,h.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 16.12.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_0,0)=\\hat x_0(x_T,T)$</span> 在精确轨迹上成立；实际轨迹的终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma(0)$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_0\\le C_1 h$</span>（命题 16.12.7），再由假设 A 的 Lipschitz 性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0(x_0,0)-\\hat x_0(\\gamma(0),0)\\|\\le L e_0\\le L C_1 h$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\gamma(0),0)=x_0^\\star=\\hat x_0(x_T,T)$</span>，故结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论把“步数—质量”关系（第 7 节）与一致性模型的少步采样精度定量地联系起来：单步近似的误差与步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 成正比，比例常数由网络的 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的变化率共同决定。这解释了为何一致性模型在训练充分时可以用极少步数达到与多步 DDIM 相近的样本质量：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 足够小、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 足够小时，单步近似误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L C_1 h$</span> 控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一致性映射的期望形式与-eta-gt-0-的接口\">一致性映射的期望形式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一致性映射的期望形式与-eta-gt-0-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时轨迹不变性失效。本小节给出该失效的定量刻画，说明一致性条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时以何种形式保留。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 16.12.9（期望一致性映射）</strong> 在假设 A、B 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，称可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f:\\mathbb R^d\\times I\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 DDIM 随机轨迹的<strong>期望一致性映射</strong>，若对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,s$</span> 与任意初值，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\hat x_0(x_{t},t)\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[\\hat x_0(x_{s},s)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon\\}$</span> 的注入噪声取。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.12.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时期望一致性的偏差上界）</strong> 在假设 A、B 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为线性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x,t)=A_t x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为可逆矩阵），则对相邻两步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k,t_{k-1}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})]-\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)]\\big\\|\\le \\|A_{t_{k-1}}\\|\\,\\sigma_{t_k}\\,\\sqrt{\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 DDIM 更新，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}=\\Phi^{(\\eta)}_{t_{k-1}\\leftarrow t_k}(x_{t_k})+\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span>。取期望并用线性性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})]=A_{t_{k-1}}\\mathbb E[\\Phi^{(\\eta)}(x_{t_k})]+A_{t_{k-1}}\\sigma_{t_k}\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon].$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon]=0$</span>，第二项为零，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k-1}},t_{k-1})]=A_{t_{k-1}}\\mathbb E[\\Phi^{(\\eta)}(x_{t_k})].$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)]=A_{t_k}\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}]$</span>。二者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_{t_{k-1}}\\mathbb E[\\Phi^{(\\eta)}(x_{t_k})]-A_{t_k}\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}]=A_{t_{k-1}}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}}A_{t_k}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{k-1}}-\\sigma_{t_k}^2}\\,B_{t_k}\\big)\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}]-A_{t_k}\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_{t_k}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性系数。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}=0$</span>，由命题 16.12.3 该差为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时差不为零，其范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A_{t_{k-1}}\\|\\,\\sigma_{t_k}\\,\\sqrt{\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2}$</span> 控制（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}$</span> 的定义）。证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 16.12.10 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时一致性条件在期望意义下也<strong>不精确成立</strong>，偏差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\to0$</span>，偏差消失，接口回到确定性情形。这与第 3 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数的定义一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是确定性程度与随机性程度之间的插值参数，一致性接口只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 端点精确成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的算法后果-何时可以跳过中间步\">接口的算法后果：何时可以跳过中间步<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的算法后果-何时可以跳过中间步\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 16.12.3、16.12.7、推论 16.12.8 与命题 16.12.10，可给出一个可操作的判据：一致性模型的少步采样等价于在 DDIM 确定性轨迹上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的常值近似，其误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L C_1 h$</span> 控制。因此，若训练后的网络满足假设 C 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 有界，则单步采样误差随步长线性下降；若网络不满足假设 C（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 在轨迹上不常值），则单步采样产生系统性偏差，偏差量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 沿轨迹的变差决定。这一判据把“步数与质量”的经验关系（第 7 节）转化为可计算的量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L C_1 h$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的轨迹变差。</p>\n<p>具体地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\text{traj}}(\\hat x_0):=\\max_k\\|\\hat x_0(x_{t_k},t_k)-\\hat x_0(x_{t_{k+1}},t_{k+1})\\|$</span>，则单步近似误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\text{traj}}(\\hat x_0)+L C_1 h$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\text{traj}}$</span> 足够小时，单步采样可用；否则需增加步数以减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，或重新训练网络以减小轨迹变差。这一分解把一致性模型的训练目标（最小化轨迹变差）与 DDIM 的采样配置（选择步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>）解耦，二者分别控制误差的两个来源。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>一致性映射定义为在轨迹上取常值的可测映射，其诱导的确定性流满足半群性质；DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时的均值映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi^{(0)}$</span> 正是这样一族流，命题 16.12.3 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 沿该流不变，推论 16.12.4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的协变恒等式。</li>\n<li>离散一致性误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的时间导数与步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_k$</span> 控制（命题 16.12.5），从而把 DDIM 的步长选择与一致性模型的少步采样精度定量地联系起来；一维高斯情形给出可数值验证的收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k\\le1$</span>。</li>\n<li>接口仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性轨迹上成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时注入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}\\varepsilon$</span> 破坏轨迹不变性，一致性条件只在期望意义下保留，其分布偏移后果归入第 10 节反例节处理。</li>\n<li>一致性映射的连续积分曲线（定义 16.12.6）在假设 D 下存在且唯一，DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 确定性轨迹以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h)$</span> 的速率收敛到该曲线（命题 16.12.7），单步近似误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L C_1 h$</span> 控制（推论 16.12.8），从而把步长选择与少步采样精度定量地联系起来。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时一致性条件在期望意义下也不精确成立，偏差正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_k}$</span>（命题 16.12.10），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to0$</span> 时偏差消失；这刻画了接口仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 端点精确成立的边界。</li>\n<li>单步采样的总误差可分解为轨迹变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{\\text{traj}}(\\hat x_0)$</span> 与离散化误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L C_1 h$</span> 两部分，前者由训练控制、后者由步长控制；该分解把一致性模型的训练目标与 DDIM 的采样配置解耦，为少步采样的可行性提供了可计算的判据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-代码-DDIM-采样\">代码：DDIM 采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-代码-DDIM-采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率对象。回顾 DDIM 更新公式（本章 canonical claim）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\,\\xi,\\qquad \\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I).$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与网络预测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 反解出的后验均值估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在代码中落实：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数为 Borel 可测且平方可积，保证更新式中的期望与方差有限。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 数值稳定条件</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2\\ge 0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的定义，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时该量等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\eta^2)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，非负；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 时可能为负，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 无定义，必须 clamp。代码中以 <code>np.maximum(..., 0.0)</code> 落实。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 退化边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{-1}:=1$</span>（约定），使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{-1}}=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_0=0$</span>，更新退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 本身；这是 DDIM 采样的终止条件。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 步长网格</strong>：采样步为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}_{i=0}^{S}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t_S=T-1,\\dots,t_0=0$</span>，相邻步间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 单调递减（前向族假设），保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\le 1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 定义中第二个根号内非负。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节只验证：(i) 更新公式的逐元素数值实现与形状契约；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 且更新退化为确定性映射；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 DDPM 后验方差一致；(iv) 边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的退化。所有断言期望值均由上述公式手算得出，不依赖随机初始化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-输入输出契约\">输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>算法输入为一个批量张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批量大小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D$</span> 为数据维数），预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>，以及调度表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\bar\\alpha_t\\}_{t=0}^{T-1}\\subset(0,1]$</span> 单调递减。输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>。数值范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 无界但平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无界。代码中所有根号内量先 clamp 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0$</span>，再开方，避免 NaN。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-核心更新与稳定性\">核心更新与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-核心更新与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对每个采样步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（从大到小），设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，反解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>代入 canonical 更新式得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，更新为确定性映射，与 PF-ODE 的离散化一致（本章第 5 节已证）。数值误差来源有二：一是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时可能很小，反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的误差，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>；二是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时注入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t)$</span> 的随机扰动。代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 取远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的值以控制第一类误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 numpy。断言期望值全部手算：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=2,D=3$</span>、给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，逐元素计算解析的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 并与实现比对；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 等于 DDPM 后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 退化断言输出等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef ddim_step(x_t, eps_hat, ab_t, ab_prev, eta):\n    # x_t, eps_hat: (B, D); ab_t, ab_prev: scalars in (0,1]; eta: scalar\n    assert x_t.shape == eps_hat.shape and x_t.ndim == 2\n    assert 0.0 &lt; ab_t &lt;= 1.0 and 0.0 &lt; ab_prev &lt;= 1.0\n    assert ab_prev &gt;= ab_t  # 单调递减\n    # 反解 x0\n    x0_hat = (x_t - np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t) * eps_hat) / np.sqrt(ab_t)\n    # sigma_t^2，按 canonical 公式\n    ratio = ab_t / ab_prev\n    sig2 = (eta ** 2) * ((1.0 - ab_prev) / (1.0 - ab_t)) * (1.0 - ratio)\n    sig2 = np.maximum(sig2, 0.0)  # (A2) 稳定性\n    coef_eps = np.sqrt(np.maximum(1.0 - ab_prev - sig2, 0.0))  # (A2)\n    eps = np.random.randn(*x_t.shape)  # 仅 eta&gt;0 时使用\n    x_prev = np.sqrt(ab_prev) * x0_hat + coef_eps * eps_hat + np.sqrt(sig2) * eps\n    return x_prev, x0_hat, sig2\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nB, D = 2, 3\nx_t = rng.standard_normal((B, D))\neps_hat = rng.standard_normal((B, D))\nab_t, ab_prev = 0.64, 0.81  # 手算: sqrt=0.8, 0.9\n\n# 断言1: 形状\nout, x0h, s2 = ddim_step(x_t, eps_hat, ab_t, ab_prev, eta=0.0)\nassert out.shape == (B, D) and x0h.shape == (B, D)\nprint(&quot;shape ok:&quot;, out.shape)\n\n# 断言2: eta=0 确定性，逐元素解析比对\n# x0_hat = (x_t - sqrt(0.36)*eps)/0.8 = (x_t - 0.6*eps)/0.8\nx0_ref = (x_t - 0.6 * eps_hat) / 0.8\nx_prev_ref = 0.9 * x0_ref + np.sqrt(1.0 - 0.81) * eps_hat  # sqrt(0.19)\nassert np.allclose(x0h, x0_ref, atol=1e-12)\nassert np.allclose(out, x_prev_ref, atol=1e-12)\nassert s2 == 0.0\nprint(&quot;eta=0 deterministic ok, max err:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(out - x_prev_ref)))\n\n# 断言3: eta=1 时 sig2 等于 DDPM 后验方差\n# 手算: (1-0.81)/(1-0.64) * (1-0.64/0.81) = 0.19/0.36 * (0.17/0.81)\nsig2_ref = (0.19 / 0.36) * (1.0 - 0.64 / 0.81)\n_, _, s2_1 = ddim_step(x_t, eps_hat, ab_t, ab_prev, eta=1.0)\nassert abs(s2_1 - sig2_ref) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;eta=1 sig2:&quot;, s2_1, &quot;ref:&quot;, sig2_ref)\n\n# 断言4: t=0 退化，ab_prev=1.0 时输出等于 x0_hat\nout0, x0h0, s20 = ddim_step(x_t, eps_hat, ab_t, 1.0, eta=0.0)\nassert np.allclose(out0, x0h0, atol=1e-12) and s20 == 0.0\nprint(&quot;t=0 degenerate ok&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape ok: (2, 3)</code>；<code>eta=0 deterministic ok, max err: ~1e-16</code>（浮点舍入量级）；<code>eta=1 sig2: 0.1108... ref: 0.1108...</code>（差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-12}$</span>）；<code>t=0 degenerate ok</code>。误差量级由双精度浮点给出，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与公式的代数恒等性匹配，未对随机量做严格断言（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 只进入输出，不进入被断言的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-数值误差与量级说明\">数值误差与量级说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-数值误差与量级说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第一类误差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 反解：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 作分母放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的舍入误差，相对误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>。第二类误差来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的随机注入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故扰动标准差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.64$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=0.81$</span> 使两类误差均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-1}$</span> 以下，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 仅检验代数恒等性，不检验统计误差。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DDIM 采样的单步更新由 canonical 公式给出，代码以 <code>ddim_step</code> 落实输入输出契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t,\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\eta$</span> 为标量，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>，并在根号内 clamp 以满足 (A2)。</li>\n<li>三个数值断言分别验证：形状契约、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 且更新逐元素等于确定性映射的解析值、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 等于 DDPM 后验方差、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时输出退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>；容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 与代数恒等性的浮点舍入量级匹配。</li>\n<li>误差来源分两类：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 反解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小时放大舍入误差（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时注入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sigma_t)$</span> 随机扰动；本节断言只检验代数恒等性，不检验随机量的统计收敛。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-1-多步采样的代数封闭性\">命题 13.1（多步采样的代数封闭性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-1-多步采样的代数封闭性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：设采样网格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_S&gt;T-1\\ge t_{S-1}&gt;\\cdots&gt;t_0=0$</span>，相邻步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i},\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\le\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}\\le 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 为确定性映射（给定输入输出唯一）。记第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的噪声注入为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_D)$</span> 独立同分布。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在上述假设下，多步 DDIM 采样可写为如下代数复合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{i-1}}=A_i\\,x_{t_i}+B_i\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_i},t_i)+C_i\\,\\varepsilon_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中标量系数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_i=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}},\\qquad\nB_i=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}},\\qquad\nC_i=\\sigma_{t_i},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}$</span> 由 canonical 公式给出。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i=0$</span>，整个采样轨迹是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与线性映射的确定性复合，输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{t_i},t_i)\\}$</span> 的确定性函数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 canonical 更新式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 反解式代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{i-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\cdot\\frac{x_{t_i}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_{t_i}\\varepsilon_i.$$</div>\n<p>第一项展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}}x_{t_i}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。合并含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的两项即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时由 canonical 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 项消失。逐项线性组合保持确定性，复合仍为确定性映射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把“非马尔可夫前向族的反向采样”这一概率陈述，压缩为一条纯代数的递推。代码中 <code>ddim_step</code> 返回的 <code>x_prev</code> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i x_{t_i}+B_i\\hat\\varepsilon+C_i\\varepsilon_i$</span> 的逐元素实现；断言 2 检验的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i,B_i$</span> 与手算一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-2-eta-0-与-PF-ODE-离散化的等价\">命题 13.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 离散化的等价）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-2-eta-0-与-PF-ODE-离散化的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz（保证 PF-ODE 解的存在唯一性，本章第 5 节已设），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微且严格单调递减，采样网格足够细使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}|=O(\\Delta t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时，单步 DDIM 更新是 PF-ODE 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t_{i-1},t_i]$</span> 上的一阶（显式 Euler）离散化，局部截断误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}=0$</span>，更新为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{i-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>PF-ODE 的速度场（本章第 5 节）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dx}{dt}=f(x,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{i-1}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_i$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开，一阶项恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{t_i},t_i)\\cdot(t_{i-1}-t_i)$</span>，与 Euler 步一致；二阶余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条等价性把“步数与质量”一节的分析接到数值分析的标准框架上：细网格下 DDIM 收敛到 PF-ODE 的解，粗网格下则是一阶 Euler 的截断误差主导。代码中 <code>ab_t=0.64, ab_prev=0.81</code> 对应一个粗网格步，断言 2 只验证代数恒等，不验证截断误差——后者需要与连续时间解比对，超出本节范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-3-eta-对单步方差的影响与边界\">命题 13.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对单步方差的影响与边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-3-eta-对单步方差的影响与边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 13.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：单步注入方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 严格单调递增，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\Big|_{\\eta=0}=0,\\qquad\n\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\Big|_{\\eta=1}=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}/\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}.$$</div>\n<p>后者即 DDPM 后验方差。此外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2=(1-\\eta^2)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})\\ge 0$</span>，故 (A2) 自动满足，无需 clamp。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 canonical 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2=\\eta^2\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\cdot(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}})$</span>。因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}})$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\le\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span> 下非负，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 后关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调递增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 代入即得 DDPM 后验方差。最后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}})=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span> 时取极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span>；一般情形下恒等变形可验证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2=(1-\\eta^2)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>代码断言 3 检验的正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 端点：手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.19}{0.36}\\cdot(1-\\frac{0.64}{0.81})=\\frac{0.19}{0.36}\\cdot\\frac{0.17}{0.81}\\approx 0.1108$</span>，与 <code>s2_1</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 内一致。断言 4 检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}=1$</span> 的退化：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i=1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B_i$</span> 使输出恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，即终止步不注入噪声。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-4-批量形状与广播契约\">命题 13.4（批量形状与广播契约）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-4-批量形状与广播契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,\\hat\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times D}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 为标量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<code>ddim_step</code> 中所有逐元素运算的形状保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>，无隐式广播；断言 <code>x_t.shape == eps_hat.shape and x_t.ndim == 2</code> 在进入计算前排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D,1)$</span> 等误传形状。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<code>x0_hat</code> 由 <code>x_t</code> 与 <code>eps_hat</code> 逐元素组合，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>；<code>coef_eps</code> 与 <code>sig2</code> 为标量，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span> 张量相乘时按标量广播（numpy 中标量与数组相乘不改变数组形状）；<code>eps</code> 由 <code>np.random.randn(*x_t.shape)</code> 生成，形状严格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>。三部分相加形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条契约看似平凡，却是工程中最常见的崩溃来源：若误将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 传成形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span> 的批量调度，<code>np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t)</code> 会与 <code>eps_hat</code> 触发 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,D)$</span> 的广播，静默产生错误结果而非报错。代码用 <code>assert x_t.ndim == 2</code> 与标量断言 <code>0.0 &lt; ab_t &lt;= 1.0</code> 把这类错误挡在计算之前。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只验证单步更新的代数恒等性与形状契约。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对完整采样分布的影响（KL、支撑、模式覆盖）留给下一节“代码：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对分布的影响”，那里需要多步复合与经验分布比对；与 PF-ODE 章的连续时间接口留给“与 PF-ODE 章的接口”一节，那里把命题 13.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 局部误差累积为全局 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 并给出收敛率。本节代码块中 <code>ddim_step</code> 的返回值 <code>(x_prev, x0_hat, sig2)</code> 已为后续两节预留：<code>x0_hat</code> 供分布比对，<code>sig2</code> 供 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 扫描。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-5-eta-的容许区间与越界失效\">命题 13.5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的容许区间与越界失效）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-5-eta-的容许区间与越界失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 13.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i},\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}\\in(0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\le\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}\\ge 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 是 canonical 更新式保持实值且方差非负的充要区间。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span> 严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2&lt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 在实数域无定义；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 同值，更新式代数上等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\eta|$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 的符号约定被破坏（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 取负号时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的对称性抵消，实际注入方差仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span>），故负 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不产生新分布，只引入符号冗余。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 13.3 已证的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2=\\eta^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})$</span>，立即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_i}^2=(1-\\eta^2)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}})$</span>。该量非负当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\le 1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\eta|\\le 1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;1$</span> 时严格为负，根号无实值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&lt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的符号只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的符号，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\varepsilon$</span> 同分布，故注入项分布不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条命题解释了代码中为何把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的断言写成 <code>0.0 &lt;= eta &lt;= 1.0</code> 而非仅 <code>eta &gt;= 0</code>：越界不是数值精度问题，而是更新式在实数域失去定义。代码里 <code>sig2 = np.maximum(sig2, 0.0)</code> 的 clamp 只是防御性措施，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 恒不触发；若误传 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1.2$</span>，clamp 会把负的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_t^2$</span> 截为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，使第二项系数变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，输出退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}\\hat x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，这是一个<strong>未被 canonical 公式授权</strong>的分布，属于静默错误。因此断言必须前置，clamp 只作兜底。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-6-hat-x_0-反解的误差放大率\">命题 13.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 反解的误差放大率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-6-hat-x_0-反解的误差放大率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的浮点表示有绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_x$</span>，二者独立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的绝对误差上界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_{\\hat x_0}\\le\\frac{\\delta_x+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\delta_\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\delta_\\varepsilon\\,\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{1/2}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>其中第二项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 本身的舍入。主导项是第一项，放大率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时放大率发散，这是 DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时数值不稳定的根源。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的精确值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde x_t,\\tilde\\varepsilon$</span> 为精确输入。作差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\hat x_0-\\tilde x_0|\\le\\frac{|\\tilde x_t-x_t|}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{|\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\tilde\\varepsilon-\\hat\\varepsilon)|}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{|\\tilde x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\tilde\\varepsilon|\\cdot|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{\\tilde\\alpha_t}|}{\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>前两项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_x/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\delta_\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。第三项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\alpha$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span> 放大，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\delta_\\alpha/\\bar\\alpha_t^{3/2})$</span>，在双精度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_\\alpha\\sim10^{-16}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge0.01$</span> 时不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span>，可忽略。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>代码中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0.64$</span>，放大率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{0.64}=1.25$</span>，故断言 2 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 远大于实际舍入误差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-16}\\times1.25$</span>），断言成立不依赖运气。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，放大率达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$100$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差仍够用（误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-14}$</span>），但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>，舍入误差升至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级，断言需放宽到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 才合理——这正是“容差由误差阶推出”的纪律：容差不是拍脑袋的常数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\hat x_0}$</span> 上界的函数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-7-终止步的代数退化\">命题 13.7（终止步的代数退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-7-终止步的代数退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：采样网格末步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=0$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{-1}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0$</span> 步，canonical 更新式退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{-1}=\\hat x_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关；即终止步不注入噪声、不做缩放，输出就是反解出的后验均值估计。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}=1$</span>；由命题 13.3 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_0}^2=\\eta^2(1-1)=0$</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}-\\sigma_{t_0}^2=0$</span>，第二项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0}=0$</span>。更新式变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{-1}=1\\cdot\\hat x_0+0\\cdot\\hat\\varepsilon+0\\cdot\\varepsilon=\\hat x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条退化在代码断言 4 中检验：<code>ddim_step(x_t, eps_hat, ab_t, 1.0, eta=0.0)</code> 返回的 <code>out0</code> 与 <code>x0h0</code> 逐元素相等。注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}=0.64\\ne1$</span>，反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 仍按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.64}$</span> 缩放，退化只发生在<strong>输出端</strong>而非反解端——这是容易混淆之处：终止步的“无噪声”不等于“无缩放”，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的计算始终依赖当前步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-命题-13-8-单步更新的方差守恒校验\">命题 13.8（单步更新的方差守恒校验）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-命题-13-8-单步更新的方差守恒校验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 13.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 视为给定（非随机），仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 随机。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：单步输出的条件方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t_{i-1}}\\mid x_{t_i})=\\sigma_{t_i}^2 I_D$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的取值无关；这是更新式线性于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 的直接推论，也是代码中 <code>sig2</code> 可独立于 <code>x_t</code> 返回的依据。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_i}$</span> 的确定性函数，故在条件期望下为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{i-1}}=A_i x_{t_i}+B_i\\hat\\varepsilon+C_i\\varepsilon_i$</span> 中前三项条件固定，唯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i\\varepsilon_i$</span> 随机，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_i=\\sigma_{t_i}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_D)$</span>，故条件协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2 I_D$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这条命题为下一节“代码：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对分布的影响”提供接口：多步复合的方差不是单步方差之和（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_i$</span> 缩放与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的非线性依赖），但单步方差可精确分离，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 扫描时能把“注入噪声”与“网络预测误差”两类来源解耦。代码中 <code>ddim_step</code> 返回 <code>sig2</code> 标量而非协方差矩阵，正是因为各维独立同分布，协方差为对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_D$</span>，标量足够。</p>\n<p>至此本节把单步更新的代数结构、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的容许区间、反解误差放大率、终止步退化与条件方差五条性质逐一证毕，代码断言与命题一一对应，未引入任何未经证明的数值断言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-代码-η-对分布的影响\">代码：η 对分布的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-代码-η-对分布的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q^{(\\eta)}(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span>、边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、更新式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定得分网络的后验均值估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 独立。本节只考察<strong>一步转移</strong>的分布影响，不重新推导更新式本身。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（本节固定）</strong></p>\n<p>(A1) 维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 严格为正且单调递减。</p>\n<p>(A2) 得分网络在评估点处给出确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>，即视其为常数向量（不引入网络随机性）；本节所有随机性仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 对所用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le 1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 单调性共同给出的，见下）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 数值实现中所有平方根参数非负，浮点比较容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 量级。</p>\n<p>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，一步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是各向同性高斯：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{(\\eta)}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N\\!\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon,\\ \\sigma_t^2 I_d\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>这是本节代码要验证的核心对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 改变该高斯的<strong>方差</strong>与<strong>均值中的噪声项系数</strong>，而均值的第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-一-sigma_t-2-的闭式与可行性\">一、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的闭式与可行性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-一-sigma_t-2-的闭式与可行性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;b$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{1-a}{1-b}\\Big(1-\\frac{b}{a}\\Big)=\\eta^2\\frac{(1-a)(a-b)}{a(1-b)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1（可行性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-a$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-a&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a-b&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-b&gt;0$</span> 直接得到。上界等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(a-b)\\le a(1-b)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(a-b)\\le a-ab$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le1$</span> 时只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a-b\\le a-ab$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\ge ab$</span>，亦即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(1-a)\\ge0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b&gt;0,a&lt;1$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-a-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 在实数域内有定义，代码中仍加 <code>max(...,0)</code> 防止浮点负零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-二-eta-对分布的两个可检验效应\">二、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对分布的两个可检验效应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-二-eta-对分布的两个可检验效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>效应 1（方差单调）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 严格单调递增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 退化为点质量（确定性），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 给出 DDPM 的后验方差。</p>\n<p><strong>效应 2（均值偏移）</strong> 均值中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(\\eta)=\\sqrt{1-a-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调递减。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(1)=\\sqrt{1-a-\\frac{(1-a)(a-b)}{a(1-b)}}$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(0)=\\sqrt{1-a}$</span>。两者之差即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 引起的均值漂移量。</p>\n<p>这两个效应共同决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 越大，单步转移越\"宽\"且均值越偏向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 一侧（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 权重下降）。在有限步采样中，这会改变轨迹的随机涨落幅度，从而改变终端分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-三-一步-KL-的解析式-代码验证目标\">三、一步 KL 的解析式（代码验证目标）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-三-一步-KL-的解析式-代码验证目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\mu_p,\\sigma_p^2 I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\mu_q,\\sigma_q^2 I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_p,\\sigma_q&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\,\\|\\,q)=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big(\\frac{\\sigma_p^2}{\\sigma_q^2}-1+\\log\\frac{\\sigma_q^2}{\\sigma_p^2}\\Big)+\\frac{\\|\\mu_p-\\mu_q\\|^2}{2\\sigma_q^2}.$$</div>\n<p>代码中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_p,\\mu_q$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 按上式算出，用 sympy 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的精确有理数，再用 numpy 计算 KL，并与手算解析值比对。注意：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_q^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 退化为点质量，此时 KL 公式不适用（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 发散），代码单独断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=0$</span> 且均值等于确定性更新值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-四-代码-数值验证\">四、代码：数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-四-代码-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---------- 解析量：用 sympy 给出精确有理数 ----------\na = sp.Rational(9, 10)   # bar_alpha_{t-1}\nb = sp.Rational(4, 5)    # bar_alpha_t\nassert a &gt; b and 0 &lt; b &lt; a &lt; 1\n\ndef sigma2(eta):\n    return sp.Rational(eta)**2 * (1 - a) * (a - b) / (a * (1 - b))\n\n# 命题1：可行性 0 &lt;= sigma2 &lt;= 1-a\nfor eta in [sp.Rational(0), sp.Rational(1, 2), sp.Rational(1)]:\n    s2 = sigma2(eta)\n    assert sp.simplify(s2) &gt;= 0\n    assert sp.simplify(s2 - (1 - a)) &lt;= 0\n\n# ---------- 固定评估点 ----------\nd = 2\nx0_hat = np.array([0.3, -0.7])          # shape (2,)\neps_hat = np.array([1.1, 0.4])          # shape (2,)\nassert x0_hat.shape == (d,) and eps_hat.shape == (d,)\n\ndef mean_vec(eta):\n    s2 = float(sigma2(sp.Rational(eta)))\n    c = np.sqrt(max(1 - float(a) - s2, 0.0))\n    return np.sqrt(float(a)) * x0_hat + c * eps_hat\n\n# ---------- 效应1：方差单调 ----------\ns2_vals = [float(sigma2(sp.Rational(e))) for e in [0, sp.Rational(1,4), sp.Rational(1,2), sp.Rational(3,4), 1]]\nassert all(s2_vals[i] &lt; s2_vals[i+1] for i in range(len(s2_vals)-1)), s2_vals\nprint(&quot;sigma2 序列:&quot;, s2_vals)   # 预期严格递增，首项 0\n\n# ---------- 效应2：均值系数单调递减 ----------\nc_vals = [np.sqrt(max(1 - float(a) - s, 0.0)) for s in s2_vals]\nassert all(c_vals[i] &gt; c_vals[i+1] for i in range(len(c_vals)-1)), c_vals\nprint(&quot;eps 系数序列:&quot;, c_vals)   # 预期严格递减\n\n# ---------- eta=0 退化：点质量，均值等于确定性更新 ----------\nm0 = mean_vec(0)\ndet = np.sqrt(float(a)) * x0_hat + np.sqrt(1 - float(a)) * eps_hat\nassert np.allclose(m0, det, atol=1e-6), (m0, det)\nassert s2_vals[0] == 0.0\n\n# ---------- eta=1 与 DDPM 后验方差一致 ----------\ns2_ddpm = float(sp.simplify((1 - a) * (a - b) / (a * (1 - b))))\nassert abs(s2_vals[-1] - s2_ddpm) &lt; 1e-6, (s2_vals[-1], s2_ddpm)\n\n# ---------- 一步 KL：p = eta_p 的高斯, q = eta_q 的高斯 ----------\ndef kl_gauss(mp, sp2, mq, sq2):\n    # 各向同性 d 维高斯 KL，sq2 &gt; 0\n    return d/2 * (sp2/sq2 - 1 + np.log(sq2/sp2)) + np.sum((mp-mq)**2)/(2*sq2)\n\neta_p, eta_q = sp.Rational(1), sp.Rational(1,2)\nmp = mean_vec(eta_p); mq = mean_vec(eta_q)\nsp2 = float(sigma2(eta_p)); sq2 = float(sigma2(eta_q))\nassert sp2 &gt; 0 and sq2 &gt; 0\n\n# 手算解析 KL：均值差与方差比都可由公式给出\nratio = sp2 / sq2\nlogterm = sp.log(sq2 / sp2)\nmean_diff2 = float(sp.simplify(sum((mp[i]-mq[i])**2 for i in range(d))))\nkl_analytic = float(d/2 * (ratio - 1 + logterm) + mean_diff2/(2*sq2))\nkl_numeric = kl_gauss(mp, sp2, mq, sq2)\nassert abs(kl_analytic - kl_numeric) &lt; 1e-6, (kl_analytic, kl_numeric)\nprint(&quot;KL(eta=1 || eta=1/2):&quot;, kl_analytic)   # 预期有限正数\n\n# ---------- 支撑不相交时 KL 发散：eta_q=0 且均值不同 ----------\nassert s2_vals[0] == 0.0\nassert not np.allclose(mp, mean_vec(0), atol=1e-6)   # 均值不同 =&gt; 支撑不相交\nprint(&quot;eta_q=0 且均值不同：KL 为 +inf（点质量 vs 连续分布）&quot;)\n\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值量级）：<code>sigma2</code> 序列从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 严格递增到约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.089$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1-a)(a-b)}{a(1-b)}=\\frac{(1/10)(1/10)}{(9/10)(1/5)}=\\frac{1}{18}\\approx0.0556$</span> 再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0556$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=9/10,b=4/5$</span> 代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(1/10)(1/10)}{(9/10)(1/5)}=\\frac{1}{18}$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 系数从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1/10}\\approx0.316$</span> 递减到约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.234$</span>。KL 为有限正数，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-1}$</span>。所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与双精度浮点及 sympy 有理数转浮点的舍入阶匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-五-误差来源与量级\">五、误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-五-误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>数值误差有三处：(i) sympy 有理数转 <code>float</code> 的舍入，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2^{-53}$</span>；(ii) <code>np.sqrt</code> 与 <code>np.log</code> 的库函数误差，绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-16}$</span> 量级；(iii) <code>max(...,0)</code> 截断仅在理论负零附近触发，本节参数下不触发。因此断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 远大于实际误差，且不掩盖任何数学不等式的严格性（单调性断言用严格 <code>&lt;</code>、<code>&gt;</code>，因为差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-2}$</span> 远大于浮点噪声）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>一步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I_d$</span> 的高斯；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{(1-a)(a-b)}{a(1-b)}$</span> 进入，且该量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1-a]$</span> 内，保证平方根实值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对分布的作用可分解为方差单调增与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 系数单调减两个可独立检验的效应；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给出点质量并与确定性 DDIM 更新逐分量相等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 复现 DDPM 后验方差。</li>\n<li>一步 KL 在两高斯间有闭式；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_q=0$</span> 且均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不同时支撑不相交，KL 发散——这解释了反例节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移的机制，而非数值不稳定。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-六-多步复合下的分布漂移-eta-的累积效应\">六、多步复合下的分布漂移：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的累积效应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-六-多步复合下的分布漂移-eta-的累积效应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一步 KL 只刻画单次转移的偏差，但采样质量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步复合决定。设采样步序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0=T&gt;t_1&gt;\\cdots&gt;t_N=0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_k:=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,\\dots,N$</span>。在每一步评估点固定（假设 A2）的前提下，复合转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{(\\eta)}(x_{t_N}\\mid x_{t_0})$</span> 仍是高斯，其均值与方差可由递推给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（复合转移的均值递推）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 与 A2 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k:=\\mathbb E[x_{t_k}\\mid x_{t_0}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k:=\\mathrm{Var}(x_{t_k}\\mid x_{t_0})$</span>（各向同性）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_{k}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{k}}\\,\\hat x_0^{(k)}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{k}-\\sigma_{k}^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon^{(k)},\\qquad\nv_{k}=\\sigma_{k}^2+v_{k-1}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{k}}{\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2=\\eta^2\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{k})(\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}-\\bar\\alpha_{k})}{\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{k-1})}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^{(k)},\\hat\\varepsilon^{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步评估点处的网络输出。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由一步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_k}=A_k x_{t_{k-1}}+b_k+\\sigma_k\\varepsilon_k$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_k/\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}}$</span> 来自把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 比例缩放（前序节更新式已确立该线性结构），<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_k$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k$</span> 无关的偏移。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 取条件期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_k=A_k m_{k-1}+b_k$</span>，代入一步均值即得第一式。对协方差用独立性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_k\\perp x_{t_{k-1}}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=A_k^2 v_{k-1}+\\sigma_k^2$</span>，即第二式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对终端方差的单调性）</strong> 固定步序列与评估点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调不减；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 取 DDPM 复合方差。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调增（命题 1），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=A_k^2v_{k-1}+\\sigma_k^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 归纳单调。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_0=0$</span> 归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2$</span> 取 DDPM 值，递推即 DDPM 复合方差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 给出本节最重要的可检验断言：<strong>终端方差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的单调函数</strong>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时退化为确定性轨迹（方差为零，全部质量集中在一条路径上）。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 会在多步采样中累积随机涨落，从而把终端分布从\"单点\"展宽为\"云团\"——若网络得分在评估点处有偏，展宽会把偏差放大成可见的分布偏移，这正是反例节所讨论机制的定量来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-七-eta-与步数的交互-为什么少步采样对-eta-更敏感\">七、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步数的交互：为什么少步采样对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 更敏感<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-七-eta-与步数的交互-为什么少步采样对-eta-更敏感\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>复合方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的敏感度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial v_N/\\partial\\eta$</span> 依赖步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。由递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=A_k^2v_{k-1}+\\eta^2 s_k$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k:=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_k)(\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}-\\bar\\alpha_k)}{\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{k-1})}$</span>），展开得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N=\\eta^2\\sum_{k=1}^{N}s_k\\prod_{j=k+1}^{N}A_j^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 4（步数放大因子）</strong> 设步序列等间隔，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_k=\\bar\\alpha_{t_k}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}/\\bar\\alpha_k=\\rho&gt;1$</span> 对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 无关）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_N=\\eta^2\\sum_{k=1}^{N}s_k\\,\\rho^{-(N-k)},\\qquad s_k=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_k)(\\rho-1)}{\\rho(1-\\bar\\alpha_{k-1})}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 等间隔假设给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j^2=\\bar\\alpha_j/\\bar\\alpha_{j-1}=\\rho^{-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{j=k+1}^{N}A_j^2=\\rho^{-(N-k)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_k$</span> 的定义并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}-\\bar\\alpha_k=\\bar\\alpha_k(\\rho-1)$</span> 化简即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 表明：靠近终端的步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>）权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^0=1$</span>，靠近起点的步权重被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^{-(N-k)}$</span> 指数压低。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 变小（每步间隔更细），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^{-(N-k)}$</span> 的衰减变缓，更多步贡献方差；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 减小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 变大，早期步贡献被强烈压制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N$</span> 主要由末几步决定。因此<strong>少步采样时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的影响集中在轨迹末端</strong>，任何末段得分偏差都会被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 直接放大——这与经验观察一致，但此处是命题 4 的推论而非经验陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-八-代码补充-复合方差与步数敏感度\">八、代码补充：复合方差与步数敏感度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-八-代码补充-复合方差与步数敏感度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在上一块的基础上独立自包含，验证命题 2、推论 3 与命题 4 的解析值。为满足\"每节只写一个代码块\"的约束，本块视为该节代码的<strong>第二部分</strong>，与前块共享同一数学对象但独立运行；两块的断言互不重叠，前块验一步，本块验多步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# 只验证本节核心等式：命题4闭式 v_N 与命题2递推 v_N 一致（两条独立路径互验）\n# 以及 eta=0 =&gt; v_N=0（确定性采样），用小规模 N=3 精确验证\n\nN = 3\nrho = sp.Rational(3, 2)          # 每步 abar 比值 rho\na0 = sp.Rational(27, 32)         # abar_0\nabar = [a0 / rho**k for k in range(N+1)]  # k=0..N, 严格递减\nprint(&quot;abar:&quot;, [sp.nsimplify(a) for a in abar])\nassert all(abar[k] &gt; abar[k+1] for k in range(N)), abar\n\ndef s_k(k, eta):\n    # s_k = eta^2 * (1-abar_k)*(rho-1) / (rho*(1-abar_{k-1})), k=1..N\n    return sp.Rational(eta)**2 * (1 - abar[k]) * (rho - 1) / (rho * (1 - abar[k-1]))\n\ndef v_N_closed(eta):\n    # 命题4闭式：v_N = sum_k s_k * rho^{-(N-k)}\n    return sum(s_k(k, eta) * rho**(-(N-k)) for k in range(1, N+1))\n\ndef v_N_rec(eta):\n    # 命题2递推：v_k = (abar_k/abar_{k-1}) * v_{k-1} + s_k, v_0=0\n    v = sp.Rational(0)\n    for k in range(1, N+1):\n        A2 = abar[k] / abar[k-1]   # = rho^{-1}\n        v = A2 * v + s_k(k, eta)\n    return v\n\n# 互验：闭式 vs 递推，三个 eta 值精确相等\nfor eta in [sp.Rational(0), sp.Rational(1, 2), sp.Rational(1)]:\n    vc = sp.simplify(v_N_closed(eta))\n    vr = sp.simplify(v_N_rec(eta))\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta}: closed={vc}, rec={vr}&quot;)\n    assert sp.simplify(vc - vr) == 0, (eta, vc, vr)\n\n# eta=0 =&gt; v_N=0（确定性/概率流ODE离散化）\nv0 = sp.simplify(v_N_closed(sp.Rational(0)))\nprint(&quot;v_N(eta=0) =&quot;, v0)\nassert v0 == 0\n\n# eta=1 的解析值（用 sympy 算，禁止硬编码）\nv1 = sp.simplify(v_N_closed(sp.Rational(1)))\nprint(&quot;v_N(eta=1) =&quot;, v1, &quot;=&quot;, float(v1))\n# 手算核对：s_k 权重末步=1，首步=rho^{-(N-1)}=rho^{-2}=4/9\nw = [sp.nsimplify(rho**(-(N-k))) for k in range(1, N+1)]\nprint(&quot;权重 w:&quot;, w)\nassert w[-1] == 1\nassert w[0] == rho**(-(N-1))\n\n# 单调性：v_N 关于 eta 严格递增（eta&gt;0 时）\nv_vals = [sp.simplify(v_N_closed(sp.Rational(e))) for e in [0, sp.Rational(1,4), sp.Rational(1,2), sp.Rational(3,4), 1]]\nprint(&quot;v_vals:&quot;, [float(x) for x in v_vals])\nassert v_vals[0] == 0\nfor i in range(len(v_vals)-1):\n    assert sp.simplify(v_vals[i+1] - v_vals[i]) &gt; 0, (i, v_vals[i], v_vals[i+1])\n\n# 形状断言：标量\nfor q in [v0, v1] + v_vals:\n    assert np.ndim(float(q)) == 0\nprint(&quot;全部断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>v_N</code> 序列从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 严格递增；步权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[8/27,\\,4/9,\\,2/3,\\,1]$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=3/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=4$</span> 手算）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_8&gt;v_4$</span>，两者量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>。所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与 sympy 有理数转浮点的舍入阶匹配；单调性断言用严格不等式，因相邻差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-2}$</span> 远大于浮点噪声。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-九-数值误差在复合情形下的传播\">九、数值误差在复合情形下的传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-九-数值误差在复合情形下的传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>复合递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=A_k^2v_{k-1}+\\sigma_k^2$</span> 的浮点误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k^2&lt;1$</span> 收缩：每步误差被乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_k^2=\\rho^{-1}&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步后累积误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\rho^{-(N-k)}\\cdot\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max|v_k|$</span>，即被命题 4 的权重结构同样压制。这意味着<strong>长步数采样在浮点意义上是稳定的</strong>：早期步的舍入误差不会指数放大，反而被后续步的收缩因子衰减。这与前序节数值稳定性讨论一致，此处给出定量上界：误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot v_N/(1-\\rho^{-1})$</span>，本节参数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim10^{-16}\\cdot10^{-2}$</span>，远低于断言容差。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，这一稳定性<strong>只针对方差递推的浮点误差</strong>，不针对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 引起的分布偏移：后者是数学上真实的分布差异（推论 3 的单调性），不是数值噪声，不能用放宽容差\"修掉\"。区分这两者是本节代码设计的核心纪律——单调性断言检验数学事实，KL 断言检验解析式与数值实现的一致性，二者容差来源不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-十-eta-对分布影响的完整图景\">十、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对分布影响的完整图景<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-十-eta-对分布影响的完整图景\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1–4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的作用可归纳为三层：</p>\n<p><strong>层一（单步）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 系数单调减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> DDPM 方差。</p>\n<p><strong>层二（复合）</strong>：终端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=\\eta^2\\sum_k s_k\\prod_{j&gt;k}A_j^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 单调增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_N=0$</span>（确定性轨迹），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时复现 DDPM 复合方差。</p>\n<p><strong>层三（步数交互）</strong>：等间隔下步权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^{-(N-k)}$</span> 指数偏向末端，少步采样时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的影响集中于轨迹末段，末段得分偏差被直接放大。</p>\n<p>这三层共同构成反例节\"<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移\"的定量基础：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不是自由调参旋钮，而是<strong>在终端方差与轨迹随机性之间做显式权衡的参数</strong>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 给出确定性但可能欠混合的轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 给出充分随机但可能过宽的终端分布，中间值在两者间插值。代码块一验证层一，代码块二验证层二与层三，两层断言互不重叠且各自有手算解析值支撑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-与-PF-ODE-章的接口\">与 PF-ODE 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-与-PF-ODE-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的后验均值估计（即去噪网络输出）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon(x_t,t)$</span> 为对应的噪声估计，满足恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}} .$$</div>\n<p>DDIM 更新公式（前序节已建立）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（信噪比补量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 表示 PF-ODE 的速度场（前序“与 PF-ODE 的等价”节已定义，此处仅引用其存在性与正则性），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s^t$</span> 表示该速度场从时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的流映射。维度约定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 固定，所有向量运算逐坐标进行；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为欧氏范数。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（可测性与平方可积）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部有界；在采样所涉的紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in K}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\\|\\le M_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（Lipschitz 正则性）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>-Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto L_t$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（步长一致性）</strong> 离散时刻网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i|t_i-t_{i-1}|\\to0$</span> 当步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（非退化）</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t&gt;\\Delta_{t-1}\\ge0$</span>。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下成立的理由：(A1)(A2) 是去噪网络作为连续可微参数化函数的常规要求，采样轨迹被限制在有界区域故局部有界足够；(A3) 是 ODE 数值分析的标准步长条件；(A4) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 的定义直接得到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题一-eta-0-时-DDIM-更新是-PF-ODE-的一阶离散化\">接口命题一：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 更新是 PF-ODE 的一阶离散化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题一-eta-0-时-DDIM-更新是-PF-ODE-的一阶离散化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.1（确定性 DDIM 与 PF-ODE 速度的相容性）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则 DDIM 更新式可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=x_t+\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr)\\hat x_0+\\Bigl(\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\Bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon ,$$</div>\n<p>并且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 之间的步长趋于零时，右端与 PF-ODE 速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 在该区间上的前向 Euler 增量之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\Delta t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 为时间步长。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，更新式退化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\hat\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入并按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 合并：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_t+\\Bigl(\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\Bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>注意到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}=\\sqrt{\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，开方即得），故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}-x_t=\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}-1\\Bigr)x_t+\\Bigl(\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}}\\Bigr)\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-1=-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\Delta t+o(\\Delta t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}}=-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\,\\Delta t+o(\\Delta t)$</span>。而 PF-ODE 的速度场（前序节已证）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\,x-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t},$$</div>\n<p>其中第二项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}$</span> 的导数与噪声方向的组合。逐项比对即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}-x_t=v_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Delta t+o(\\Delta t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该命题只断言“一阶相容”，不断言“收敛”。收敛性需要 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 条件保证 Euler 格式的稳定性，这属于数值 ODE 的标准结论，本节不重复证明，仅指出接口位置：前序“与 PF-ODE 的等价”节给出了连续时间极限的严格陈述，本节给出的是其离散对应物。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题二-eta-的插值与-PF-ODE-的随机扰动项\">接口命题二：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的插值与 PF-ODE 的随机扰动项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题二-eta-的插值与-PF-ODE-的随机扰动项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 的恒等变形）</strong>\n在 (A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\Bigl(\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t\\Bigr)=\\eta^2\\bigl(\\Delta_{t-1}-\\Delta_t+\\Delta_{t-1}\\tfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t$</span>，这正是 DDPM 后验方差；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\frac{\\Delta_{t-1}}{\\Delta_t}\\Bigl(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\Bigr)=\\eta^2\\frac{\\Delta_{t-1}}{\\Delta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\eta^2\\frac{\\Delta_{t-1}}{\\Delta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-1$</span>，整理得第一等式；第二等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t=\\Delta_{t-1}-\\Delta_t+\\Delta_t(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的端点语义）</strong>\n在 (A4) 下：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新式不含随机项，采样轨迹是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的确定性函数；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 等于 DDPM 的后验方差，更新式与 DDPM 的反向采样步同分布。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续插值“确定性—随机性”，且端点分别对应前序“确定性极限”节与“与 DDPM 的关系”节的两个极限对象。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 直接得。(ii) 由命题 15.2 的第二等式与 DDPM 后验方差公式（前序节已建立）逐项比对即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题三-eta-gt-0-时与-PF-ODE-的偏离量估计\">接口命题三：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时与 PF-ODE 的偏离量估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题三-eta-gt-0-时与-PF-ODE-的偏离量估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.4（随机项的累积偏离）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1]$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步采样，每步注入独立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。则采样终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(N)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的确定性轨迹终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(0,N)}$</span> 之差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\bigl\\|x_0^{(N)}-x_0^{(0,N)}\\bigr\\|^2\\le\\eta^2\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\prod_{j=i+1}^{N}\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{j-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_j}}}\\Bigr)^2 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 将两条轨迹的更新式相减，随机项仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}\\varepsilon_i$</span>，且线性部分的传播矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{j-1}}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_j}}\\,I$</span>（由命题 15.1 的合并形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 项对差分的贡献被 Lipschitz 界吸收，此处取上界）。由独立性，交叉项期望为零，逐项平方求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_i\\|^2=d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span> 的上界即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该估计说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 越大、步数越多，随机项累积偏离越显著；当步长趋于零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=O(\\Delta t)$</span>），故连续时间极限下随机项消失，回到 PF-ODE。这正是“与 PF-ODE 章的接口”的定量内容：DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族在离散层面插值，在连续时间极限下所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 都收敛到同一 PF-ODE 的流。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-具体例子-一维高斯验证\">具体例子：一维高斯验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-具体例子-一维高斯验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.8$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=x$</span>（线性去噪器，满足 (A1)(A2)）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_2=0,\\quad x_1=\\sqrt{0.8}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{0.2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon .$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_2-\\sqrt{0.5}\\,x_2)/\\sqrt{0.5}=x_2(1-\\sqrt{0.5})/\\sqrt{0.5}$</span>，计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot x_2(1-\\sqrt{0.5})/\\sqrt{0.5}+\\sqrt{0.2}\\,x_2$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.8}/\\sqrt{0.5}\\approx1.2649$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\sqrt{0.5})\\approx0.2929$</span>，乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.3706$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.2}\\approx0.4472$</span>；合计系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.8178$</span>。而 PF-ODE 在该区间的精确流映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_2^1(x)=\\exp(\\int_1^2 v_\\theta\\,dt)$</span> 的线性化，其一阶 Euler 近似系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8178$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 内一致，验证命题 15.1。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef ddim_step(x_t, ab_t, ab_prev, eps_hat, eta, rng):\n    # 单步 DDIM 更新，d 维批量\n    delta_t = 1.0 - ab_t\n    delta_prev = 1.0 - ab_prev\n    sigma = eta * np.sqrt(delta_prev / delta_t) * np.sqrt(1.0 - ab_t / ab_prev)\n    x0_hat = (x_t - np.sqrt(delta_t) * eps_hat) / np.sqrt(ab_t)\n    noise = rng.standard_normal(x_t.shape) if sigma &gt; 0 else np.zeros_like(x_t)\n    return np.sqrt(ab_prev) * x0_hat + np.sqrt(max(delta_prev - sigma**2, 0.0)) * eps_hat + sigma * noise\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nd = 4\nx2 = rng.standard_normal(d)\nab2, ab1 = 0.5, 0.8\neps_hat = x2  # 线性去噪器\nx1_det = ddim_step(x2, ab2, ab1, eps_hat, eta=0.0, rng=rng)\nx1_sto = ddim_step(x2, ab2, ab1, eps_hat, eta=1.0, rng=rng)\nassert x1_det.shape == (d,)\nassert np.allclose(x1_det, np.sqrt(0.8) * ((x2 - np.sqrt(0.5)*x2)/np.sqrt(0.5)) + np.sqrt(0.2)*x2)\nassert not np.allclose(x1_det, x1_sto)\nprint(&quot;shape:&quot;, x1_det.shape, &quot;eta=0 与 eta=1 不同:&quot;, not np.allclose(x1_det, x1_sto))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>shape: (4,) eta=0 与 eta=1 不同: True</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的边界-何时该命题失效\">接口的边界：何时该命题失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的边界-何时该命题失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.1 的一阶相容性依赖 (A2) 的 Lipschitz 条件；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 在采样区域内不 Lipschitz（例如分段常数网络），则 Euler 增量的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\Delta t)$</span> 余项不再受控，离散轨迹可能不收敛到 PF-ODE 流。命题 15.4 的偏离估计依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 的独立性；若采样器复用随机数（ antithetic 或公共随机数），交叉项不为零，估计需改为含协方差项的版本。这些失效情形属于本章第 10 节反例节的范畴，本节仅标记接口边界，不展开构造。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 更新式经恒等变形后与 PF-ODE 速度场的一阶 Euler 增量相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\Delta t)$</span>，故 DDIM 确定性采样是 PF-ODE 的离散化接口，相容性由 (A1)–(A4) 保证。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2(\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t)$</span>，端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 分别精确对应确定性 DDIM 与 DDPM 后验方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在离散层面连续插值二者。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时随机项造成相对确定性轨迹的累积偏离，其平方期望被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\prod_j A_j^2$</span> 控制；步长趋于零时该上界趋于零，故连续时间极限下所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族收敛到同一 PF-ODE 流。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题四-离散流映射与-PF-ODE-流映射的定量比较\">接口命题四：离散流映射与 PF-ODE 流映射的定量比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题四-离散流映射与-PF-ODE-流映射的定量比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.1 只给出单步的一阶相容性。要把它接到 PF-ODE 章的整体流映射上，需要一个跨多步的误差累积陈述。设网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_N&lt;t_{N-1}&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_0=T$</span>（反向采样方向），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N=\\psi_{t_{N-1}}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\psi_{t_0}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 复合映射，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_{t_i}$</span> 是命题 15.1 合并形式给出的单步映射；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{T}^{0}$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的流映射。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（复合误差界）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在采样所涉紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L:=\\sup_t L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>，单步映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_{t_i}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda_i$</span>-Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda:=\\sup_i\\Lambda_i&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\in K$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl\\|\\Psi_N(x_T)-\\Phi_T^0(x_T)\\bigr\\|\\le C\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\bigl(\\Delta t_i\\bigr)^2 ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(L,\\Lambda,T,\\sup_t\\|\\partial_t v_\\theta\\|)$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i=t_{i-1}-t_i$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i=\\Psi_{t_i}(x_T)$</span> 为离散轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i=\\Phi_{t_i}^T(x_T)$</span> 为精确流。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，由三角不等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|y_{i-1}-z_{i-1}\\|\\le\\|\\psi_{t_i}(y_i)-\\Phi_{t_i}^{t_{i-1}}(y_i)\\|+\\|\\Phi_{t_i}^{t_{i-1}}(y_i)-\\Phi_{t_i}^{t_{i-1}}(z_i)\\| .$$</div>\n<p>第一项是单步局部截断误差。由命题 15.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_{t_i}(y_i)=y_i+v_\\theta(y_i,t_i)\\Delta t_i+o(\\Delta t_i)$</span>；而精确流满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t_i}^{t_{i-1}}(y_i)=y_i+\\int_{t_i}^{t_{i-1}}v_\\theta(\\Phi_{t_i}^s(y_i),s)\\,ds$</span>。在 (A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微（前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的光滑性给出）下，被积函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(y_i,t_i)$</span> 之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_i)$</span>，故第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C_1(\\Delta t_i)^2$</span>。第二项由流的 Lipschitz 性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\Lambda_i\\|y_i-z_i\\|$</span>。合并得递推</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|y_{i-1}-z_{i-1}\\|\\le\\Lambda\\|y_i-z_i\\|+C_1(\\Delta t_i)^2 .$$</div>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=N$</span> 递推到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>，初始误差为零，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|y_0-z_0\\|\\le C_1\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(\\Delta t_i)^2\\prod_{j=i+1}^{N}\\Lambda$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\Lambda\\le\\Lambda^N$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda^N$</span> 有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda=1+O(\\Delta t)$</span>），故可吸收进常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该命题把“单步相容”升级为“复合收敛”：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span> 时右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le C\\cdot T\\max_i\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Psi_N\\to\\Phi_T^0$</span> 一致收敛。这正是 DDIM 确定性采样能够作为 PF-ODE 数值解的理论依据，也是本节标题“接口”的严格含义：DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 分支不是 PF-ODE 的近似类比，而是其显式 Euler 离散化，误差阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题五-eta-族的连续时间极限与流映射的交换\">接口命题五：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族的连续时间极限与流映射的交换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题五-eta-族的连续时间极限与流映射的交换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“与 PF-ODE 的等价”节断言了连续时间极限下 DDIM 与 PF-ODE 的等价。本节需要把该断言与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数挂钩：是否所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时都收敛到同一流？命题 15.4 已给出偏离上界随步长趋零，但那是期望意义下的二阶矩。下面给出几乎必然意义下的陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族在连续时间极限下坍缩到同一流）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_i^{(\\eta)}\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化的 DDIM 采样轨迹，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i\\Delta t_i\\to0$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\mathbb P\\Bigl(\\max_{0\\le i\\le N}\\bigl\\|x_i^{(\\eta)}-\\Phi_{t_i}^T(x_T)\\bigr\\|&gt;\\delta\\Bigr)=0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i^{(\\eta)}$</span> 分解为确定性部分与随机部分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_i^{(\\eta)}=y_i+r_i$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_i$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_i$</span> 为累积随机项。由命题 15.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|y_i-\\Phi_{t_i}^T(x_T)\\|\\le C\\sum(\\Delta t)^2\\to0$</span> 确定性成立。由命题 15.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|r_i\\|^2\\le\\eta^2\\sum_j\\sigma_{t_j}^2\\prod A^2$</span>。关键观察：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_j}^2=O(\\Delta t_j)$</span>（由命题 15.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2(\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{t-1}-\\Delta_t=O(\\Delta t)$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\sigma_{t_j}^2=O(\\max\\Delta t)\\to0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|r_i\\|^2\\to0$</span>，由 Markov 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\|r_i\\|&gt;\\delta/2)\\le 4\\mathbb E\\|r_i\\|^2/\\delta^2\\to0$</span>。对有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 取并集界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 增长但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_i$</span> 的并集概率由一致界控制），得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该命题澄清了一个常见误解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不是“模型质量参数”，而是离散层面的插值参数；在连续时间极限下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的信息被步长吞没，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族共享同一 PF-ODE 流。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的实际作用只在有限步数下显现——这正是下一小节要量化的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-有限步数下-eta-与步数的权衡-一个可检验的恒等式\">有限步数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步数的权衡：一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-有限步数下-eta-与步数的权衡-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.6 说的是极限行为，但工程上步数有限。下面给出有限步数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对终点分布的影响的一个精确恒等式，它把“步数—质量”关系接到接口上。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.7（有限步终点协方差的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 为线性去噪器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=\\kappa_t x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 为标量，满足 (A1)(A2)），初始 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 参数化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 步 DDIM 终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(\\eta)}$</span> 为高斯，其协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}\\bigl(x_0^{(\\eta)}\\bigr)=\\Bigl(\\prod_{i=1}^{N}\\lambda_i\\Bigr)^2 I+\\eta^2\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\sigma_{t_i}^2\\Bigl(\\prod_{j=1}^{i-1}\\lambda_j\\Bigr)^2 I ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_{i-1}}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}\\,(1-\\kappa_{t_i}\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t_i}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}})+\\kappa_{t_i}\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t_{i-1}}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t_i}}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的标量传播系数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 线性去噪器下每步更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t_{i-1}}=\\lambda_i x_{t_i}+\\sigma_{t_i}\\varepsilon_i$</span>（把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 的线性组合合并为标量系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 独立）。逐 step 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{(\\eta)}=(\\prod\\lambda_i)x_T+\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}(\\prod_{j&lt;i}\\lambda_j)\\varepsilon_i$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i$</span> 独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 独立，协方差为两项之和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大协方差的单调性）</strong>\n在命题 15.7 的设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0^{(\\eta)})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 单调不减，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时协方差退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\prod\\lambda_i)^2 I$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i&lt;1$</span>（采样收缩），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 部分补偿了收缩造成的方差损失；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i\\approx1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 引入额外方差，导致分布偏移。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 第二项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2(\\prod_{j&lt;i}\\lambda_j)^2\\ge0$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 线性，故单调。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}=0$</span>，第二项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 推论 15.8 给出“步数与质量”关系的接口解释：步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i$</span> 趋近于 PF-ODE 流的精确传播系数（命题 15.5），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2$</span> 趋近于零（命题 15.6），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的影响随步数增加而衰减。反之，步数少时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i$</span> 偏离精确流，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 可能部分补偿也可能加剧偏移，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的符号与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的调度。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择必须与步数联合考虑，而不能孤立地作为“随机性旋钮”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的坐标无关表述\">接口的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述命题均在欧氏坐标下写出。PF-ODE 章的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上，DDIM 更新亦逐坐标进行，故无需流形结构。但若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的向量场积分曲线，命题 15.5 的复合误差界可无坐标地表述为：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Psi_N(x_T)-\\Phi_T^0(x_T)\\|$</span> 被截断误差的积分控制，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的固定范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Lambda$</span> 为该范数下流的算子范数上界。该表述不依赖基的选择，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 均为标量或向量场的坐标无关对象（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的截面）。维度指标范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1,\\dots,d$</span>，所有矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 标量倍单位阵，故无指标混淆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题六-与得分匹配的桥接恒等式\">接口命题六：与得分匹配的桥接恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题六-与得分匹配的桥接恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>PF-ODE 章的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 与得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\,x-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>（前序节已建立）。DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 与得分的关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)=-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\,\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span>（Tweedie 公式，前序节已建立）。本小节给出一个把两者接起来的恒等式，用于验证接口的自洽性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.9（速度场—噪声估计的桥接）</strong>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v_\\theta(x,t)=-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\alpha_t\\,x+\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\Delta_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t) .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\Delta_t=\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t/\\Delta_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t=-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 的第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\cdot(-\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t})=\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}=\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\Delta_t\\cdot\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}\\cdot\\hat\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{\\Delta_t}=\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\Delta_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该恒等式说明：命题 15.1 中 DDIM 单步增量里的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sqrt{\\Delta_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\Delta_t-\\Delta_{t-1}})$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\Delta_t\\,\\Delta t$</span> 的离散化，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 的第二项一致。这从得分角度确认了接口的代数自洽性，而不依赖网络的具体参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题七-eta-对-PF-ODE-数值解的偏差方向\">接口命题七：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对 PF-ODE 数值解的偏差方向<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题七-eta-对-PF-ODE-数值解的偏差方向\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.4 给出偏离的二阶矩上界，但未说明偏离的方向。下面给出一个一阶偏差的符号陈述，用于判断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 是“向数据分布收缩”还是“向先验扩散”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的一阶偏差符号）</strong>\n在命题 15.7 的线性设定下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t&gt;0$</span>（去噪器收缩）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0^{(\\eta)}]=(\\prod\\lambda_i)\\mathbb E[x_T]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_0^{(\\eta)})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 单调增。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 不改变均值，只增大方差；若目标分布的方差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 轨迹的方差，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 造成向先验的偏移。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 均值部分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0^{(\\eta)}]=(\\prod\\lambda_i)\\mathbb E[x_T]+\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}(\\prod_{j&lt;i}\\lambda_j)\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon_i]=(\\prod\\lambda_i)\\mathbb E[x_T]$</span>，随机项均值为零。方差部分由命题 15.7 与推论 15.8。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该命题给出接口的一个实用判据：在有限步数下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的选择应使终点方差匹配目标分布方差；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i$</span> 已使方差偏小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 可补偿；若已匹配，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 则过冲。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 在步数充足时是最优的确定性选择，而在步数不足时适度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 可改善分布匹配——但改善与否取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod\\lambda_i$</span> 与目标方差的相对大小，不能一概而论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口命题八-步数趋无穷时-eta-影响的衰减速率\">接口命题八：步数趋无穷时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 影响的衰减速率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口命题八-步数趋无穷时-eta-影响的衰减速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.6 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 影响随步长趋零而消失，但未给出速率。下面给出一个显式速率，用于量化“步数与质量”的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 影响的衰减速率）</strong>\n在 (A3)(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t$</span> 有界，则对均匀步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=T/N$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\sigma_{t_i}^2=O\\bigl(\\eta^2\\max_i\\Delta t_i\\bigr)=O\\bigl(\\eta^2/N\\bigr) .$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由命题 15.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2(\\Delta_{t-1}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Delta_t)$</span>。在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{t-1}-\\Delta_t=\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,\\Delta t+o(\\Delta t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t}=1+O(\\Delta t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\bigl(\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,\\Delta t+O((\\Delta t)^2)\\bigr)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\Delta t=T$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2=\\eta^2\\bigl(\\int\\frac{d}{dt}\\Delta_t\\,dt+O(\\max\\Delta t)\\bigr)=\\eta^2\\bigl(\\Delta_T-\\Delta_0+O(\\max\\Delta t)\\bigr)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_0=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_T&lt;1$</span>，主项为常数，但被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\max\\Delta t)$</span> 修正；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时修正项主导衰减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\sigma_{t_i}^2=O(\\eta^2/N)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注.</strong> 该命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 引入的随机项总方差随步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span> 衰减。因此“增加步数”与“减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>”在终点分布方差上有可交换的效果——这为工程上“步数换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>”的权衡提供了定量接口：若步数翻倍，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 可相应增大以维持相同的随机项总方差，但确定性部分的截断误差同时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 衰减，故两者并非完全等价，需分别控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-接口的总结性恒等式-DDIM-更新作为-PF-ODE-的变步长-Euler\">接口的总结性恒等式：DDIM 更新作为 PF-ODE 的变步长 Euler<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-接口的总结性恒等式-DDIM-更新作为-PF-ODE-的变步长-Euler\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 15.1、15.5、15.9 合起来，可写出一个统一的恒等式，它把 DDIM 的离散更新、PF-ODE 的速度场、得分三者串成一条链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t_{i-1}}^{(\\eta=0)}=x_{t_i}+\\Delta t_i\\,v_\\theta(x_{t_i},t_i)+\\tfrac12\\bigl(\\Delta t_i\\bigr)^2\\,\\partial_t v_\\theta(x_{t_i},t_i)+O\\bigl((\\Delta t_i)^3\\bigr) ,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v_\\theta$</span> 由命题 15.9 的桥接恒等式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的可微性给出（(A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 光滑，(A1)(A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 正则，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的可微性需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微，此处显式加入作为 (A5)）。该恒等式说明：DDIM 的确定性分支是 PF-ODE 的二阶精度显式 Euler（若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t v_\\theta$</span> 项吸收进修正），而一阶项正是命题 15.1 的内容。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 时，随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t_i}\\varepsilon_i$</span> 在恒等式右端附加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\Delta t_i})$</span> 的噪声，其方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t_i)$</span> 与二阶截断项同阶，故在有限步数下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与截断误差不可分离——这正是接口的深层含义：DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 族不是 PF-ODE 的“近似族”，而是 PF-ODE 离散化的“随机化族”，其连续时间极限唯一，有限步行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 与步长联合决定。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5)（时间可微性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in K,t}\\|\\partial_t\\hat\\varepsilon(x,t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>。该假设在去噪网络以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为输入且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 光滑时成立。</p>\n<p>在上述恒等式下，命题 15.5 的复合误差界可精确到二阶：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\Psi_N(x_T)-\\Phi_T^0(x_T)\\|\\le C\\sum_i(\\Delta t_i)^2$</span> 中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 现由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|\\partial_t v_\\theta\\|$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\|\\partial_x v_\\theta\\|$</span> 显式给出，不再依赖抽象的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$o(\\Delta t)$</span>。这把接口从“相容”升级为“二阶收敛速率”，是本节对 PF-ODE 章最实质的贡献：DDIM 确定性采样不仅是 PF-ODE 的离散化，而且其误差阶可被速度场的时间与空间导数界定量控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df16--h-本章推导链-非马尔可夫的确定性\">本章推导链：非马尔可夫的确定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-本章推导链-非马尔可夫的确定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机对象；仅对推导链中反复出现的量作一次集中登记，以便逐项核对假设。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间轴：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\bar\\alpha_T&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\bar\\alpha_1&lt;1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>前向族：给定数据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上概率测度，具有限二阶矩），非马尔可夫前向由本章第 1 节定义，其边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal{N}(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。本节只使用该边际，不重述转移核。</li>\n<li>得分与预测：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon=\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span> 为数据预测，二者满足本章第 2 节已证的代数关系\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\hat\\varepsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div></li>\n<li>更新族参数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\ge 0$</span> 为本章第 3 节定义的随机性幅度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 为其归一化参数，满足 canonical 公式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t=\\eta\\sqrt{\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div></li>\n<li>更新式（canonical）：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,\\dots,1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I).$$</div></li>\n<li>概率流 ODE（本章第 5 节已定义）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}x/\\mathrm{d}t=f(x,t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=v_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 为本章第 5 节给出的速度场；本节只引用其离散化，不重复构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设统一列如下，后续每个命题只引用与其相关的条目。</p>\n<p>(A1) 可测性与可积性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{q_t}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 具有限二阶矩。</p>\n<p>(A2) Lipschitz 与有界性：在本节涉及的紧时间区间与紧状态集上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le M$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 非退化方差：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>；当使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2\\ge 0$</span>，此即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，由 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时自动成立（见命题 3）。</p>\n<p>(A4) 得分一致性：本章第 5 节已证，在 (A1)(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 诱导的得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=-\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 PF-ODE 速度场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)=v_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 的显式表达；本节引用该恒等式而不重证。</p>\n<p>(A5) 数值实现假设：浮点运算下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 的宗量非负，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的计算不产生下溢；第 8 节已讨论其失效边界，本节只引用。</p>\n<p>下面按“定义—主定理—推论—例子”的顺序完成推导链，每一步标注命题、假设与证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-1-确定性映射的定义与相邻概念的区别\">1. 确定性映射的定义与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-1-确定性映射的定义与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（DDIM 更新映射）</strong> 在 (A1)—(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，定义映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{\\eta}:\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^{\\eta}(x_t,\\varepsilon)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^{0}(x_t)=\\Phi_t^{0}(x_t,0)$</span>，称为确定性 DDIM 更新映射。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>（三点，逐条对照，不展开前序节已证内容）：</p>\n<p>(i) 与 DDPM 反向核的区别：DDPM 的反向核是马尔可夫链的转移概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其随机性来自固定的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，且该核由前向马尔可夫链的贝叶斯反演唯一确定；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^\\eta$</span> 的随机性由自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不参与前向边际的构造，故前向族非马尔可夫。区别的数学内容是：DDPM 的转移核被前向链的联合分布锁定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^\\eta$</span> 则只被边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 锁定，联合分布自由。</p>\n<p>(ii) 与 PF-ODE 流的区别：PF-ODE 是连续时间向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的积分流 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_s$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{d}\\phi_s/\\mathrm{d}s=f(\\phi_s,s)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 是离散时间映射，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的一个一阶离散化（命题 4 给出精确陈述）。二者不是同一个对象：前者是微分同胚族，后者是逐点映射，只有在步长趋于零且离散格式相容时才收敛。</p>\n<p>(iii) 与得分估计的区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是网络输出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^\\eta$</span> 是用它构造的采样更新；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^\\eta$</span> 不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是任何真实得分的精确估计，只要求 (A1)(A2)。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^\\eta$</span> 的分布性质不能由“得分估计准确”直接推出，必须单独分析（第 10 节反例即针对此点）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-2-主定理-eta-0-时更新式与-PF-ODE-离散化一致\">2. 主定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新式与 PF-ODE 离散化一致<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-2-主定理-eta-0-时更新式与-PF-ODE-离散化一致\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的代数退化）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>，且 canonical 更新式退化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时右端含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span>。代入 canonical 更新式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 同时消失，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的合法范围）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。canonical 公式给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2=\\eta^2\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot(1-r_t).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}r_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}r_t$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-r_t)=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-r_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}r_t}.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=r_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{(1-a)(1-r)}{1-ar}\\le 1$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a)(1-r)\\le 1-ar$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-a-r+ar\\le 1-ar$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ar-ar\\le a+r-2ar$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le a+r-2ar$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,r\\in(0,1)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a(1-r)+r(1-a)\\ge 0$</span>，故成立。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\le 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。非负性由各因子非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明 (A3) 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>”不是额外假设，而是 canonical 公式的推论；这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 的宗量在实数域内非负，无需在实数运算层面另设条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 的一阶相容性）</strong> 在 (A1)—(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=t-(t-1)=1$</span> 为离散步长（本章时间轴为整数，故步长恒为 1；若将时间重标度为连续变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 为相邻整数点对应的连续时间间隔）。则确定性 DDIM 更新 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 出发、步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 的一阶 Euler 步满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^{0}(x_t)=x_t+\\Delta\\tau\\, f(x_t,t)+O(\\Delta\\tau^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为本章第 5 节的速度场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau^2)$</span> 的常数只依赖 (A2) 中的局部 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤逐步写出）</strong></p>\n<p>第一步：写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 的显式表达。由命题 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^0(x_t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^0(x_t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,x_t+\\left(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right)\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^0(x_t)=c_t x_t+d_t\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t).$$</div></p>\n<p>第二步：写出 PF-ODE 速度场在离散时间点上的表达。本章第 5 节已证（(A4) 引用），在同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$f(x,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\Delta\\tau\\,\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\Delta\\tau\\,\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,x.$$</div>\n此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 为相邻整数时间点对应的连续时间间隔；该表达式的推导只用边际高斯性与得分恒等式，不引入新假设。</p>\n<p>第三步：计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t+\\Delta\\tau f(x_t,t)$</span> 并与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 逐项比较。将第二步乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 后加到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t+\\Delta\\tau f=\\left(1+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right)x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n第一项系数化简：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p>第四步：验证两个系数与第一步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t,d_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau\\to 0$</span> 时的一阶匹配。将第一步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\Delta\\tau\\,\\lambda_t+O(\\Delta\\tau^2))$</span> 下展开（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=-\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\tau}\\log\\bar\\alpha_\\tau\\big|_{\\tau=t}$</span>，由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的可微性保证；本章时间轴离散，此处只作形式展开以比较系数，严格陈述为：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时两系数之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span>）。直接计算差：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时该差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 求导并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 取值，得有限常数，故差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span>。同理\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 的导数有限，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t^0(x_t)-\\big(x_t+\\Delta\\tau f(x_t,t)\\big)=O(\\Delta\\tau)\\cdot x_t+O(\\Delta\\tau)\\cdot\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t).$$</div>\n由 (A2) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\le M$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在紧集上，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau^2)$</span> 的界（常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 与紧集半径）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的结论是“一阶相容”，不是“相等”。它只说明：当相邻时间点的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 间隔趋于零时，确定性 DDIM 的一步更新与 PF-ODE 的 Euler 步相差二阶小量。这为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时 DDIM 是 PF-ODE 的离散化”提供了可检验的数学内容，而不把二者混为一谈（禁止事项 4 的边界在此显式划出）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-3-推论-eta-1-退化为-DDPM-的方差形式\">3. 推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 退化为 DDPM 的方差形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-3-推论-eta-1-退化为-DDPM-的方差形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的方差匹配）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 等于 DDPM 反向核在后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 下的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的高斯近似形式，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2\\big|_{\\eta=1}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式中令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span>，右端即上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>可检验的恒等式（推论 1 的推论）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2\\big|_{\\eta=1}-\\sigma_t^2\\big|_{\\eta=0}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left(1-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right).$$</div>\n且由命题 2，该量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}]$</span>。此恒等式可直接在代码中逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 断言（见代码节），用于验证实现与 canonical 公式一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-4-具体例子-T-2-的逐步验证\">4. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的逐步验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-4-具体例子-T-2-的逐步验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2=0$</span>。canonical 更新给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_1=\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat x_0(x_2,2)+\\sqrt{0.5}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_2,2).$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1=0$</span>。canonical 更新给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\sqrt{1}\\,\\hat x_0(x_1,1)+\\sqrt{0}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\hat x_0(x_1,1).$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>验证命题 3 的系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\sqrt{0.5/0.25}=\\sqrt{2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2=\\sqrt{0.5}-\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt{0.75}=\\sqrt{0.5}-\\sqrt{1.5}$</span>。PF-ODE 速度场系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\sqrt{0.5}-\\sqrt{0.25})/\\sqrt{0.75}=(0.7071-0.5)/0.8660=0.2391$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2=0.7071-1.2247=-0.5176$</span>；二者在有限步长下不相等，命题 3 只断言差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的相对变化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，并非小量，故不应期待数值接近。这正说明命题 3 是渐近陈述，有限步长下偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span> 项承载，第 7 节“步数与质量”讨论的正是这一项的累积效应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-5-推导链的闭合-从非马尔可夫前向到确定性采样\">5. 推导链的闭合：从非马尔可夫前向到确定性采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-5-推导链的闭合-从非马尔可夫前向到确定性采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将本节四个命题串成一条闭合链，每一步只引用前一步与已登记假设：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>非马尔可夫前向（本章第 1 节）只固定边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>，联合分布自由；自由度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>canonical 更新式（本章第 2 节）把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 作为自由参数写入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 是其归一化（本章第 3 节）。</li>\n<li>命题 2 证明 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in[0,1]$</span> 时自动满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\le 1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故更新式的平方根宗量合法，无需额外约束。</li>\n<li>命题 1 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新式退化为确定性映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span>。</li>\n<li>命题 3 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 的 Euler 步一阶相容，故“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的 DDIM 是 PF-ODE 的离散化”是可在 (A1)—(A4) 下逐项验证的命题，而非类比。</li>\n<li>推论 1 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 回到 DDPM 的方差形式，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上插值于“确定性”与“DDPM 随机性”两端，canonical 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0\\Rightarrow$</span> 确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow$</span> DDPM 在此获得代数内容。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>该链的每一环都只依赖已登记假设；若 (A2) 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不局部 Lipschitz），命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau^2)$</span> 界不再成立，但命题 1、2、推论 1 仍成立（它们只用代数恒等式）。若 (A3) 失效（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=0$</span>），命题 2 的除法无定义，canonical 公式本身失效；此边界在第 8 节数值稳定性中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-6-代码验证-canonical-公式与命题-2-推论-1-的逐点断言\">6. 代码验证：canonical 公式与命题 2、推论 1 的逐点断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-6-代码验证-canonical-公式与命题-2-推论-1-的逐点断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在浮点下逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的 canonical 公式、命题 2 的界、推论 1 的恒等式，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时更新式退化为确定性映射。所有断言均为精确等式或不等式，不依赖随机种子。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef make_alphas(T=10, seed=0):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    # 取 alpha_s in (0.1, 0.9)，保证 bar_alpha 严格递减且远离 0/1\n    alphas = rng.uniform(0.1, 0.9, size=T)\n    bar = np.cumprod(alphas)\n    return alphas, bar\n\ndef sigma_sq(t, bar, eta):\n    # t 为 1-based；返回 sigma_t^2，使用 canonical 公式\n    a_prev = bar[t-2] if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n    a_t = bar[t-1]\n    return (eta**2) * (1.0 - a_prev) / (1.0 - a_t) * (1.0 - a_t / a_prev)\n\nalphas, bar = make_alphas(T=10)\nT = len(bar)\nprint(&quot;alphas shape:&quot;, alphas.shape, &quot;bar shape:&quot;, bar.shape)\nprint(&quot;bar:&quot;, np.round(bar, 4))\n\nfor eta in [0.0, 0.5, 1.0]:\n    for t in range(1, T+1):\n        s2 = sigma_sq(t, bar, eta)\n        a_prev = bar[t-2] if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n        # 命题 2：0 &lt;= sigma_t^2 &lt;= 1 - bar_{t-1}\n        assert s2 &gt;= -1e-12, (eta, t, s2)\n        assert s2 &lt;= (1.0 - a_prev) + 1e-12, (eta, t, s2)\n        # canonical 公式的显式展开\n        lhs = s2\n        rhs = (eta**2) * (1.0 - a_prev) / (1.0 - bar[t-1]) * (1.0 - bar[t-1]/a_prev)\n        assert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12, (eta, t, lhs, rhs)\n    print(f&quot;eta={eta}: 命题2 与 canonical 公式逐点通过&quot;)\n\n# 推论 1：eta=1 时 sigma_t^2 等于 DDPM 方差形式\nfor t in range(1, T+1):\n    a_prev = bar[t-2] if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n    s2_1 = sigma_sq(t, bar, 1.0)\n    ddpm_var = (1.0 - a_prev) / (1.0 - bar[t-1]) * (1.0 - bar[t-1]/a_prev)\n    assert abs(s2_1 - ddpm_var) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;推论1：eta=1 的方差匹配逐点通过&quot;)\n\n# eta=0 时更新式退化为确定性映射：随机项系数为 0\nt = 5\ns2_0 = sigma_sq(t, bar, 0.0)\nassert s2_0 == 0.0\nprint(&quot;eta=0: sigma_t^2 =&quot;, s2_0, &quot;（确定性）&quot;)\n\n# 命题 1 的代数退化：给定 x_t 与网络输出，比较 canonical 更新与确定性映射\nd = 4\nx_t = np.random.default_rng(1).normal(size=d)\neps_hat = np.random.default_rng(2).normal(size=d)\na_prev = bar[t-2]\na_t = bar[t-1]\nx0_hat = (x_t - np.sqrt(1.0 - a_t) * eps_hat) / np.sqrt(a_t)\n# canonical 更新（eta=0）\nx_prev_canonical = np.sqrt(a_prev) * x0_hat + np.sqrt(1.0 - a_prev - s2_0) * eps_hat\n# 确定性映射\nx_prev_det = np.sqrt(a_prev) * x0_hat + np.sqrt(1.0 - a_prev) * eps_hat\nassert np.allclose(x_prev_canonical, x_prev_det, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;命题1：eta=0 更新式退化，形状&quot;, x_prev_canonical.shape, &quot;预期 (4,)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果预期：<code>alphas shape: (10,) bar shape: (10,)</code>；三组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 均打印“命题2 与 canonical 公式逐点通过”；推论 1 打印“逐点通过”；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 打印 <code>sigma_t^2 = 0.0</code>；命题 1 打印形状 <code>(4,)</code> 且断言通过。代码中所有断言均为精确等式或带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差的不等式，不依赖随机种子以外的随机性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-7-离散化误差的累积界-从单步相容到轨迹级估计\">7. 离散化误差的累积界：从单步相容到轨迹级估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-7-离散化误差的累积界-从单步相容到轨迹级估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 只给出单步相容性。要把它接到“采样轨迹”上，需要把单步误差沿时间轴累积。本节给出一个只依赖 (A1)—(A4) 的轨迹级误差界，其形式足以支撑第 7 节“步数与质量”的讨论，但不涉及分布层面的 KL 或 Wasserstein 估计（那属于第 7 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（轨迹级误差累积）</strong> 在 (A1)—(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}\\}_{t=T}^{0}$</span> 为确定性 DDIM 迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 生成的序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\}_{t=T}^{0}$</span> 为 PF-ODE 从同一点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发、以相同整数时间点为节点的精确流采样（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}=\\phi_{t-1,t}(x_t^{\\mathrm{ODE}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_{s,t}$</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的流映射）。则在每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_t^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}-x_t^{\\mathrm{ODE}}\\|\\le \\sum_{s=t+1}^{T} L^{T-s}\\, e_s,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_s=O(\\Delta\\tau_s^2)$</span> 为命题 3 在节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 给出的单步误差界（常数依赖 (A2) 的局部 Lipschitz 常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s^0$</span> 在相应紧集上的 Lipschitz 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\tau_s$</span> 为节点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 对应的连续时间间隔。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong></p>\n<p>第一步：单步分解。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_s=x_{s-1}^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}-x_{s-1}^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>。由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_s=\\Phi_s^0(x_s^{\\mathrm{DDIM}})-\\phi_{s-1,s}(x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}}).$$</div>\n插入并减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s^0(x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}})$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_s=\\big[\\Phi_s^0(x_s^{\\mathrm{DDIM}})-\\Phi_s^0(x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}})\\big]+\\big[\\Phi_s^0(x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}})-\\phi_{s-1,s}(x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}})\\big].$$</div>\n第二项由命题 3 界定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|\\le e_s$</span>。第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_s^0$</span> 的局部 Lipschitz 性界定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le L\\|\\delta_{s+1}\\|$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{s+1}=x_s^{\\mathrm{DDIM}}-x_s^{\\mathrm{ODE}}$</span>）。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_s\\|\\le L\\|\\delta_{s+1}\\|+e_s.$$</div></p>\n<p>第二步：递推展开。从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=T$</span> 向下递推，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_T\\|=0$</span>（同一起点），于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\delta_{T-1}\\|\\le e_T,\\quad \\|\\delta_{T-2}\\|\\le L e_T+e_{T-1},\\quad \\dots$$</div>\n一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta_t\\|\\le\\sum_{s=t+1}^{T}L^{T-s}e_s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的界是显式的：它把轨迹误差写成单步误差按 Lipschitz 常数的幂次加权求和。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&lt;1$</span> 时误差不放大，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;1$</span> 时按几何级数放大。这解释了第 7 节“步数与质量”中的一个现象：步数增加使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_s$</span> 变小，但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 接近或超过 1，累积项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum L^{T-s}e_s$</span> 未必随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 单调下降，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大同时增加了求和项数。本节不展开该定量分析，只指出命题 4 是第 7 节讨论的数学入口。</p>\n<p><strong>关于 (A2) 的必要性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不局部 Lipschitz，第一步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\|\\delta_{s+1}\\|$</span> 界失效，命题 4 不成立。此时单步相容（命题 3）仍成立，但轨迹级误差无界；这正是第 10 节反例中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 选择不当导致分布偏移”的一个可能机制（网络在采样轨迹附近不光滑）。本节只登记该边界，不构造反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-8-确定性映射的逆-Phi_t-0-的可逆性与隐式采样的接口\">8. 确定性映射的逆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 的可逆性与隐式采样的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-8-确定性映射的逆-Phi_t-0-的可逆性与隐式采样的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 11 节“隐式采样”需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 时反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。本节给出一个充分条件，说明在什么假设下该反解存在且唯一，从而为第 11 节提供接口；本节不展开隐式采样的算法细节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 的局部可逆性）</strong> 在 (A1)—(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 的，且其 Jacobian 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sup_{x\\in K}\\left\\|\\frac{\\partial\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\partial x}(x,t)\\right\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}&lt;\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-c_t},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上为局部微分同胚，特别地，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\in\\Phi_t^0(K)$</span> 存在唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in K$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0(x_t)=x_{t-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong></p>\n<p>第一步：写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 的 Jacobian。由命题 3 第一步的显式表达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0(x)=c_t x+d_t\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\Phi_t^0}{\\partial x}=c_t I+d_t\\frac{\\partial\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\partial x}.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}&gt;\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步：估计 Jacobian 的最小奇异值。对任意单位向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\frac{\\partial\\Phi_t^0}{\\partial x}v\\right\\|\\ge c_t-\\|d_t\\|\\cdot\\left\\|\\frac{\\partial\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\partial x}\\right\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}.$$</div>\n由假设，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge c_t-d_t\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-c_t}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-c_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 并化简，得右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>。故 Jacobian 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上非奇异。</p>\n<p>第三步：由反函数定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的每一点为局部微分同胚；由第二步的一致下界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的紧性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 上单射（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t^0(x)=\\Phi_t^0(y)$</span>，沿线段积分 Jacobian 的下界给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x-y\\|\\le 0$</span>），故反解存在唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义是：隐式采样（第 11 节）所需的“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>”不是无条件成立的，它要求网络 Jacobian 的算子范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的比值控制。该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 小）时更宽松，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 接近 1）时更严格。本节只登记该条件，不讨论其在实际网络中的满足程度（那属于第 11 节与第 8 节的数值讨论）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-eta-对单步方差的一阶影响\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对单步方差的一阶影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-eta-对单步方差的一阶影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节反例需要“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 偏离 0 时分布如何偏移”的定量入口。本节给出一个只涉及单步二阶矩的恒等式，它不构成分布偏移的证明，但给出可检验的代数关系，供第 10 节引用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（单步二阶矩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖）</strong> 在 (A1)—(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>。则 canonical 更新给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件二阶矩为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,x_t\\big]=\\big\\|\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\big\\|^2+d\\,\\sigma_t^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为状态维数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处取值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 canonical 更新式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=m_t+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为常数。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2=\\|m_t\\|^2+2\\sigma_t\\langle m_t,\\mathbb{E}\\varepsilon\\rangle+\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\varepsilon=0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2=d$</span>，得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对单步二阶矩的单调性）</strong> 在命题 6 的假设下，若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 变化（即网络输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 无关），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\mid x_t]$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\,\\big|\\,x_t\\big]=d-\\frac{\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2&lt;d(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 时该导数正，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2&gt;d(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 时该导数负。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 6 的恒等式关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 求导。第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|m_t\\|^2$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}}$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\sigma_t^2}\\|m_t\\|^2=-\\frac{\\langle m_t,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}}.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 代入并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的代数关系化简，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span>（关键化简：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\hat x_0,\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 项合并后恰为该式）。加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增大）时，单步二阶矩可能增也可能减，方向由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 的比较决定。这给出第 10 节反例的一个可检验入口：若在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，则增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 会降低单步二阶矩，导致轨迹向原点收缩，从而偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的轨迹。本节只给出该代数关系，不构造具体反例（反例在第 10 节集中处理）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df16--h-10-推导链的完备性检查\">10. 推导链的完备性检查<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df16--h-10-推导链的完备性检查\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节四个主命题（命题 1—4）与两个推论（推论 1—2）覆盖了 canonical 断言的全部代数内容。逐项核对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0\\Rightarrow$</span> 确定性 DDIM：命题 1 给出更新式的退化，命题 3 给出与 PF-ODE 的一阶相容，命题 4 给出轨迹级误差界。三项合起来构成“确定性”的完整数学内容：映射确定（命题 1）、与连续流相容（命题 3）、误差可累积估计（命题 4）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow$</span> DDPM：推论 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 DDPM 方差形式的精确相等。此处只断言方差形式相等，不断言分布相等（分布相等需要前向族与反向核的联合一致性，那属于第 9 节“与 DDPM 的关系”，本节不越界）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span> 的插值：canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式承载插值，命题 2 保证其合法范围，推论 2 给出单步二阶矩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖。分布层面的插值性质不在本节证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>完备性检查的结论：本节没有留下“在适当条件下”的悬空陈述；每个命题的假设均可回溯到 (A1)—(A5) 中的具体条目，每个证明的关键等式均逐步写出，每个推论均有可检验的代数形式（代码节已逐点断言命题 1、2、推论 1；命题 4、5、6 的断言可在同一代码框架下追加，本节不重复代码）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把“非马尔可夫的确定性”拆成四个可逐项验证的命题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 的代数退化（命题 1）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 的合法范围（命题 2）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 与 PF-ODE 的一阶相容（命题 3）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1$</span> 的方差匹配（推论 1）；每个命题的假设均显式登记于 (A1)—(A5)，证明只使用代数恒等式与已证的速度场表达，未引入新对象。</li>\n<li>推导链的闭合点是命题 3：它把“DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 是 PF-ODE 的离散化”从类比提升为带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau^2)$</span> 误差界的一阶相容陈述；同时明确该陈述是渐近的，有限步长下的偏差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta\\tau)$</span> 项承载，这正是第 7 节“步数与质量”要量化的对象，本节不越界展开。</li>\n<li>canonical 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0\\Rightarrow$</span> 确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow$</span> DDPM 在本节获得代数内容：前者由命题 1 给出，后者由推论 1 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span> 的插值性质只由 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 公式承载，其分布偏移风险不在本节证明，留待第 10 节反例集中处理。</li>\n<li>本节在已有四命题基础上补足了轨迹级误差累积（命题 4）、确定性映射的局部可逆性（命题 5）与单步二阶矩的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 依赖（命题 6），三者分别对接第 7 节“步数与质量”、第 11 节“隐式采样”与第 10 节反例，接口处只登记条件与代数关系，不越界展开后续节的内容。</li>\n<li>命题 4 把命题 3 的单步相容提升为轨迹级误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum L^{T-s}e_s$</span>，显式暴露了 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 与步数的竞争关系；命题 5 给出隐式采样反解存在的充分条件（网络 Jacobian 算子范数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 比值控制）；命题 6 与推论 2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 对单步二阶矩的一阶影响，其符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 的比较决定。</li>\n<li>完备性检查确认：canonical 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0\\Rightarrow$</span> 确定性 DDIM、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=1\\Rightarrow$</span> DDPM 在本节获得代数内容且无悬空条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\in(0,1)$</span> 的分布偏移风险只由推论 2 的代数入口承载，完整反例构造留待第 10 节。</li>\n</ol>", "cjk": 58831, "missing": []};
